    {
      "index": 4,
      "subject": "Constitutional Law",
      "chapter": "Individual Rights",
      "topic": "Significant state involvement",
      "count": 120,
      "question": "A city owns and operates a large public auditorium. It leases the auditorium to any group that wishes to use it for a meeting, lecture, concert, or contest. Each user must post a damage deposit and pay rent, which is calculated only for the actual time the building is used by the lessee. Reservations are made on a first-come, first-served basis.\nA private organization that permits only males to serve in its highest offices rented the auditorium for its national convention. The organization planned to install its new officers at that convention. It broadly publicized the event, inviting members of the general public to attend the installation ceremony at the city auditorium. No statute or administrative rule prohibits the organization from restricting its highest offices to men.\nAn appropriate plaintiff sues the private organization seeking to enjoin it from using the city auditorium for the installation of its new officers. The sole claim of the plaintiff is that the use of this auditorium by the organization for the installation ceremony violates the Fourteenth Amendment because the organization disqualifies women from serving in its highest offices.\nWill the plaintiff prevail?",
      "choices": {
        "A": "No, because the freedom of association protected by the Fourteenth Amendment prohibits the city from interfering in any way with the organization's use of city facilities.",
        "B": "No, because this organization is not a state actor and, therefore, its activities are not subject to the provisions of the Fourteenth Amendment.",
        "C": "Yes, because the Fourteenth Amendment prohibits such an organization from discriminating against women in any of its activities to which it has invited members of the general public.",
        "D": "Yes, because the organization's use of the city auditorium for this purpose subjects its conduct to the provisions of the Fourteenth Amendment."
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "source_img": "source_imgs/q0004.png",
      "explanation": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n  <title>Explanation</title>\n  <style>\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      font-size: 1rem;\n      line-height: 1.7;\n      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n      color: #222;\n      background: #fff;\n    }\n    .pbx-explanation {\n      padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n      max-width: 100%;\n      overflow-wrap: break-word;\n      word-break: break-word;\n    }\n    .pbx-explanation h2,\n    .pbx-explanation h3,\n    .pbx-explanation p {\n      margin: 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-top-explanation {\n      font-size: 1rem;\n      margin-bottom: 1.1rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-diagram-card {\n      border: 1px solid #d8d8d8;\n      border-radius: 0.8rem;\n      box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\n      padding: 1.1rem 1.1rem 1rem;\n      margin: 0 auto 1.2rem;\n      background: #fff;\n    }\n    .pbx-diagram-title {\n      text-align: center;\n      font-size: 1.05rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-diagram-subtitle {\n      text-align: center;\n      font-size: 0.98rem;\n      margin-bottom: 0.7rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-row {\n      display: flex;\n      gap: 1rem;\n      align-items: stretch;\n    }\n    .pbx-panel {\n      flex: 1;\n      border: 1px solid #e4e4e4;\n      border-radius: 0.65rem;\n      padding: 0.9rem;\n      background: #fff;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      justify-content: center;\n      min-height: 13rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-panel-title {\n      text-align: center;\n      font-size: 0.95rem;\n      margin-bottom: 0.45rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-vote-box {\n      width: 7rem;\n      height: 8rem;\n      background: #4d5f95;\n      border-radius: 0.2rem;\n      margin: 1.6rem auto 0;\n      position: relative;\n    }\n    .pbx-vote-box:before {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      top: -0.55rem;\n      left: 0;\n      right: 0;\n      height: 0.8rem;\n      background: #40507c;\n      border-radius: 0.2rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-vote-label {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 0;\n      right: 0;\n      top: 2.7rem;\n      text-align: center;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      font-size: 1.2rem;\n      color: #e25b51;\n      background: #fff;\n      padding: 0.2rem 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-hand {\n      width: 4.8rem;\n      height: 2.4rem;\n      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f1d4b2 0%, #d9b08c 55%, #f1dcc7 100%);\n      border-radius: 1.6rem 0.3rem 0.3rem 1.6rem;\n      transform: rotate(-25deg);\n      margin: 0.5rem auto -0.2rem 3.1rem;\n      position: relative;\n    }\n    .pbx-balloon {\n      width: 10.7rem;\n      height: 7.3rem;\n      border-radius: 0.5rem;\n      background: linear-gradient(#d9edf7, #bcd9ea);\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      position: relative;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n    .pbx-house {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 1.0rem;\n      right: 1.0rem;\n      bottom: 0.9rem;\n      height: 4.8rem;\n      background: linear-gradient(#ebe7df, #d8d1c4);\n      border: 1px solid #b8b0a3;\n    }\n    .pbx-roof {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 1.25rem;\n      top: 0.4rem;\n      width: 7.5rem;\n      height: 2.2rem;\n      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4d5565 50%, transparent 50%);\n      transform: skewX(-25deg);\n    }\n    .pbx-orb {\n      position: absolute;\n      right: -0.2rem;\n      top: 0.1rem;\n      width: 4.0rem;\n      height: 4.0rem;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      background: #8f8f8f;\n      color: #111;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      text-align: center;\n      font-size: 0.85rem;\n      line-height: 1.1;\n      box-shadow: inset -0.2rem -0.2rem 0.6rem rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\n    }\n    .pbx-section {\n      border: 1px solid #d8d8d8;\n      border-radius: 0.8rem;\n      box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\n      padding: 1rem 1rem 1.1rem;\n      margin-top: 1.2rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-section-title {\n      text-align: center;\n      font-size: 1rem;\n      margin-bottom: 1rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-three {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;\n      gap: 1rem;\n      align-items: start;\n    }\n    .pbx-handshake {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 5.2rem;\n      border-radius: 0.4rem;\n      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #1f6f93 0 48%, #28354f 48% 100%);\n      position: relative;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n    .pbx-handshake:before,\n    .pbx-handshake:after {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 1.6rem;\n      width: 4rem;\n      height: 1rem;\n      border-radius: 1rem;\n      background: #f0d0b0;\n    }\n    .pbx-handshake:before { left: 1rem; transform: rotate(15deg); }\n    .pbx-handshake:after { right: 1rem; transform: rotate(-15deg); }\n    .pbx-venn {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 6rem;\n      position: relative;\n      margin-top: 0.1rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-circle {\n      position: absolute;\n      width: 3.8rem;\n      height: 3.8rem;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      opacity: 0.78;\n    }\n    .pbx-circle.a { left: 0.1rem; top: 0.2rem; background: #74c0f5; }\n    .pbx-circle.b { right: 0.1rem; top: 0.2rem; background: #9dd08c; }\n    .pbx-circle.c { left: 1.95rem; top: 1.9rem; background: #f2a08f; }\n    .pbx-venn-label {\n      position: absolute;\n      font-size: 0.82rem;\n      font-weight: 400;\n    }\n    .pbx-ring {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 5.2rem;\n      position: relative;\n    }\n    .pbx-ring .ring1,\n    .pbx-ring .ring2 {\n      position: absolute;\n      width: 3.4rem;\n      height: 2.1rem;\n      border: 0.35rem solid #9a9a9a;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      transform: rotate(20deg);\n      top: 1rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-ring .ring1 { left: 0.1rem; border-color: #bdbdbd; background: #f6f6f6; }\n    .pbx-ring .ring2 { left: 1.8rem; border-color: #d0af59; background: #fff7d7; }\n    .pbx-choice-paragraphs p {\n      margin: 0.95rem 0;\n      font-size: 1rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-choice-paragraphs strong { font-weight: 700; }\n    .pbx-edu-objective {\n      background: #f0f7ff;\n      border-left: 4px solid #3498db;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      padding: 14px 18px;\n      margin: 24px 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-edu-objective-title {\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: #2980b9;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n    .pbx-references {\n      background: #fafafa;\n      border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      padding: 14px 18px;\n      margin: 20px 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-references-title {\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: #555;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n    .pbx-ref-list {\n      margin: 0;\n      padding-left: 18px;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      color: #555;\n      line-height: 1.7;\n    }\n    @media (max-width: 640px) {\n      body { font-size: 0.95rem; padding: 0.75rem; }\n      .pbx-explanation { padding: 0.875rem 1rem; }\n      .pbx-diagram-card, .pbx-section { padding: 0.85rem; }\n      .pbx-row, .pbx-three { grid-template-columns: 1fr; display: grid; }\n      .pbx-panel { min-height: unset; }\n      .pbx-diagram-title { font-size: 1rem; }\n      .pbx-section-title { font-size: 0.98rem; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<!-- pbx-topic: Significant state involvement -->\n<div class=\"pbx-explanation\">\n  <div class=\"pbx-diagram-card\">\n    <div class=\"pbx-diagram-title\">State-action doctrine</div>\n    <div class=\"pbx-diagram-subtitle\">Traditional government function</div>\n    <div class=\"pbx-row\">\n      <div class=\"pbx-panel\">\n        <div class=\"pbx-hand\"></div>\n        <div class=\"pbx-vote-box\"><div class=\"pbx-vote-label\">VOTE</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pbx-panel\">\n        <div class=\"pbx-balloon\">\n          <div class=\"pbx-house\"></div>\n          <div class=\"pbx-roof\"></div>\n          <div class=\"pbx-orb\">Eminent<br>domain</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pbx-section\">\n    <div class=\"pbx-section-title\">Significant government involvement</div>\n    <div class=\"pbx-three\">\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"pbx-handshake\"></div>\n        <div style=\"text-align:center;margin-top:0.7rem;\">Joint action</div>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"pbx-venn\">\n          <div class=\"pbx-circle a\"></div>\n          <div class=\"pbx-circle b\"></div>\n          <div class=\"pbx-circle c\"></div>\n          <div class=\"pbx-venn-label\" style=\"left:1.0rem;top:0.7rem;\">Hiring</div>\n          <div class=\"pbx-venn-label\" style=\"right:1.05rem;top:0.7rem;\">Mgmt.</div>\n          <div class=\"pbx-venn-label\" style=\"left:2.23rem;top:2.45rem;\">Gov’t</div>\n          <div class=\"pbx-venn-label\" style=\"left:2.0rem;top:5.05rem;\">Funding</div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"text-align:center;margin-top:0.35rem;\">Nexus</div>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"pbx-ring\">\n          <div class=\"ring1\"></div>\n          <div class=\"ring2\"></div>\n          <div style=\"position:absolute;left:1.55rem;top:0.35rem;transform:rotate(-22deg);\">Private</div>\n          <div style=\"position:absolute;left:1.8rem;top:2.7rem;transform:rotate(18deg);\">Government</div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"text-align:center;margin-top:0.55rem;\">Entwinement</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pbx-choice-paragraphs\" style=\"margin-top:1.2rem;\">\n    <p>The Constitution (except the Thirteenth Amendment) applies to government actors. But under the <strong>state-action doctrine</strong>, a private actor is treated as a government actor—and similarly bound by the Constitution—when (1) the private actor performs a <strong>traditional and exclusive government function</strong> or (2) the government is <strong>significantly involved</strong> in the private actor's activities. Significant involvement exists when the government:</p>\n\n    <p>• has a <strong>mutually beneficial relationship</strong> with the private actor (eg, joint venture)</p>\n    <p>• creates a <strong>nexus</strong> by affirmatively facilitating or authorizing private action (eg, through a police officer acting under color of law) or</p>\n    <p>• is pervasively <strong>intertwined</strong> in the private actor's management or control.</p>\n\n    <p>Here, the private organization is not performing a traditional and exclusive government function because private groups have historically used city auditoriums for conventions <strong>(Choice D)</strong>. And merely leasing the auditorium does not affirmatively facilitate the organization's actions or entwine the city in the organization's management. Nor does it create a mutually beneficial relationship since the city provides uniform access to any group at the same rate on a first-come, first-served basis. Therefore, the organization is not a state actor subject to the Fourteenth Amendment.</p>\n\n    <p data-choice=\"A\" data-choice-role=\"distractor\"><strong>(Choice A)</strong> The First Amendment—applicable to states and municipalities through the Fourteenth Amendment—prohibits some (but not all) government interference with the <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">freedom of association</span>.</p>\n\n    <p data-choice=\"C\" data-choice-role=\"distractor\"><strong>(Choice C)</strong> The fact that the private organization invited members of the general public to its activities does not make it a government actor subject to the Fourteenth Amendment <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">equal protection clause</span>.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"pbx-edu-objective\">\n      <div class=\"pbx-edu-objective-title\">📌 Educational Objective</div>\n      <p>Under the state-action doctrine, private actors are considered government actors and bound by the Constitution when (1) they perform a traditional government function or (2) the government is significantly involved in their activities—eg, more than providing access to government services or facilities.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"pbx-references\">\n      <div class=\"pbx-references-title\">📚 References</div>\n      <ul class=\"pbx-ref-list\">\n        <li>Gilmore v. Montgomery, 417 U.S. 556, 574 (1974) (explaining that the mere private use of government facilities does not constitute significant state involvement under the state-action doctrine).</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "zh-question": "一个城市拥有并经营一个大型公共礼堂。该市将礼堂出租给任何希望用其举办会议、讲座、音乐会或比赛的团体。每个使用者必须支付损坏押金并支付租金，租金仅按承租人实际使用建筑物的时间计算。预订遵循先到先得的原则。\n\n一个只允许男性担任其最高职位的私人组织租用了该礼堂以举办其全国代表大会。该组织计划在大会上任命其新任官员。该组织广泛宣传了此次活动，邀请公众参加在市立礼堂举行的任命仪式。没有任何法规或行政规定禁止该组织将其最高职位限制于男性。\n\n一位适当的原告起诉该私人组织，寻求禁止令，以阻止其使用市立礼堂举行新任官员的任命仪式。原告的唯一主张是，该组织使用此礼堂举行任命仪式违反了 Fourteenth Amendment，因为该组织取消了女性担任其最高职位的资格。\n\n原告会胜诉吗？",
      "zh-choices": {
        "A": "不会，因为 Fourteenth Amendment 所保护的结社自由禁止市政府以任何方式干涉该组织对城市设施的使用。",
        "B": "不会，因为该组织不是一个州行为体（state actor），因此其活动不受 Fourteenth Amendment 条款的约束。",
        "C": "会，因为 Fourteenth Amendment 禁止此类组织在任何已邀请公众参加的活动中歧视女性。",
        "D": "会，因为该组织为此目的使用市立礼堂使其行为受到 Fourteenth Amendment 条款的约束。"
      },
      "zh-explanation": "<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\r\n<head>\r\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\r\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\r\n    <title>MBE Question Analysis</title>\r\n    \r\n    <style>\r\n        strong, b {\r\n            display: inline !important; \r\n            white-space: normal !important; \r\n            word-break: normal !important;\n            overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\r\n        }\r\n    </style>\r\n\r\n<style>\r\n        :root {\r\n            --primary-color: #2c3e50;\r\n            --accent-color: #3498db;\r\n            --success-color: #27ae60;\r\n            --warning-color: #e67e22;\r\n            --bg-color: #f4f6f7;\r\n            --card-bg: #ffffff;\r\n            --text-color: #333333;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        body {\r\n            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\r\n            background-color: var(--bg-color);\r\n            color: var(--text-color);\r\n            margin: 0;\r\n            padding: 20px;\r\n            display: flex;\r\n            justify-content: center;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .container {\r\n            width: 100%;\r\n            max-width: 480px; /* 适配手机逻辑宽度 */\r\n            background-color: var(--card-bg);\r\n            border-radius: 12px;\r\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\r\n            overflow: hidden;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .header {\r\n            background-color: var(--primary-color);\r\n            color: white;\r\n            padding: 20px;\r\n            text-align: center;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .header h1 {\r\n            margin: 0;\r\n            font-size: 1.2rem;\r\n            font-weight: 600;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .header .subtitle {\r\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\r\n            opacity: 0.9;\r\n            margin-top: 5px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .content {\r\n            padding: 20px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .concept-card {\r\n            background-color: #eef7fc;\r\n            border-left: 5px solid var(--accent-color);\r\n            padding: 15px;\r\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\r\n            border-radius: 4px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .concept-title {\r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n            color: var(--primary-color);\r\n            margin-bottom: 8px;\r\n            display: block;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .analysis-section {\r\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .analysis-title {\r\n            font-size: 1.1rem;\r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n            border-bottom: 2px solid #eee;\r\n            padding-bottom: 8px;\r\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\r\n            color: var(--primary-color);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .highlight {\r\n            background-color: #fff3cd;\r\n            padding: 2px 4px;\r\n            border-radius: 3px;\r\n            font-weight: 500;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .english-term {\r\n            font-style: italic;\r\n            color: #7f8c8d;\r\n            font-size: 0.9em;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .option-analysis {\r\n            margin-top: 15px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .option {\r\n            display: flex;\r\n            align-items: flex-start;\r\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\r\n            padding: 10px;\r\n            border-radius: 6px;\r\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .option.correct {\r\n            background-color: #e8f8f5;\r\n            border-color: var(--success-color);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .option.wrong {\r\n            background-color: #fdf2e9;\r\n            border-color: var(--warning-color);\r\n            opacity: 0.8;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .badge {\r\n            display: inline-block;\r\n            padding: 2px 8px;\r\n            border-radius: 12px;\r\n            font-size: 0.75rem;\r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n            margin-right: 10px;\r\n            flex-shrink: 0;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .badge-correct {\r\n            background-color: var(--success-color);\r\n            color: white;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .badge-wrong {\r\n            background-color: var(--warning-color);\r\n            color: white;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .exam-tip {\r\n            background-color: #2c3e50;\r\n            color: white;\r\n            padding: 15px;\r\n            border-radius: 8px;\r\n            margin-top: 20px;\r\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .exam-tip strong {\r\n            color: #f1c40f;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        ul {\r\n            padding-left: 20px;\r\n            margin: 8px 0;\r\n        }\r\n    </style>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n    <div class=\"header\">\r\n        <h1>MBE 考题解析</h1>\r\n        <div class=\"subtitle\">Constitutional Law: State Action</div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"content\">\r\n        <!-- 核心考点 -->\r\n        <div class=\"concept-card\">\r\n            <span class=\"concept-title\">⚖️ 核心考点：州行为原则 (State Action Doctrine)</span>\r\n            <p>美国宪法第十四修正案 (14th Amendment) 仅限制<b>政府行为</b>，不限制私人行为。除非存在例外情况，私人组织的歧视行为并不违反宪法。</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 案情分析 -->\r\n        <div class=\"analysis-section\">\r\n            <div class=\"analysis-title\">案情关键点分析</div>\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li><b>主体：</b>一个私人组织 (Private Organization)。</li>\r\n                <li><b>行为：</b>租用市政府拥有的礼堂举办活动，且该组织内部规定歧视女性。</li>\r\n                <li><b>政府角色：</b>市政府仅仅是房东，按“先到先得”原则出租，收取租金，没有参与组织的管理或决策。</li>\r\n            </ul>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 正确答案解析 -->\r\n        <div class=\"analysis-section\">\r\n            <div class=\"analysis-title\">为何选 B？</div>\r\n            <p>本题的关键在于判断该私人组织是否因为租用了公共设施而变成了<b>“州行为体” (State Actor)</b>。</p>\r\n            \r\n            <p>根据最高法院的判例（如 <i>Gilmore v. Montgomery</i>），仅仅使用公共设施并不足以构成“州行为”。要将私人行为转化为州行为，通常需要满足以下两个条件之一：</p>\r\n            \r\n            <ol>\r\n                <li><b>公共职能例外 (Public Function Exception)：</b>私人实体行使了传统上由政府<b>独占</b>的权力（如管理城镇、举行选举）。<br><span class=\"english-term\">→ 租礼堂开会显然不是政府独占的职能。</span></li>\r\n                <li><b>纠缠/参与例外 (Entanglement/Involvement Exception)：</b>政府在很大程度上授权、鼓励或从私人歧视中获利（如 <i>Burton v. Wilmington Parking Authority</i> 中的共生关系）。<br><span class=\"english-term\">→ 本案中，市政府只是中立地出租场地，没有“深度参与” (Significant Involvement)。</span></li>\r\n            </ol>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"option correct\">\r\n                <span class=\"badge badge-correct\">正确</span>\r\n                <div>\r\n                    <b>选项 B</b> 指出该组织不是州行为体，因此不受第十四修正案约束。这是原告败诉的根本原因。\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 错误选项辨析 -->\r\n        <div class=\"analysis-section\">\r\n            <div class=\"analysis-title\">干扰项排除</div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"option wrong\">\r\n                <span class=\"badge badge-wrong\">选项 D</span>\r\n                <div>\r\n                    <b>错误理由：</b>仅仅“使用” (Use) 城市礼堂并不足以建立州行为。如果只要用了水电或走了公路就受宪法约束，那宪法将无限扩大。\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"option wrong\">\r\n                <span class=\"badge badge-wrong\">选项 C</span>\r\n                <div>\r\n                    <b>错误理由：</b>“邀请公众” (Inviting the public) 并不使私人俱乐部变成政府。虽然民权法案 (Civil Rights Acts) 可能通过立法禁止公共场所歧视，但本题问的是<b>宪法第十四修正案</b>，而宪法本身不直接约束此类私人行为。\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 考试技巧 -->\r\n        <div class=\"exam-tip\">\r\n            <strong>🎓 MBE 考试技巧</strong>\r\n            <br><br>\r\n            遇到“私人歧视”被起诉违反“宪法”的题目时，首先问自己：<b>“这是政府在歧视吗？”</b>\r\n            <br><br>\r\n            如果被告是私人：\r\n            1. 除非它是<b>“公司市镇” (Company Town)</b>；\r\n            2. 或者政府与它有<b>“共生关系” (Symbiotic Relationship)</b>（如利润分成）；\r\n            <br>\r\n            否则，宪法管不着它！直接选“No, because not a state actor”。\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n</html>",
