    {
      "index": 10,
      "subject": "Constitutional Law",
      "chapter": "Individual Rights",
      "topic": "Regulation of Content",
      "count": 120,
      "question": "Congress enacted a statute that made it illegal for \"any employee, without the consent of his or her employer, to post on the Internet any information concerning the employer.\" The purpose of the statute was to prevent employees from revealing their employers' trade secrets.\nIs the statute constitutional?",
      "choices": {
        "A": "No, because it is not narrowly tailored to further a compelling government interest.",
        "B": "No, because it targets a particular medium of communication for special regulation.",
        "C": "Yes, because it leaves open ample alternative channels of communication.",
        "D": "Yes, because it prevents employees from engaging in unethical conduct."
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "source_img": "source_imgs/q0010.png",
      "explanation": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n<title>Free speech analysis</title>\n<style>\n  body { margin: 0; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.7; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; background: #fff; color: #222; }\n  .pbx-explanation { padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem; max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; box-sizing: border-box; }\n  .pbx-explanation * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  .pbx-flow-wrap { margin: 0.5rem 0 1.25rem; }\n  .pbx-flow-inner { min-width: 760px; position: relative; padding: 0.5rem 0 0.75rem; }\n  .pbx-flow-title {\n    width: 18rem; margin: 0 auto 2.25rem; text-align: center; font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 700;\n    background: #f8f9fb; border-radius: 0.75rem; padding: 0.55em 1em; box-shadow: 0 0.2rem 0.55rem rgba(0,0,0,0.18);\n  }\n  .pbx-flow-line { position: relative; height: 3.8rem; width: 100%; }\n  .pbx-flow-line:before {\n    content: \"\"; position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 0; bottom: 0; width: 2px; background: #333;\n  }\n  .pbx-flow-branch {\n    position: relative; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 2rem;\n    margin-top: 0.2rem;\n  }\n  .pbx-flow-branch:before {\n    content: \"\"; position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 0; height: 2px; width: 46%; transform: translateX(-50%);\n    background: #333;\n  }\n  .pbx-flow-card {\n    width: 46%; border-radius: 0.9rem; background: #f3f3f3; padding: 1em 1.25em; box-shadow: 0 0.16rem 0.5rem rgba(0,0,0,0.18);\n    font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.45;\n  }\n  .pbx-flow-card .pbx-card-title { font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.08rem; margin-bottom: 0.15em; }\n  .pbx-flow-card .pbx-card-sub { font-style: italic; color: #444; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 0.45em; }\n  .pbx-flow-card ul { margin: 0.35em 0 0 1.15em; padding: 0; }\n  .pbx-flow-card li { margin: 0.15em 0; }\n  .pbx-flow-card.left { margin-top: 0.8rem; }\n  .pbx-flow-card.right { margin-top: 0.8rem; }\n  .pbx-arrow-down { width: 2px; height: 2.2rem; background: #333; margin: 0 auto; position: relative; }\n  .pbx-arrow-down:after {\n    content:\"\"; position:absolute; left:50%; bottom:-0.05rem; transform:translateX(-50%) rotate(45deg);\n    width: 0.65rem; height: 0.65rem; border-right: 2px solid #333; border-bottom: 2px solid #333;\n  }\n  .pbx-explanation p { margin: 0 0 1.1em; }\n  .pbx-explanation strong { font-weight: 700; }\n  .pbx-explanation em { font-style: italic; }\n  .pbx-choice { margin-left: 0; }\n  .pbx-edu-objective { background: #f0f7ff; border-left: 4px solid #3498db; border-radius: 6px; padding: 14px 18px; margin: 24px 0; }\n  .pbx-edu-objective-title { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: #2980b9; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n  .pbx-references { background: #fafafa; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px; padding: 14px 18px; margin: 20px 0; }\n  .pbx-references-title { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: #555; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n  .pbx-ref-list { margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; font-size: 14px; color: #555; line-height: 1.7; }\n  .pbx-small { font-size: 0.95rem; }\n  @media (max-width: 640px) {\n    body { font-size: 0.95rem; padding: 0.75rem; }\n    .pbx-explanation { padding: 0.875rem 1rem; }\n    .pbx-flow-inner { min-width: 760px; }\n    .pbx-flow-title { font-size: 1.15rem; }\n    .pbx-flow-card { font-size: 0.95rem; }\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<!-- pbx-topic: Regulation of Content -->\n<div class=\"pbx-explanation\">\n  <div class=\"pbx-flow-wrap\">\n    <div class=\"pbx-flow-inner\">\n      <div class=\"pbx-flow-title\">Free speech analysis</div>\n      <div class=\"pbx-flow-line\"></div>\n      <div class=\"pbx-flow-branch\">\n        <div class=\"pbx-flow-card left\">\n          <div class=\"pbx-card-title\">Content-based restriction</div>\n          <div class=\"pbx-card-sub\">(message, subject, or idea)</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"pbx-flow-card right\">\n          <div class=\"pbx-card-title\">Content-neutral restriction</div>\n          <div class=\"pbx-card-sub\">(time, place, or manner)</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pbx-arrow-down\" style=\"margin-top:0.55rem;\"></div>\n      <div class=\"pbx-flow-branch\">\n        <div class=\"pbx-flow-card left\">\n          <div class=\"pbx-card-title\">Strict scrutiny</div>\n          <div class=\"pbx-card-sub\">(least restrictive means)</div>\n          <ul>\n            <li>Necessary &amp; narrowly tailored to compelling interest</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"pbx-flow-card right\">\n          <div class=\"pbx-card-title\">Intermediate scrutiny</div>\n          <div class=\"pbx-card-sub\">(no greater than necessary)</div>\n          <ul>\n            <li>Narrowly tailored to substantial interest</li>\n            <li>Alternative avenues of communication</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pbx-arrow-down\" style=\"margin-top:0.8rem;\"></div>\n      <div style=\"width: 18rem; margin: 0 auto; text-align:center; background:#f7f7f7; border-radius:0.85rem; padding:0.65em 1em; box-shadow:0 0.16rem 0.45rem rgba(0,0,0,0.16); font-size:1rem;\">\n        <div style=\"font-weight:700;\">Exception</div>\n        <div>(nonpublic forum + viewpoint-neutral)</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pbx-arrow-down\" style=\"margin-top:0.8rem; height:1.9rem;\"></div>\n      <div style=\"width: 16rem; margin: 0 auto; text-align:center; background:#f1f1f1; border-radius:0.85rem; padding:0.65em 1em; box-shadow:0 0.16rem 0.45rem rgba(0,0,0,0.16); font-size:1rem;\">\n        <div style=\"font-weight:700;\">Rational basis</div>\n        <div>Reasonably related to legitimate interest</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <p>The First Amendment <strong>free speech clause</strong> prohibits the government from unduly restricting an individual's right to freely communicate information and ideas. <strong>Restrictions based on the content of speech</strong> (ie, its message or ideas) are <strong>presumptively invalid</strong> and will only be upheld if they survive <strong>strict judicial scrutiny</strong>. Under this standard of review, the government has the nearly impossible task of proving that the restriction is <strong>necessary and narrowly tailored</strong> (ie, the least restrictive means) to further a <strong>compelling government interest</strong>.</p>\n\n  <p>Here, the statute targets speech based on its content since the statute prohibits employees from posting information concerning their employer. And though the government may have a compelling interest in preventing employees from revealing trade secrets, the statute is <strong>not necessary or narrowly tailored</strong> to further that interest. That is because less restrictive means could be used to protect trade secrets—eg, barring employees from posting information concerning their employers' trade secrets. As a result, the statute is unconstitutional.</p>\n\n  <p data-choice=\"B\" data-choice-role=\"distractor\" class=\"pbx-choice\" style=\"border-left:3px solid #c0392b; padding-left:10px;\"><strong style=\"color:#9b1c1c;\">(Choice B)</strong> A speech regulation does not violate the First Amendment simply because it targets a particular medium of communication (eg, Internet postings— as seen here).* </p>\n\n  <p class=\"pbx-small\"><em>*In <span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\">Packingham v. North Carolina</span>, the Supreme Court equated the Internet to public streets and parks in dicta but never expressly held that the Internet is a <span style=\"color:#2b7cff;\">public forum</span>. Several cases dealing with this issue are currently being litigated in lower courts.</em></p>\n\n  <p data-choice=\"C\" data-choice-role=\"distractor\" class=\"pbx-choice\" style=\"border-left:3px solid #c0392b; padding-left:10px;\"><strong style=\"color:#9b1c1c;\">(Choice C)</strong> The availability of alternative channels of communication is one factor in evaluating content-neutral speech restrictions (ie, time, place, or manner restrictions). But since this statute is a content-based restriction, the fact that it leaves open other channels of communication other than the Internet is irrelevant.</p>\n\n  <p data-choice=\"D\" data-choice-role=\"distractor\" class=\"pbx-choice\" style=\"border-left:3px solid #c0392b; padding-left:10px;\"><strong style=\"color:#9b1c1c;\">(Choice D)</strong> The statute may prevent employees from engaging in unethical conduct (eg, revealing trade secrets). But regardless, it is unconstitutional because it cannot survive strict scrutiny.</p>\n\n  <div class=\"pbx-edu-objective\">\n    <div class=\"pbx-edu-objective-title\">📌 Educational Objective</div>\n    <p>Content-based restrictions on speech are presumptively invalid and will only be upheld if they survive strict scrutiny—ie, the government must prove that the restriction is necessary and narrowly tailored to achieve a compelling government interest.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pbx-references\">\n    <div class=\"pbx-references-title\">📚 References</div>\n    <ul class=\"pbx-ref-list\">\n      <li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\">United States v. Playboy Entm't Grp., 529 U.S. 803, 816–17 (2000)</span> (explaining that content-based restrictions on speech require the government to satisfy strict scrutiny).</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "zh-question": "国会颁布了一项法规，规定“任何雇员，未经其雇主同意，在互联网上发布任何有关其雇主的信息”均属非法。该法规的目的是防止雇员泄露其雇主的商业秘密。\n\n该法规是否合宪？",
      "zh-choices": {
        "A": "不合宪，因为它并非为促进某一重大的政府利益而经过严格限缩。",
        "B": "不合宪，因为它针对某一特定的传播媒介进行特别管制。",
        "C": "合宪，因为它保留了充足的替代沟通渠道。",
        "D": "合宪，因为它阻止了雇员从事不道德的行为。"
      },
      "zh-explanation": "<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\r\n<head>\r\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\r\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\r\n\r\n    <style>\r\n        strong, b {\r\n            display: inline !important; \r\n            white-space: normal !important; \r\n            word-break: normal !important;\n            overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\r\n        }\r\n    </style>\r\n\r\n<style>\r\n    :root {\r\n        --primary-color: #2c3e50;\r\n        --accent-color: #3498db;\r\n        --highlight-bg: #e8f4f8;\r\n        --correct-bg: #d4edda;\r\n        --correct-text: #155724;\r\n        --wrong-bg: #f8d7da;\r\n        --wrong-text: #721c24;\r\n        --card-bg: #ffffff;\r\n        --text-color: #333333;\r\n    }\r\n    body {\r\n        font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\r\n        background-color: #f4f4f4;\r\n        margin: 0;\r\n        padding: 10px;\r\n        display: flex;\r\n        justify-content: center;\r\n        color: var(--text-color);\r\n        line-height: 1.6;\r\n    }\r\n    .container {\r\n        width: 100%;\r\n        max-width: 480px; /* 适配手机屏幕逻辑宽度 */\r\n        background-color: transparent;\r\n    }\r\n    .card {\r\n        background-color: var(--card-bg);\r\n        border-radius: 12px;\r\n        box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\r\n        padding: 20px;\r\n        margin-bottom: 20px;\r\n        border-left: 5px solid var(--accent-color);\r\n    }\r\n    .header {\r\n        background-color: var(--primary-color);\r\n        color: white;\r\n        padding: 15px;\r\n        border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0;\r\n        text-align: center;\r\n        margin-bottom: -10px; /* Connect to first card */\r\n        z-index: 1;\r\n        position: relative;\r\n    }\r\n    h2 {\r\n        margin: 0;\r\n        font-size: 1.2rem;\r\n    }\r\n    h3 {\r\n        color: var(--primary-color);\r\n        font-size: 1.1rem;\r\n        border-bottom: 2px solid var(--highlight-bg);\r\n        padding-bottom: 5px;\r\n        margin-top: 0;\r\n    }\r\n    .concept-box {\r\n        background-color: var(--highlight-bg);\r\n        padding: 10px;\r\n        border-radius: 8px;\r\n        margin: 10px 0;\r\n        font-size: 0.95rem;\r\n    }\r\n.term {\n        background: transparent;\n        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(36, 52, 71, 0.26);\n        padding: 0 1px 1px;\n        border-radius: 0;\n        font-size: 1em;\n        font-weight: 800;\n        white-space: normal;\n    }\r\n    .english {\r\n        font-style: italic;\r\n        color: #7f8c8d;\r\n        font-size: 0.9em;\r\n    }\r\n    .analysis-step {\r\n        display: flex;\r\n        align-items: flex-start;\r\n        margin-bottom: 10px;\r\n    }\r\n    .step-num {\r\n        background-color: var(--accent-color);\r\n        color: white;\r\n        width: 24px;\r\n        height: 24px;\r\n        border-radius: 50%;\r\n        text-align: center;\r\n        line-height: 24px;\r\n        margin-right: 10px;\r\n        flex-shrink: 0;\r\n        font-size: 0.8rem;\r\n        font-weight: bold;\r\n    }\r\n    .correct-answer {\r\n        background-color: var(--correct-bg);\r\n        color: var(--correct-text);\r\n        padding: 15px;\r\n        border-radius: 8px;\r\n        margin-top: 15px;\r\n        border: 1px solid #c3e6cb;\r\n    }\r\n    .wrong-option {\r\n        font-size: 0.9rem;\r\n        margin-top: 8px;\r\n        padding: 8px;\r\n        background-color: #f9f9f9;\r\n        border-left: 3px solid #ccc;\r\n    }\r\n    .tip-box {\r\n        background-color: #fff3cd;\r\n        color: #856404;\r\n        padding: 15px;\r\n        border-radius: 8px;\r\n        border: 1px solid #ffeeba;\r\n        margin-top: 20px;\r\n    }\r\n    .tip-title {\r\n        font-weight: bold;\r\n        display: block;\r\n        margin-bottom: 5px;\r\n    }\r\n</style>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n    <div class=\"header\">\r\n        <h2>MBE 考题解析</h2>\r\n        <div style=\"font-size: 0.8rem; opacity: 0.9;\">Constitutional Law / First Amendment</div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 核心考点卡片 -->\r\n    <div class=\"card\" style=\"border-radius: 0 0 12px 12px;\">\r\n        <h3>核心考点：严格审查标准</h3>\r\n        <div class=\"concept-box\">\r\n            <span class=\"term\">基于内容的限制 (Content-Based Restriction)</span><br>\r\n            如果政府对言论的限制是基于言论所传达的信息或主题，则该限制被推定为违宪。\r\n        </div>\r\n        <p>\r\n            对于此类限制，法院适用<b>严格审查标准 (Strict Scrutiny)</b>。政府必须证明该法律：\r\n        </p>\r\n        <ol>\r\n            <li>是为了实现<b>重大的政府利益</b> <span class=\"english\">(Compelling Government Interest)</span>；且</li>\r\n            <li>手段是<b>经过严格限缩的 / 必要的</b> <span class=\"english\">(Narrowly Tailored / Necessary)</span>。</li>\r\n        </ol>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 题目分析卡片 -->\r\n    <div class=\"card\">\r\n        <h3>本题逻辑链分析</h3>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"analysis-step\">\r\n            <div class=\"step-num\">1</div>\r\n            <div>\r\n                <strong>定性：</strong>法规禁止发布“有关其雇主的信息”。要判断某条言论是否违规，执法者必须查看言论的<b>内容</b>。因此，这是<b>基于内容的限制</b>。\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"analysis-step\">\r\n            <div class=\"step-num\">2</div>\r\n            <div>\r\n                <strong>定标：</strong>既然是基于内容的限制，必须适用<b>严格审查 (Strict Scrutiny)</b>。\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"analysis-step\">\r\n            <div class=\"step-num\">3</div>\r\n            <div>\r\n                <strong>应用：</strong>\r\n                <ul>\r\n                    <li><b>目的：</b>保护商业秘密 (Trade Secrets)。这可能是一个重大的政府利益。</li>\r\n                    <li><b>手段：</b>禁止发布“任何”关于雇主的信息。</li>\r\n                    <li><b>结论：</b>手段太宽泛了！它不仅禁止了商业秘密，还禁止了诸如“我老板今天穿了红衬衫”等无害言论。因此，它不是<b>Narrowly Tailored</b>。</li>\r\n                </ul>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"correct-answer\">\r\n            <strong>✅ 正确答案 A</strong><br>\r\n            法律违宪，因为它没有经过严格限缩 (Not narrowly tailored) 以促进重大的政府利益。它打击面过广，限制了受第一修正案保护的无害言论。\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 干扰项排除卡片 -->\r\n    <div class=\"card\">\r\n        <h3>为什么其他选项是错的？</h3>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"wrong-option\">\r\n            <strong>❌ 选项 B (媒介管制)：</strong>\r\n            针对特定媒介（如互联网）的管制本身并不自动违宪。关键在于该管制是否基于内容。如果法律只是说“禁止在互联网上发垃圾邮件”（不看内容），标准会不同。\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"wrong-option\">\r\n            <strong>❌ 选项 C (替代渠道)：</strong>\r\n            “充足的替代沟通渠道” <span class=\"english\">(Ample alternative channels)</span> 是<b>内容中立 (Content-Neutral)</b> 的“时间、地点、方式”限制 <span class=\"english\">(Time, Place, and Manner Restrictions)</span> 的审查要素。本题是基于内容的限制，不适用此标准。\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"wrong-option\">\r\n            <strong>❌ 选项 D (不道德行为)：</strong>\r\n            这是典型的“红鲱鱼”选项。即使政府意图良好（防止不道德行为），如果手段违反了宪法第一修正案的严格审查标准，该法律依然无效。\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 考试技巧卡片 -->\r\n    <div class=\"tip-box\">\r\n        <span class=\"tip-title\">💡 MBE 考试技巧 (Exam Tip)</span>\r\n        在处理言论自由 (Free Speech) 题目时，请遵循以下<b>两步法</b>：\r\n        <ol style=\"margin-left: -20px;\">\r\n            <li><b>第一步：</b>判断限制是<b>基于内容 (Content-Based)</b> 还是<b>内容中立 (Content-Neutral)</b>？\r\n                <br><small>👉 只要法律条文提到具体的话题（如“关于雇主”、“关于政治”），通常就是基于内容的。</small>\r\n            </li>\r\n            <li><b>第二步：</b>\r\n                <ul>\r\n                    <li>如果是<b>基于内容</b> -> 选 <b>Strict Scrutiny</b> (通常导致违宪)。</li>\r\n                    <li>如果是<b>内容中立</b> -> 选 <b>Intermediate Scrutiny</b> (看是否有替代渠道等)。</li>\r\n                </ul>\r\n            </li>\r\n        </ol>\r\n        本题中，一旦你识别出它是“基于内容”的，选项 A 中提到的 \"Narrowly Tailored\" 和 \"Compelling Interest\" 关键词就是最直接的线索。\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n</html>",
      "meta": {
        "question_analysis": {
          "micro_concept": "Content-based speech restriction strict scrutiny",
          "trap_type": "Overbroad General Rule",
