    {
      "index": 12,
      "subject": "Constitutional Law",
      "chapter": "Individual Rights",
      "topic": "Quasi-suspect classifications",
      "count": 120,
      "question": "A state enacted a statute that prohibited children born outside of marriage from receiving welfare benefits that the state provides to children who live in households below the federal poverty line. The purpose of the statute was to encourage individuals to get married before having children.\nA man and his unmarried partner had a daughter out of wedlock. Before the man and his partner married, the partner died. The man's annual household income was below the federal poverty line, so he applied for welfare benefits on the daughter's behalf. The state agency overseeing the program denied the application based on the state statute.\nThe man filed suit in a federal district court, alleging that the state statute violates the equal protection clause.\nWhich of the following best states the burden of persuasion in the suit?",
      "choices": {
        "A": "The agency must demonstrate that the state statute is substantially related to an important state interest.",
        "B": "The agency must demonstrate that the state statute is the least restrictive means to achieve a compelling state interest.",
        "C": "The man must demonstrate that the state statute is not substantially related to an important state interest.",
        "D": "The man must demonstrate that the state statute is not the least restrictive means to achieve a compelling state interest."
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "source_img": "source_imgs/q0012.png",
      "explanation": "<!doctype html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n  <title>Explanation</title>\n  <style>\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      font-size: 1rem;\n      line-height: 1.7;\n      background: #ffffff;\n      color: #111;\n      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    }\n    .pbx-explanation {\n      padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n      max-width: 100%;\n    }\n    .pbx-explanation, .pbx-explanation * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n    .pbx-explanation h1,\n    .pbx-explanation h2,\n    .pbx-explanation h3,\n    .pbx-explanation p,\n    .pbx-explanation ul {\n      margin-top: 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-explanation p {\n      margin-bottom: 1rem;\n      word-break: break-word;\n      overflow-wrap: break-word;\n    }\n    .pbx-title {\n      text-align: center;\n      font-size: 1.45rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      margin: 2rem 0 1.25rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-flow-wrap {\n      margin: 0 auto 1rem;\n      max-width: 100%;\n    }\n    .pbx-scroll-x {\n      overflow-x: auto;\n      -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\n      margin: 1rem 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-flow-inner {\n      min-width: 56rem;\n      padding: 0.5rem 0 0.75rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-flow {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 100%;\n      min-height: 28rem;\n      border: 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-axis-y {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 7%;\n      top: 2%;\n      bottom: 15%;\n      width: 0;\n      border-left: 2px solid #7a7a7a;\n    }\n    .pbx-axis-y:after {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      top: -0.35rem;\n      left: -0.35rem;\n      border-left: 0.35rem solid transparent;\n      border-right: 0.35rem solid transparent;\n      border-bottom: 0.6rem solid #7a7a7a;\n    }\n    .pbx-axis-x {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 7%;\n      right: 4%;\n      bottom: 12%;\n      height: 0;\n      border-top: 2px solid #7a7a7a;\n    }\n    .pbx-axis-x:after {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      right: -0.1rem;\n      top: -0.35rem;\n      border-top: 0.35rem solid transparent;\n      border-bottom: 0.35rem solid transparent;\n      border-left: 0.6rem solid #7a7a7a;\n    }\n    .pbx-y-label {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 3.2%;\n      top: 38%;\n      transform: rotate(-90deg);\n      transform-origin: left top;\n      font-size: 1.05rem;\n      color: #333;\n    }\n    .pbx-x-label {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 44%;\n      bottom: 6%;\n      font-size: 1.05rem;\n      color: #333;\n    }\n    .pbx-diag-title {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 6%;\n      left: 20%;\n      right: 10%;\n      text-align: center;\n      font-size: 1.5rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n    }\n    .pbx-bar {\n      position: absolute;\n      bottom: 12%;\n      width: 18%;\n      border-radius: 0;\n      padding: 1rem 1rem 1.25rem;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      justify-content: flex-start;\n      color: #111;\n      line-height: 1.15;\n      font-size: 1rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-bar .pbx-bar-title {\n      font-size: 1.1rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      text-align: center;\n      margin-bottom: 0.7rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-bar ul {\n      margin: 0;\n      padding-left: 1.1rem;\n      font-size: 0.98rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-bar li { margin: 0.2rem 0; }\n    .pbx-bar-blue {\n      left: 11%;\n      height: 28%;\n      background: #d8e5f4;\n    }\n    .pbx-bar-pink {\n      left: 32%;\n      height: 42%;\n      background: #f2d7dd;\n    }\n    .pbx-bar-pink2 {\n      left: 61%;\n      height: 57%;\n      background: #f1c9d2;\n    }\n    .pbx-legend {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 30%;\n      bottom: 2%;\n      font-size: 0.95rem;\n      color: #333;\n    }\n    .pbx-legend span {\n      display: inline-block;\n      margin-right: 2rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-swatch {\n      width: 1.05rem;\n      height: 1.05rem;\n      display: inline-block;\n      vertical-align: middle;\n      margin-right: 0.35rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-swatch-blue { background: #d8e5f4; }\n    .pbx-swatch-pink { background: #f2d7dd; }\n    .pbx-swatch-pink2 { background: #f1c9d2; }\n    .pbx-choice {\n      font-size: 1rem;\n      line-height: 1.55;\n    }\n    .pbx-choice strong { font-weight: 700; }\n    .pbx-edu-objective {\n      background: #f0f7ff;\n      border-left: 4px solid #3498db;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      padding: 14px 18px;\n      margin: 24px 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-edu-objective-title {\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: #2980b9;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n    .pbx-references {\n      background: #fafafa;\n      border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      padding: 14px 18px;\n      margin: 20px 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-references-title {\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: #555;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n    .pbx-ref-list {\n      margin: 0;\n      padding-left: 18px;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      color: #555;\n      line-height: 1.7;\n    }\n    @media (max-width: 640px) {\n      body { font-size: 0.95rem; padding: 0.75rem; }\n      .pbx-explanation { padding: 0.875rem 1rem; }\n      .pbx-title { font-size: 1.2rem; }\n      .pbx-flow-inner { min-width: 52rem; }\n      .pbx-diag-title { font-size: 1.25rem; }\n      .pbx-y-label, .pbx-x-label { font-size: 0.95rem; }\n      .pbx-bar { font-size: 0.92rem; }\n      .pbx-bar ul { font-size: 0.9rem; }\n      .pbx-ref-list { font-size: 0.825rem; }\n      .pbx-references-title, .pbx-edu-objective-title { font-size: 13px; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <!-- pbx-topic: Quasi-suspect classifications -->\n  <div class=\"pbx-explanation\">\n    <div class=\"pbx-flow-wrap pbx-scroll-x\">\n      <div class=\"pbx-flow-inner\">\n        <div class=\"pbx-flow\">\n          <div class=\"pbx-diag-title\">Levels of scrutiny under equal protection clause</div>\n          <div class=\"pbx-axis-y\"></div>\n          <div class=\"pbx-axis-x\"></div>\n          <div class=\"pbx-y-label\">Severity of burden</div>\n          <div class=\"pbx-x-label\">Type of scrutiny</div>\n\n          <div class=\"pbx-bar pbx-bar-blue\">\n            <div class=\"pbx-bar-title\">Rational basis</div>\n            <ul>\n              <li>no rational</li>\n              <li>relation to</li>\n              <li>legitimate</li>\n              <li>state interest</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"pbx-bar pbx-bar-pink\">\n            <div class=\"pbx-bar-title\">Intermediate</div>\n            <ul>\n              <li>substantial</li>\n              <li>relation to</li>\n              <li>important</li>\n              <li>state interest</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"pbx-bar pbx-bar-pink2\">\n            <div class=\"pbx-bar-title\">Strict</div>\n            <ul>\n              <li>necessary to</li>\n              <li>achieve</li>\n              <li>compelling</li>\n              <li>state interest</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"pbx-legend\">\n            <span><i class=\"pbx-swatch pbx-swatch-blue\"></i>= challenger's burden</span>\n            <span><i class=\"pbx-swatch pbx-swatch-pink\"></i>= state's burden</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <p>A state law that discriminates against similarly situated persons can be challenged under the Fourteenth Amendment <strong>equal protection clause</strong>. The standard under which a court will review this challenge depends on the alleged discrimination. A law that discriminates against a <span style=\"color:#1d6fd6;\">quasi-suspect class</span> (eg, nonmarital birth) must satisfy <strong>intermediate scrutiny</strong>. This imposes a difficult <strong>burden on the state</strong> to prove that the law is <strong>substantially related to an important state interest</strong>.</p>\n\n    <p>Here, a state statute prohibits children born outside of marriage from receiving welfare benefits that the state provides to children who live in households below the federal poverty line. Since this statute discriminates against nonmarital children, the state agency overseeing the welfare program (not the man) has the burden to satisfy intermediate scrutiny <strong>(Choice C)</strong>. Therefore, the agency must demonstrate that the state statute is substantially related to an important state interest.</p>\n\n    <p><strong>(Choices B &amp; D)</strong> Strict scrutiny applies when a state law discriminates against a <span style=\"color:#1d6fd6;\">suspect class</span> or substantially impacts a <span style=\"color:#1d6fd6;\">fundamental right</span>. This highest level of scrutiny places the burden on the state (not the challenger) to prove that the law is the least restrictive means to achieve a compelling state interest. But since the state statute here discriminates against a quasi-suspect class, intermediate scrutiny applies.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"pbx-edu-objective\">\n      <div class=\"pbx-edu-objective-title\">📌 Educational Objective</div>\n      <p>A state law that discriminates against a quasi-suspect class (eg, nonmarital birth) must satisfy intermediate scrutiny, which imposes the burden on the state to prove that the law is substantially related to an important state interest</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"pbx-references\">\n      <div class=\"pbx-references-title\">📚 References</div>\n      <ul class=\"pbx-ref-list\">\n        <li>U.S. Const. amend. XIV (equal protection clause).</li>\n        <li>Clark v. Jeter, 486 U.S. 456, 461 (1988) (holding that a law discriminating against nonmarital children is subject to intermediate scrutiny).</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "zh-question": "一个州颁布了一项法规，禁止婚外子女获得该州向生活在联邦贫困线以下家庭的儿童提供的福利金。该法规的目的是鼓励个人在生育子女前结婚。\n一名男子和他的未婚伴侣育有一名婚外女儿。在该男子和他的伴侣结婚前，该伴侣去世了。该男子家庭年收入低于联邦贫困线，因此他代表女儿申请福利金。负责该项目的州机构依据该州法规拒绝了该申请。\n该男子向联邦地区法院提起诉讼，声称该州法规违反了平等保护条款（equal protection clause）。\n以下哪项最能说明该诉讼中的说服责任（burden of persuasion）？",
      "zh-choices": {
        "A": "该机构必须证明该州法规与一项重要的州利益（important state interest）有实质性关联（substantially related）。",
        "B": "该机构必须证明该州法规是实现一项紧迫的州利益（compelling state interest）的限制最少的手段（least restrictive means）。",
        "C": "该男子必须证明该州法规与一项重要的州利益没有实质性关联。",
        "D": "该男子必须证明该州法规不是实现一项紧迫的州利益的限制最少的手段。"
      },
      "zh-explanation": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head><style>\n:root{--primary-color:#2c3e50;--accent-color:#3498db;--highlight-bg:#e8f4f8;--correct-bg:#d4edda;--correct-text:#155724;--wrong-bg:#f8d7da;--wrong-text:#721c24;--text-color:#333;--bg-color:#f4f7f6;--card-bg:#ffffff;--border-radius:8px}\nstrong,b{display:inline!important;white-space:normal!important;word-break:normal!important;overflow-wrap:break-word!important}\nbody{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.6;color:var(--text-color);background-color:var(--bg-color);margin:0;padding:20px;display:flex;justify-content:center;font-size:14px}\n.container{max-width:480px;width:100%;background:transparent}\n/* Header variants */\n.header,.card-header,.header-card{background:var(--primary-color);color:#fff;padding:15px;text-align:center;border-radius:var(--border-radius);margin-bottom:20px;box-shadow:0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.2)}\n.header h1,.card-header h1,.header-card h1{margin:0;font-size:20px;font-weight:600}\n.header p,.header .sub-title,.card-header p,.card-header .sub-title,.header-card p,.header-card .sub-title{margin:5px 0 0;font-size:14px;opacity:.9}\n.header + .card,.card-header + .card,.header-card + .card{margin-top:0}\n.header-title{font-size:20px;font-weight:600;margin:0}\n.header-subtitle{font-size:14px;opacity:.9;margin:5px 0 0}\n/* Content */\n.content,.content-section{padding:20px}\n/* Section headings — unified 1rem */\nh3{color:var(--primary-color);font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:20px;margin-bottom:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;padding-bottom:5px}\n.section-title{color:var(--primary-color);font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:20px;margin-bottom:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;padding-bottom:5px}\n/* Core concept / rule box */\n.concept-box,.rule-box{background-color:var(--highlight-bg);padding:10px;border-radius:4px;margin:10px 0;font-size:.95rem}\n.concept-box h2,.concept-box h3,.concept-box h4{color:var(--accent-color);margin-top:0;font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;border:none!important;padding-bottom:0!important;margin-bottom:8px}\n.rule-title{font-weight:bold;color:var(--primary-color);margin-bottom:8px;display:block}\n/* Concept cards */\n.concept-card{border:1px solid #eee;border-radius:8px;padding:15px;margin-bottom:15px}\n.concept-card h3{margin-top:0;font-size:1rem;color:var(--accent-color);border-bottom:1px solid #eee;padding-bottom:8px;margin-bottom:10px}\n/* Comparison table — solid borders, border-collapse */\n.comparison-table{margin:15px 0}\n.comparison-table h3,.comparison-table h4{color:var(--primary-color);font-size:.95rem;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:8px;border:none!important;padding-bottom:0!important}\ntable.comparison-table,.comparison-table table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:.9em}\ntable.comparison-table th,table.comparison-table td,.comparison-table table th,.comparison-table table td{border:1px solid #ddd;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left}\ntable.comparison-table th,.comparison-table table th{background-color:#f8f9fa;font-weight:bold;color:var(--primary-color)}\n/* Diagram */\n.diagram{background-color:#f9f9f9;border:1px solid #e0e0e0;padding:15px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:20px;text-align:center}\n.diagram h3{margin-top:0;border:none!important;padding-bottom:0!important;font-size:.95rem}\n.flow-container{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:10px}\n.flow-node{background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd;padding:10px 15px;border-radius:6px;font-size:.9em;max-width:90%;text-align:center}\n.flow-node.active{border-color:var(--accent-color);box-shadow:0 0 0 2px rgba(52,152,219,.3)}\n.flow-node.highlight-node{background-color:var(--correct-bg);border-color:var(--correct-text);color:var(--correct-text)}\n.arrow{font-size:1.2em;color:#aaa;line-height:1}\n/* Analysis steps — step-number floats left; step-content fills rest via BFC */\n.analysis-step{display:block;margin-bottom:14px;overflow:hidden}\n.step-number,.step-label{float:left;clear:left;background:var(--primary-color);color:#fff;width:24px;height:24px;min-width:24px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:bold;margin-right:10px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:1px}\n.step-content{overflow:hidden;font-size:.95em}\n/* Answer box */\n.answer-box{background-color:#e8f5e9;border-left:5px solid #4caf50;padding:15px;margin-bottom:20px;border-radius:4px}\n.answer-title{color:#2e7d32;font-weight:bold;display:block;margin-bottom:5px}\n/* Answer options */\n.option{padding:12px 15px;margin-bottom:10px;border-radius:8px;font-size:.9em;line-height:1.5}\n.option.correct,.option-item.correct{background-color:var(--correct-bg);color:var(--correct-text);border:1px solid #c3e6cb}\n.option.wrong{background-color:var(--wrong-bg);color:var(--wrong-text);border:1px solid #f5c6cb}\n.option-item{margin-bottom:12px;padding:10px;border-radius:6px;background-color:#f9f9f9;border:1px solid #eee;font-size:.9em}\n.option-label{font-weight:bold;display:inline-block;margin-right:5px}\n.correct-label{color:#27ae60}\n.wrong-label{color:#c0392b}\n/* Rule / trap alert */\n.rule-block,.trap-alert{background-color:#fff3cd;border:1px solid #ffeeba;color:#856404;padding:15px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:20px;font-size:.9em}\n.rule-block h4,.trap-alert h4{margin-top:0;color:#665000;font-size:.95em}\n/* Case reference box */\n.case-box{background-color:#e3f2fd;border:1px solid #bbdefb;border-radius:8px;padding:15px;margin-bottom:20px;font-size:.9em}\n.case-box h4,.case-title{color:#1565c0;font-weight:bold;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:8px;display:block;font-size:.95em}\n/* span.case-box — inline badge usage: compact padding, no line-height blowout */\nspan.case-box{display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;margin:0 4px;font-size:.85em;border-radius:4px;vertical-align:middle;background-color:#e3f2fd;border:1px solid #bbdefb;color:#1565c0;font-weight:500}\n/* Term highlight */\n.term {\n    background: transparent;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(36, 52, 71, 0.26);\n    padding: 0 1px 1px;\n    border-radius: 0;\n    font-size: 1em;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    white-space: normal;\n}\n.highlight{background-color:#fff3cd;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-weight:500}\n.key-concept{font-weight:bold;color:#e74c3c}\n/* Wrong options list */\n.wrong-options{background-color:#fafafa;padding:15px;border-radius:8px;font-size:.9em;color:#555;border:1px solid #eee}\n.wrong-options li{margin-bottom:8px}\n/* Exam tip — all variants → yellow left-bordered box */\n.footer-tip,.tip-box,.exam-tip{background:#fff8e1;border-left:5px solid #ffc107;padding:15px 20px;margin-top:20px;font-size:.9em;color:#6d4c41}\n.footer-tip{border-radius:0 0 12px 12px;margin-top:0}\n.footer{background:#fff8e1;border-left:5px solid #ffc107;padding:15px 20px;font-size:.9em;color:#6d4c41;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px}\n.tip-title,.exam-tip-title{font-weight:bold;color:#ff8f00;display:block;margin-bottom:8px}\n/* Misc */\ncode{background:#eee;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:4px;font-family:monospace;font-size:.9em}\nul,ol{padding-left:20px;margin:8px 0}\np{margin:8px 0}\n/* ── Aliases for legacy Gemini-generated class names ── */\n/* Card variants */\n.card{background:var(--card-bg);border-radius:var(--border-radius);box-shadow:0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.1);padding:20px;margin-bottom:20px;border-left:5px solid var(--accent-color)}\n.card.option.wrong{background:var(--card-bg);color:var(--wrong-text);border-left-color:#e74c3c;opacity:.95;font-size:.95rem}\n.card-title,.step-title{color:var(--primary-color);font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n/* Correct answer variants */\n.correct-answer,.answer-banner,.correct-section{background-color:#e8f5e9;border-left:5px solid #4caf50;padding:15px;margin-bottom:20px;border-radius:4px}\n/* Wrong answer / distractor variants */\n.wrong-option,.wrong-answer,.distractor,.option-wrong,.incorrect,.wrong-choice{background:var(--card-bg);border-radius:var(--border-radius);box-shadow:0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.1);padding:20px;margin-bottom:20px;border-left:5px solid #e74c3c;opacity:.95;font-size:.95rem;color:var(--wrong-text)}\n/* Option analysis wrapper */\n.option-analysis,.option-card,.option-box,.choice-analysis{margin-bottom:8px}\n/* English term / key term variants */\n.english-term,.eng-term,.en-term,.term-en,.english,.eng,.key-term,.latin-term{background-color:#e1ecf4;color:#2980b9;padding:1px 5px;border-radius:4px;font-size:.9em;font-weight:500}\n/* Analysis section variants — block containers, NOT flex */\n.analysis-section,.analysis-box,.analysis-title,.rule-section{display:block;margin-bottom:16px}\n/* Analysis step variants — same as .analysis-step (float-based) */\n.analysis-point,.logic-step,.step-item,.step-card{display:block;margin-bottom:14px;overflow:hidden}\n/* Step variants */\n.step{display:block;margin-bottom:14px;overflow:hidden}\n.step-num,.step-icon{float:left;clear:left;background:var(--primary-color);color:#fff;width:24px;height:24px;min-width:24px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:bold;margin-right:10px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:1px;flex-shrink:0}\n.step-text,.analysis-text,.explanation-text{flex-grow:1;font-size:.95em}\n/* Highlight / key point / rule card variants */\n.highlight-box,.key-point,.rule-card,.rule-section,.result-box,.answer-analysis{background-color:var(--highlight-bg);border-left:4px solid var(--accent-color);padding:15px;margin-bottom:20px;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0}\n/* Subtitle */\n.subtitle{margin:4px 0 0;font-size:14px;opacity:.9}\n/* MBE tip variants */\n.mbe-tip,.tip-box-alt,.exam-tip-box{background:#fff8e1;border-left:5px solid #ffc107;padding:15px 20px;margin-top:20px;font-size:.9em;color:#6d4c41}\n.mbe-tip-title{font-weight:bold;color:#ff8f00;display:block;margin-bottom:8px}\n/* Badge / tag variants */\n.badge,.tag,.concept-tag,.concept-term{display:inline-block;background:var(--accent-color);color:#fff;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:12px;font-size:.8em;margin-right:5px}\n.card.option.wrong .badge,.wrong-option .badge{background:#e74c3c;color:#fff}\n.badge-wrong,.wrong-tag,.tag-wrong,.wrong-badge{background-color:var(--wrong-bg);color:var(--wrong-text);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:4px;font-size:.85em;display:inline-block}\n.badge-correct,.correct-tag{background-color:var(--correct-bg);color:var(--correct-text);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:4px;font-size:.85em;display:inline-block}\n/* Case law / case ref */\n.case-law,.case-ref,.case-study{background-color:#e3f2fd;border:1px solid #bbdefb;border-radius:8px;padding:15px;margin-bottom:20px;font-size:.9em}\n/* Trap box */\n.trap-box{background-color:#fff3cd;border:1px solid #ffeeba;color:#856404;padding:15px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:20px;font-size:.9em}\n.trap-title{font-weight:bold;color:#856404;margin-bottom:8px;display:block}\n/* Timeline → diagram-like */\n.timeline{background-color:#f9f9f9;border:1px solid #e0e0e0;padding:15px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:20px}\n.timeline-item,.event{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;margin-bottom:10px;gap:10px}\n.timeline-date{background:var(--primary-color);color:#fff;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;font-size:.8em;white-space:nowrap;flex-shrink:0}\n.timeline-content,.timeline-desc,.event-desc{flex-grow:1;font-size:.9em}\n/* Party box (already in canonical, add alias) */\n.party-box{background:#e8fcff;border:1px solid #22b8cf;border-radius:6px;padding:10px 14px;font-weight:700;color:#05606a}\n/* Flow arrow alias */\n.flow-arrow{font-size:1.2em;color:#aaa;text-align:center;padding:2px 0}\n/* Distractor variants */\n.distractor-item,.wrong-distractor{background-color:var(--wrong-bg);color:var(--wrong-text);border:1px solid #f5c6cb;padding:10px 12px;margin-bottom:8px;border-radius:6px;font-size:.9em}\n.distractor-label,.wrong-title,.distractor-title{font-weight:bold;color:var(--wrong-text);display:block;margin-bottom:4px}\n/* Section/label */\n.section,.rule-item{margin-bottom:10px}\n.answer-label,.answer-title-text{color:#2e7d32;font-weight:bold;display:block;margin-bottom:5px}\n/* Concept header */\n.concept-header,.rule-header{color:var(--accent-color);font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px}\n/* Legal rule / law block variants */\n.legal-rule,.law-block,.rule-content,.legal-principle{background-color:var(--highlight-bg);border-left:4px solid var(--accent-color);padding:14px 15px;margin-bottom:16px;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;font-size:.95em}\n.result-title,.correct-title{color:#2e7d32;font-weight:bold;display:block;margin-bottom:5px}\n/* Icon (decorative) */\n.icon{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:20px;height:20px;font-size:.9em}\n/* Misc */\n.list-item{margin-bottom:6px}\n.label{font-size:.85em;font-weight:600;color:var(--primary-color)}\n.conclusion{background-color:#e8f5e9;border-left:5px solid #4caf50;padding:12px 15px;margin:15px 0;border-radius:4px}\n/* Remaining high-frequency aliases */\n.timeline-title{font-weight:600;color:var(--primary-color);margin-bottom:6px}\n.comparison-table-wrapper{overflow-x:auto;margin:15px 0}\n.text{font-size:.95em;line-height:1.6}\n.flow-label{font-size:.8em;color:#555;text-align:center;margin:2px 0}\n.diagram-box{background:#f9f9f9;border:1px solid #e0e0e0;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;margin:10px 0}\n.diagram-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;margin:6px 0}\n.diagram-content,.diagram-arrow{font-size:.9em;color:#555}\n.tip-icon,.check-icon,.logic-icon{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:.9em;margin-right:4px}\n.answer-badge{background-color:var(--correct-bg);color:var(--correct-text);padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;font-size:.85em;font-weight:600}\n.rule-list{list-style:disc;padding-left:18px;margin:8px 0}\n.rule-tag,.option-tag{background-color:#e8f4f8;color:#1565c0;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:4px;font-size:.82em;font-weight:500;display:inline-block}\n.flow-branch{display:flex;gap:8px;margin:6px 0}\n.option-title,.wrong-item{font-weight:600;margin-bottom:4px}\n.date{font-size:.82em;color:#666;white-space:nowrap}\n.explanation{font-size:.9em;color:var(--text-color);line-height:1.6}\n.wrong-item{color:var(--wrong-text)}\n</style>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>MBE 考点解析 - 宪法：个人权利</title>\n    \n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <header class=\"header\">\n            <h1>MBE 考点解析</h1>\n            <p class=\"sub-title\">宪法：个人权利 - 平等保护条款审查标准</p>\n        </header>\n\n        <main style=\"padding: 0 24px;\">\n            <div class=\"answer-box\">\n                <p><strong>正确答案：A</strong></p>\n                <p><strong>判决要旨：</strong>州机构必须证明该州法规与一项重要的州利益之间存在实质性关联。</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <h2>核心法律规则</h2>\n            <div class=\"concept-box\">\n                <p>根据《第十四修正案》的<strong class=\"term\">平等保护条款 (equal protection clause)</strong>，州法律若对处境相似的人群进行歧视，其合宪性审查标准取决于所指控的歧视类型。对于歧视<strong class=\"term\">准可疑分类 (quasi-suspect class)</strong>（例如，基于性别或非婚生子女的分类）的法律，适用<strong class=\"term\">中间审查 (intermediate scrutiny)</strong>。</p>\n                <p>在中间审查下，政府（在此案中是州机构）负有<strong class=\"term\">举证责任 (burden of persuasion)</strong>，必须证明该法律与一项<strong class=\"term\">重要的州利益 (important state interest)</strong>之间存在<strong class=\"term\">实质性关联 (substantially related)</strong>。</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <h2>概念对比：平等保护条款下的审查标准</h2>\n            <div class=\"comparison-table\" style=\"overflow-x: auto;\">\n                <table class=\"comparison-table\">\n                    <thead>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>审查标准 (Scrutiny Level)</th>\n                            <th>分类依据 (Classification Basis)</th>\n                            <th>政府目的 (Government Interest)</th>\n                            <th>手段与目的关系 (Means-End Fit)</th>\n                            <th>举证责任 (Burden of Proof)</th>\n                        </tr>\n                    </thead>\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><strong class=\"term\">理性基础审查 (Rational Basis)</strong></td>\n                            <td>非可疑分类 (Non-suspect classifications) (如年龄、财富、智力)</td>\n                            <td>合法州利益 (Legitimate state interest)</td>\n                            <td>合理关联 (Rationally related)</td>\n                            <td>挑战者 (Challenger)</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><strong class=\"term\">中间审查 (Intermediate Scrutiny)</strong></td>\n                            <td>准可疑分类 (Quasi-suspect classifications) (如性别、非婚生子女)</td>\n                            <td>重要州利益 (Important state interest)</td>\n                            <td>实质性关联 (Substantially related)</td>\n                            <td>政府 (Government)</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><strong class=\"term\">严格审查 (Strict Scrutiny)</strong></td>\n                            <td>可疑分类 (Suspect classifications) (如种族、国籍、民族) 或 根本权利 (Fundamental rights)</td>\n                            <td>强制性州利益 (Compelling state interest)</td>\n                            <td>必要实现 (Necessary to achieve) / 最低限制性手段 (Least restrictive means)</td>\n                            <td>政府 (Government)</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n\n            <h2>案情分析与适用逻辑</h2>\n            <div class=\"analysis-step\">\n                <p>本案中，州法规禁止<strong class=\"term\">非婚生子女 (children born outside of marriage)</strong>获得福利，这构成了对非婚生子女的歧视。根据判例法，非婚生子女被视为<strong class=\"term\">准可疑分类 (quasi-suspect class)</strong>。因此，对该法规的合宪性审查适用<strong class=\"term\">中间审查 (intermediate scrutiny)</strong>标准。</p>\n                <p>在中间审查下，<strong class=\"term\">政府（即州机构）</strong>负有<strong class=\"term\">举证责任 (burden of persuasion)</strong>，必须证明该法规与一项<strong class=\"term\">重要的州利益 (important state interest)</strong>之间存在<strong class=\"term\">实质性关联 (substantially related)</strong>。</p>\n                <p>法规的目的是鼓励人们在生育前结婚，这可能被视为一项重要的州利益，但州机构仍需证明该法规是<strong class=\"term\">实质性关联</strong>于实现这一目的的手段。</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <h2>图示：平等保护条款下的审查标准</h2>\n            <div class=\"diagram\" style=\"position: relative; padding-top: 40px; padding-bottom: 40px;\">\n                <div style=\"position: absolute; left: 10px; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%) rotate(-90deg); font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary-ink); white-space: nowrap;\">负担的严苛程度 (Severity of burden)</div>\n                <div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: flex-end; gap: 2%; width: 90%; margin: 0 auto;\">\n                    <!-- Rational Basis -->\n                    <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; width: 30%;\">\n                        <div style=\"background: var(--highlight-bg); border: 1px solid var(--accent-color); padding: 15px; border-radius: 6px; margin-bottom: 10px; min-height: 120px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; text-align: center; color: var(--primary-ink); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; width: 100%;\">\n                            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-weight: 800; font-size: 18px;\">理性基础 (Rational basis)</p>\n                            <ul style=\"list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 10px 0 0;\">\n                                <li style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\">• 与合法州利益无合理关联</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary-ink);\">理性基础审查</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <!-- Intermediate -->\n                    <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; width: 30%;\">\n                        <div style=\"background-color: #fde0e7; border: 1px solid #f8bbd0; padding: 15px; border-radius: 6px; margin-bottom: 10px; min-height: 180px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; text-align: center; color: var(--primary-ink); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; width: 100%;\">\n                            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-weight: 800; font-size: 18px;\">中间 (Intermediate)</p>\n                            <ul style=\"list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 10px 0 0;\">\n                                <li style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\">• 与重要州利益实质性关联</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary-ink);\">中间审查</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <!-- Strict -->\n                    <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; width: 30%;\">\n                        <div style=\"background-color: #fde0e7; border: 1px solid #f8bbd0; padding: 15px; border-radius: 6px; margin-bottom: 10px; min-height: 240px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; text-align: center; color: var(--primary-ink); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; width: 100%;\">\n                            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-weight: 800; font-size: 18px;\">严格 (Strict)</p>\n                            <ul style=\"list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 10px 0 0;\">\n                                    <li style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\">• 为实现强制性州利益所必需</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary-ink);\">严格审查</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <p style=\"margin: 20px 0 0; font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary-ink);\">审查类型 (Type of scrutiny)</p>\n                <div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 20px; margin-top: 20px; font-size: 16px;\">\n                    <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center;\">\n                        <span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 20px; height: 12px; background: var(--highlight-bg); border: 1px solid var(--accent-color); margin-right: 8px;\"></span>\n                        <span>= 挑战者负担</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center;\">\n                        <span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 20px; height: 12px; background-color: #fde0e7; border: 1px solid #f8bbd0; margin-right: 8px;\"></span>\n                        <span>= 州政府负担</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <h2>陷阱提示</h2>\n            <div class=\"trap-alert\">\n                <p>区分<strong class=\"term\">准可疑分类 (quasi-suspect class)</strong>（如性别、非婚生子女）与<strong class=\"term\">可疑分类 (suspect class)</strong>（如种族、国籍）或<strong class=\"term\">根本权利 (fundamental rights)</strong>。对于可疑分类和根本权利，适用<strong class=\"term\">严格审查 (strict scrutiny)</strong>，要求政府证明法律是实现<strong class=\"term\">强制性州利益 (compelling state interest)</strong>的<strong class=\"term\">最低限制性手段 (least restrictive means)</strong>。本案中，非婚生子女属于准可疑分类，因此适用中间审查，要求<strong class=\"term\">实质性关联 (substantially related)</strong>于<strong class=\"term\">重要州利益 (important state interest)</strong>。</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <h2>正确答案与干扰项排除</h2>\n            <div class=\"option-analysis\">\n                <div class=\"option correct\">\n                    <p><strong>A. 机构必须证明该州法规与一项重要的州利益之间存在实质性关联。</strong></p>\n                    <p>此选项正确地描述了中间审查的举证责任和标准。由于非婚生子女构成准可疑分类，因此州机构必须证明该法规与一项重要的州利益之间存在实质性关联。</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"option wrong\">\n                    <p><strong>B. 机构必须证明该州法规是实现一项强制性州利益的最低限制性手段。</strong></p>\n                    <p>此选项描述的是严格审查的标准，适用于可疑分类或根本权利。非婚生子女不属于可疑分类，本案也不涉及根本权利，因此不适用严格审查。</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"option wrong\">\n                    <p><strong>C. 该男子必须证明该州法规与一项重要的州利益之间不存在实质性关联。</strong></p>\n                    <p>虽然此选项提到了中间审查的标准（实质性关联于重要州利益），但错误地将举证责任归于挑战者（该男子）。在中间审查下，举证责任在于政府（州机构）。</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"option wrong\">\n                    <p><strong>D. 该男子必须证明该州法规不是实现一项强制性州利益的最低限制性手段。</strong></p>\n                    <p>此选项不仅错误地将举证责任归于挑战者，而且描述的是严格审查的标准，不适用于本案。</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <h2>考试技巧</h2>\n            <div class=\"footer-tip\">\n                <p>当州法律歧视<strong class=\"term\">准可疑分类 (quasi-suspect class)</strong>（例如，非婚生子女）时，适用<strong class=\"term\">中间审查 (intermediate scrutiny)</strong>。政府负有举证责任，必须证明该法律与一项<strong class=\"term\">重要的州利益 (important state interest)</strong>之间存在<strong class=\"term\">实质性关联 (substantially related)</strong>。</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <h2>参考资料</h2>\n            <div class=\"references\">\n                <ul>\n                    <li><a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/wex/equal_protection_clause\" target=\"_blank\">U.S. Const. amend. XIV (equal protection clause).</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"https://supreme.justia.com/cases/federal/us/486/456/\" target=\"_blank\">Clark v. Jeter, 486 U.S. 456, 461 (1988) (holding that a law discriminating against nonmarital children is subject to intermediate scrutiny).</a></li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n        </main>\n\n        <footer class=\"footer-meta\">\n            <div>\n                <strong>宪法</strong>\n                <span>Subject</span>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n                <strong>个人权利</strong>\n                <span>Chapter</span>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n                <strong>准可疑分类审查</strong>\n                <span>Topic</span>\n            </div>\n        </footer>\n        <p style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted-text); margin-top: 20px; padding-bottom: 20px;\">版权所有 © UWorld. 保留所有权利。</p>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
