    {
      "index": 17,
      "subject": "Constitutional Law",
      "chapter": "Individual Rights",
      "topic": "Right to open courtroom",
      "count": 120,
      "question": "A defendant was on trial for a highly publicized capital murder in a federal district court. The court issued an order that prohibited public attendance during voir dire to protect the prospective jurors' privacy, especially concerning sensitive issues. The court issued findings on the record and concluded that public attendance during voir dire would prevent the prospective jurors from answering sensitive questions without suffering personal embarrassment.\nSeveral television networks that are televising the trial have challenged the order, arguing that it is unconstitutional.\nIs the court's order likely constitutional?",
      "choices": {
        "A": "No, because the First Amendment guarantees the press and the public the right to attend criminal trials.",
        "B": "No, because there are less restrictive means to protect the privacy of the prospective jurors.",
        "C": "Yes, because the court has an interest in protecting prospective jurors from personal embarrassment.",
        "D": "Yes, because the court-issued findings on the record warranted closing the proceedings to the public."
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "source_img": "source_imgs/q0017.png",
      "explanation": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n  <title>Explanation</title>\n  <style>\n    body{\n      margin:0;\n      font-size:1rem;\n      line-height:1.7;\n      background:#fff;\n      color:#111;\n      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    }\n    .pbx-explanation{\n      padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;\n      max-width: 100%;\n      box-sizing:border-box;\n    }\n    .pbx-title{\n      text-align:center;\n      font-size:1.9rem;\n      line-height:1.2;\n      font-weight:700;\n      margin:0.8rem 0 1rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-figure{\n      width:100%;\n      margin:0 auto 1rem;\n      box-sizing:border-box;\n    }\n    .pbx-flow{\n      position:relative;\n      width:100%;\n      min-width: 56rem;\n      height:auto;\n      border:1px solid #d9d9d9;\n      overflow:hidden;\n      background:#f4efe7;\n      box-sizing:border-box;\n    }\n    .pbx-flow-inner{\n      min-width:56rem;\n      position:relative;\n      padding:0;\n      box-sizing:border-box;\n      overflow:hidden;\n      background:\n        linear-gradient(180deg,#efe7db 0%,#f7f2eb 18%,#f3eee6 18%,#f3eee6 100%);\n    }\n    .pbx-ceiling{\n      height:2.8rem;\n      background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f7f0e6 0%,#eadfcd 100%);\n      border-bottom:1px solid #b9aa96;\n    }\n    .pbx-stage{\n      position:relative;\n      height:40rem;\n      background:\n        linear-gradient(90deg, #b51b21 0%, #c51a21 18%, #c61b22 50%, #b91b21 70%, #efe6d8 70%, #efe6d8 100%);\n    }\n    .pbx-curtain{\n      position:absolute;\n      left:0;\n      top:0;\n      width:66%;\n      height:100%;\n      background:\n        repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,.06) 0, rgba(255,255,255,.06) .35rem, rgba(0,0,0,.03) .35rem, rgba(0,0,0,.03) .7rem),\n        linear-gradient(180deg,#b51018 0%,#d21a22 40%,#b80f16 100%);\n      clip-path: polygon(0 0, 86% 0, 100% 12%, 100% 100%, 0 100%);\n    }\n    .pbx-curtain::after{\n      content:\"\";\n      position:absolute;\n      right:-4%;\n      top:0;\n      width:22%;\n      height:100%;\n      background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,.05),rgba(0,0,0,.06));\n      clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 18%, 100% 100%, 0 100%);\n    }\n    .pbx-court{\n      position:absolute;\n      right:0;\n      top:0;\n      width:34%;\n      height:100%;\n      background:#efe6d8;\n    }\n    .pbx-bench{\n      position:absolute;\n      left:61%;\n      top:25%;\n      width:22%;\n      height:15%;\n      background:#7d4f1f;\n      box-shadow: inset 0 -0.35rem 0 rgba(0,0,0,.15);\n    }\n    .pbx-bench::before{\n      content:\"\";\n      position:absolute;\n      left:0;\n      top:-0.8rem;\n      width:100%;\n      height:0.8rem;\n      background:#9c6b35;\n    }\n    .pbx-judge-label{\n      position:absolute;\n      left:64%;\n      top:44%;\n      color:#fff;\n      font-size:1.2rem;\n      text-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.4);\n    }\n    .pbx-people-label{\n      position:absolute;\n      color:#f4f0e8;\n      font-size:1.2rem;\n      text-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.25);\n      z-index:2;\n    }\n    .pbx-people-label.public{ left:8%; top:43%; }\n    .pbx-people-label.press{ left:19%; top:43%; }\n    .pbx-people-label.defendant{ left:32%; top:43%; }\n    .pbx-public{\n      position:absolute;\n      left:2%;\n      bottom:9%;\n      width:8%;\n      height:18%;\n      background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f2cab4,#e0aa88);\n      border-radius: 45% 45% 20% 20%;\n      box-shadow: 0 0 0 .05rem rgba(0,0,0,.05);\n    }\n    .pbx-public::before{\n      content:\"\";\n      position:absolute;\n      left:22%;\n      top:34%;\n      width:56%;\n      height:75%;\n      background:#cfc0a8;\n      clip-path: polygon(20% 0,80% 0,100% 100%,0 100%);\n    }\n    .pbx-public::after{\n      content:\"\";\n      position:absolute;\n      left:18%;\n      top:18%;\n      width:64%;\n      height:22%;\n      background:#e8b08a;\n      border-radius:50%;\n    }\n    .pbx-press{\n      position:absolute;\n      left:14%;\n      bottom:7%;\n      width:10%;\n      height:20%;\n      background:linear-gradient(180deg,#2b2f3d,#11161e);\n      border-radius: 30% 30% 8% 8%;\n    }\n    .pbx-press::before{\n      content:\"\";\n      position:absolute;\n      left:17%;\n      top:18%;\n      width:66%;\n      height:16%;\n      background:#0f1318;\n      border-radius:50%;\n    }\n    .pbx-defendant{\n      position:absolute;\n      left:28%;\n      bottom:7%;\n      width:10%;\n      height:21%;\n      background:linear-gradient(180deg,#233145,#111827);\n      border-radius: 30% 30% 8% 8%;\n    }\n    .pbx-defendant::before{\n      content:\"\";\n      position:absolute;\n      left:20%;\n      top:16%;\n      width:60%;\n      height:15%;\n      background:#0f1318;\n      border-radius:50%;\n    }\n    .pbx-judge{\n      position:absolute;\n      right:16%;\n      bottom:7%;\n      width:11%;\n      height:24%;\n      background:linear-gradient(180deg,#1d1d1d,#363636);\n      clip-path: polygon(22% 0, 78% 0, 100% 100%, 0 100%);\n    }\n    .pbx-judge::before{\n      content:\"\";\n      position:absolute;\n      left:18%;\n      top:0;\n      width:64%;\n      height:18%;\n      background:#6e6e6e;\n      border-radius:50%;\n    }\n    .pbx-gallery{\n      position:absolute;\n      right:0;\n      top:46%;\n      width:23%;\n      height:26%;\n      background:#a7794c;\n      clip-path: polygon(0 0,100% 0,100% 100%,0 76%);\n      box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 .05rem rgba(0,0,0,.1);\n    }\n    .pbx-court-seal{\n      position:absolute;\n      left:61%;\n      top:7%;\n      width:12%;\n      height:12%;\n      border-radius:50%;\n      background:radial-gradient(circle at 35% 35%, #d2c0a0, #a88b61 70%, #8b6a3f 100%);\n      opacity:.95;\n    }\n    .pbx-flags{\n      position:absolute;\n      left:54%;\n      top:14%;\n      width:16%;\n      height:22%;\n    }\n    .pbx-flag{\n      position:absolute;\n      width:.9rem;\n      height:5rem;\n      background:linear-gradient(180deg,#d2b48c,#8b6b43);\n      left:48%;\n      top:0;\n    }\n    .pbx-flag.us::after,.pbx-flag.ca::after{\n      content:\"\";\n      position:absolute;\n      left:-.5rem;\n      top:.5rem;\n      width:1.2rem;\n      height:2.8rem;\n      background:linear-gradient(180deg,#c62828 0 14%,#fff 14% 28%,#c62828 28% 42%,#fff 42% 56%,#c62828 56% 70%,#fff 70% 84%,#c62828 84% 100%);\n      clip-path: polygon(0 0,100% 12%,100% 78%,0 100%);\n    }\n    .pbx-flag.ca{ left:76%; }\n    .pbx-flag.ca::after{\n      background:linear-gradient(90deg,#d32f2f 0 25%,#fff 25% 75%,#d32f2f 75% 100%);\n    }\n    .pbx-caption{\n      font-size:1rem;\n      line-height:1.65;\n      color:#222;\n      margin:1rem 0 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-caption p{ margin:0 0 1rem; }\n    .pbx-caption strong{ font-weight:700; }\n    .pbx-edu-objective{\n      background:#f0f7ff;\n      border-left:4px solid #3498db;\n      border-radius:6px;\n      padding:14px 18px;\n      margin:24px 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-edu-objective-title{\n      font-size:13px;\n      font-weight:700;\n      color:#2980b9;\n      text-transform:uppercase;\n      letter-spacing:0.05em;\n      margin-bottom:8px;\n    }\n    .pbx-references{\n      background:#fafafa;\n      border:1px solid #e0e0e0;\n      border-radius:6px;\n      padding:14px 18px;\n      margin:20px 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-references-title{\n      font-size:13px;\n      font-weight:700;\n      color:#555;\n      text-transform:uppercase;\n      letter-spacing:0.05em;\n      margin-bottom:8px;\n    }\n    .pbx-ref-list{\n      margin:0;\n      padding-left:18px;\n      font-size:14px;\n      color:#555;\n      line-height:1.7;\n    }\n    @media (max-width: 640px){\n      body{ font-size:0.95rem; padding:0.75rem; }\n      .pbx-explanation{ padding:0.875rem 1rem; }\n      .pbx-title{ font-size:1.55rem; }\n      .pbx-flow{ min-width: 50rem; }\n      .pbx-caption{ font-size:0.96rem; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <!-- pbx-topic: Right to open courtroom -->\n  <div class=\"pbx-explanation\">\n    <div class=\"pbx-title\">Right to open courtroom</div>\n\n    <div class=\"pbx-figure\">\n      <div class=\"pbx-scroll-x\" style=\"overflow-x:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;margin:16px 0;\">\n        <div class=\"pbx-flow-inner\">\n          <div class=\"pbx-flow\">\n            <div class=\"pbx-ceiling\"></div>\n            <div class=\"pbx-stage\">\n              <div class=\"pbx-curtain\"></div>\n              <div class=\"pbx-court\"></div>\n              <div class=\"pbx-court-seal\"></div>\n              <div class=\"pbx-flags\">\n                <div class=\"pbx-flag us\"></div>\n                <div class=\"pbx-flag ca\"></div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"pbx-bench\"></div>\n              <div class=\"pbx-gallery\"></div>\n              <div class=\"pbx-people-label public\">Public</div>\n              <div class=\"pbx-people-label press\">Press</div>\n              <div class=\"pbx-people-label defendant\">Criminal defendant</div>\n              <div class=\"pbx-judge-label\">Judge</div>\n              <div class=\"pbx-public\"></div>\n              <div class=\"pbx-press\"></div>\n              <div class=\"pbx-defendant\"></div>\n              <div class=\"pbx-judge\"></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"pbx-caption\">\n      <p>The <strong>First Amendment</strong> generally guarantees the press and the public the <strong>right to attend every stage of a criminal trial</strong>, including voir dire.* However, this right is not absolute, and a court can order that trial proceedings be closed if the court's findings on the record demonstrate that the closure satisfies <strong>strict scrutiny</strong> (<span data-choice=\"A\" data-choice-role=\"distractor\"><strong style=\"color:#9b1c1c\">(Choice A)</strong></span>). This requires the court to show that the closure is the <strong>least restrictive means</strong> to serve a <strong>compelling government interest</strong>.</p>\n\n      <p>Here, the court prohibited the public from attending voir dire in the defendant's murder trial to protect the prospective jurors from personal embarrassment. This promotes the compelling interests of encouraging the prospective jurors to speak frankly about sensitive issues and protecting their privacy—but less restrictive means were available to serve these interests <span data-choice=\"C\" data-choice-role=\"distractor\"><strong style=\"color:#9b1c1c\">(Choice C)</strong></span>. For example, the court could have allowed prospective jurors to answer any sensitive questions outside the presence of the public. Therefore, the order is likely unconstitutional.</p>\n\n      <p style=\"font-style:italic;\">*The Supreme Court has not conclusively ruled whether the First Amendment guarantees the press and the public the right to attend civil trials.</p>\n\n      <p data-choice=\"D\" data-choice-role=\"distractor\"><strong style=\"color:#9b1c1c\">(Choice D)</strong> The court-issued findings on the record did <em>not</em> warrant closing the proceedings to the public because these findings did not demonstrate that the closure was the least restrictive means to protect the prospective jurors' privacy.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"pbx-edu-objective\">\n        <div class=\"pbx-edu-objective-title\">📌 Educational Objective</div>\n        <p>The First Amendment generally guarantees the press and the public the right to attend criminal trials. However, criminal trial proceedings may be closed when the court demonstrates that the closure satisfies strict scrutiny—ie, that it is the least restrictive means to serve a compelling government interest.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"pbx-references\">\n        <div class=\"pbx-references-title\">📚 References</div>\n        <ul class=\"pbx-ref-list\">\n          <li>Press-Enter. Co. v. Super. Ct. of Cal., 464 U.S. 501, 511 (1984) (holding that closing all voir dire proceedings in a criminal trial to the public and press is unconstitutional).</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "zh-question": "一名被告因一起备受瞩目的死刑谋杀案在联邦地区法院受审。法院发布了一项命令，禁止公众在预选陪审员（voir dire）期间旁听，以保护准陪审员的隐私，特别是关于敏感问题的隐私。法院在庭审记录中给出了调查结论，并断定在预选陪审员期间允许公众旁听将使准陪审员因个人尴尬而无法回答敏感问题。\n\n几家正在电视转播该审判的电视网络对该命令提出质疑，认为其违宪。\n\n法院的命令是否可能合宪？",
      "zh-choices": {
        "A": "否，因为 First Amendment 保证了媒体和公众有权旁听刑事审判。",
        "B": "否，因为有侵害性更小的方式来保护准陪审员的隐私。",
        "C": "是，因为法院在保护准陪审员免受个人尴尬方面拥有利益。",
        "D": "是，因为法院在庭审记录中给出的调查结论证明了对公众关闭庭审程序的正当性。"
      },
      "zh-explanation": "<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\r\n<head>\r\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\r\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\r\n    \r\n    <style>\r\n        strong, b {\r\n            display: inline !important; \r\n            white-space: normal !important; \r\n            word-break: normal !important;\n            overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\r\n        }\r\n    </style>\r\n\r\n<style>\r\n        body {\r\n            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\r\n            background-color: #f0f2f5;\r\n            margin: 0;\r\n            padding: 10px;\r\n            color: #333;\r\n            line-height: 1.6;\r\n        }\r\n        .container {\r\n            max-width: 480px;\r\n            margin: 0 auto;\r\n            background-color: #ffffff;\r\n            border-radius: 12px;\r\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\r\n            overflow: hidden;\r\n        }\r\n        .header {\r\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2c3e50, #4ca1af);\r\n            color: white;\r\n            padding: 20px;\r\n            text-align: center;\r\n        }\r\n        .header h1 {\r\n            margin: 0;\r\n            font-size: 20px;\r\n            font-weight: 700;\r\n        }\r\n        .header p {\r\n            margin: 5px 0 0;\r\n            font-size: 14px;\r\n            opacity: 0.9;\r\n        }\r\n        .content {\r\n            padding: 20px;\r\n        }\r\n        .rule-box {\r\n            background-color: #e3f2fd;\r\n            border-left: 5px solid #2196f3;\r\n            padding: 15px;\r\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\r\n            border-radius: 4px;\r\n        }\r\n        .rule-title {\r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n            color: #1565c0;\r\n            margin-bottom: 8px;\r\n            display: block;\r\n            font-size: 16px;\r\n        }\r\n        .analysis-section {\r\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\r\n        }\r\n        .analysis-title {\r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n            font-size: 18px;\r\n            color: #34495e;\r\n            border-bottom: 2px solid #ecf0f1;\r\n            padding-bottom: 5px;\r\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\r\n        }\r\n        .key-term {\r\n            background-color: #f1f8e9;\r\n            color: #2e7d32;\r\n            padding: 2px 6px;\r\n            border-radius: 4px;\r\n            font-weight: 500;\r\n            font-size: 0.9em;\r\n        }\r\n        .wrong-answer {\r\n            background-color: #ffebee;\r\n            padding: 10px;\r\n            border-radius: 6px;\r\n            margin-top: 10px;\r\n            font-size: 14px;\r\n            border-left: 4px solid #ef5350;\r\n        }\r\n        .correct-answer {\r\n            background-color: #e8f5e9;\r\n            padding: 15px;\r\n            border-radius: 6px;\r\n            margin-top: 15px;\r\n            border: 1px solid #c8e6c9;\r\n        }\r\n        .check-icon {\r\n            color: #4caf50;\r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n            margin-right: 5px;\r\n        }\r\n        .footer-tip {\r\n            background-color: #fff3e0;\r\n            padding: 15px;\r\n            border-radius: 8px;\r\n            margin-top: 20px;\r\n            font-size: 14px;\r\n            border: 1px dashed #ff9800;\r\n        }\r\n        ul {\r\n            padding-left: 20px;\r\n            margin: 10px 0;\r\n        }\r\n        li {\r\n            margin-bottom: 8px;\r\n        }\r\n    </style>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n    <div class=\"header\">\r\n        <h1>MBE 考点解析</h1>\r\n        <p>Constitutional Law: Public Access to Trials</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"content\">\r\n        \r\n        <!-- 核心考点 -->\r\n        <div class=\"rule-box\">\r\n            <span class=\"rule-title\">⚖️ 核心法律规则 (The Rule)</span>\r\n            根据 <b>First Amendment</b>，媒体和公众拥有旁听刑事审判（包括陪审员预选程序 <span class=\"key-term\">Voir Dire</span>）的推定权利。\r\n            <br><br>\r\n            这项权利不是绝对的，但关闭庭审必须满足<b>严格审查 (Strict Scrutiny)</b> 标准：\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li>必须为了服务于<b>迫切的政府利益</b> (Compelling Interest)；</li>\r\n                <li>必须有<b>记录在案的调查结论</b> (Findings on the record) 支持；</li>\r\n                <li>措施必须是<b>侵害性最小的手段</b> (Least Restrictive Means)。</li>\r\n            </ul>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 题目分析 -->\r\n        <div class=\"analysis-section\">\r\n            <div class=\"analysis-title\">🔍 案情分析</div>\r\n            <p>本案中，法官为了保护准陪审员的隐私（避免尴尬），下令<b>完全禁止</b>公众旁听预选陪审员程序。</p>\r\n            <p>虽然保护陪审员隐私是一个正当的利益，但法官采取的手段（完全关闭）过于宽泛。法官本可以采取<b>侵害性更小</b>的措施，例如：</p>\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li>仅在询问极度敏感问题时进行非公开询问 (In camera)；</li>\r\n                <li>仅对特定的准陪审员进行非公开询问。</li>\r\n            </ul>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 正确答案解析 -->\r\n        <div class=\"correct-answer\">\r\n            <div class=\"analysis-title\"><span class=\"check-icon\">✅</span> 为什么选 B？</div>\r\n            <p><b>选项 B (No, because there are less restrictive means...) 是正确的。</b></p>\r\n            <p>这是宪法第一修正案分析中的关键一环。最高法院在 <i>Press-Enterprise Co. v. Superior Court</i> (1984) 一案中明确指出，如果有关闭庭审的替代方案（即侵害性更小的手段）可以充分保护利益，那么完全关闭庭审就是违宪的。</p>\r\n            <p>因为存在“侵害性更小的方式”（如部分非公开询问），所以法院的全面禁令无法通过严格审查。</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 错误选项辨析 -->\r\n        <div class=\"analysis-section\">\r\n            <div class=\"analysis-title\">🚫 陷阱排除</div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"wrong-answer\">\r\n                <b>选项 A (First Amendment guarantees...)：</b>\r\n                <br>虽然第一修正案确实保障旁听权，但这个选项过于绝对。权利是可以被限制的，只要满足严格审查。选项 B 指出了本案具体的违宪原因（手段不当），比 A 更精准。\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"wrong-answer\">\r\n                <b>选项 C (Interest in protecting jurors...)：</b>\r\n                <br>仅仅拥有“利益”是不够的。即使利益是迫切的 (Compelling)，政府采取的手段也必须是必要的且侵害最小的。\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"wrong-answer\">\r\n                <b>选项 D (Findings on the record...)：</b>\r\n                <br>虽然法官做了记录，但如果结论本身不支持“这是唯一可行的方法”，或者忽略了替代方案，那么仅仅有记录并不能使违宪的命令变得合宪。\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 考试技巧 -->\r\n        <div class=\"footer-tip\">\r\n            <b>💡 MBE 考试技巧 (Exam Tip)</b>\r\n            <br><br>\r\n            在涉及 <b>First Amendment</b> 限制的问题中，如果政府（法院）限制了言论或旁听权，通常需要进行<b>严格审查 (Strict Scrutiny)</b>。\r\n            <br><br>\r\n            看到选项中提到“less restrictive means” (侵害性更小的手段) 或 “narrowly tailored” (狭义剪裁) 时，要高度警惕。这往往是政府行为违宪的致命伤——即手段过重，打击面过广。\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n</html>",
