    {
      "index": 18,
      "subject": "Constitutional Law",
      "chapter": "Individual Rights",
      "topic": "Applicability of Bill of Rights to states",
      "count": 120,
      "question": "A state statute requires all workers' compensation actions filed in state court to be decided by a judge. A woman brought a workers' compensation action in state court against her employer for injuries she sustained at work. The woman demanded a jury trial, but the court denied her request pursuant to the state statute.\nIs the state statute likely constitutional?",
      "choices": {
        "A": "No, because denying a jury trial only in workers' compensation actions violates equal protection of the laws.",
        "B": "No, because the Seventh Amendment guarantees the woman a jury trial.",
        "C": "No, because the Sixth Amendment requires a jury to decide the outcome of the case.",
        "D": "Yes."
      },
      "answer": "D",
      "source_img": "source_imgs/q0018.png",
      "explanation": "<!doctype html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n  <title>Explanation</title>\n  <style>\n    body{\n      margin:0;\n      font-size:1rem;\n      line-height:1.7;\n      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n      background:#ffffff;\n      color:#111;\n    }\n    .pbx-explanation{\n      padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;\n      box-sizing:border-box;\n      max-width:100%;\n    }\n    .pbx-explanation *{\n      box-sizing:border-box;\n    }\n    .pbx-title{\n      text-align:center;\n      font-size:1.15rem;\n      font-weight:700;\n      margin:0 0 1rem 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-flow{\n      display:flex;\n      flex-direction:column;\n      align-items:center;\n      margin:0 auto 1.5rem auto;\n      max-width:100%;\n    }\n    .pbx-flow-top{\n      text-align:center;\n      max-width:38rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-flow-card{\n      border:1px solid #d9d9d9;\n      box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\n      background:#fff;\n      padding:0.9rem 1rem;\n      margin:0 auto;\n    }\n    .pbx-flow-card img{\n      display:block;\n      max-width:100%;\n      height:auto;\n    }\n    .pbx-flow-label{\n      font-size:0.95rem;\n      margin-top:0.55rem;\n      line-height:1.3;\n    }\n    .pbx-exceptions{\n      width:100%;\n      margin-top:0.75rem;\n      position:relative;\n    }\n    .pbx-exceptions-line{\n      height:1px;\n      background:#b8b8b8;\n      width:100%;\n      margin:0.75rem 0 0.35rem;\n      position:relative;\n    }\n    .pbx-exceptions-label{\n      text-align:center;\n      font-size:0.95rem;\n      margin:0.15rem 0 0.4rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-exceptions-grid{\n      display:flex;\n      gap:1rem;\n      justify-content:space-between;\n      align-items:stretch;\n    }\n    .pbx-exception-card{\n      flex:1 1 0;\n      border:1px solid #d9d9d9;\n      box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\n      background:#fff;\n      overflow:hidden;\n    }\n    .pbx-exception-img{\n      width:100%;\n      height:11rem;\n      background:linear-gradient(180deg,#cfcfcf,#efefef);\n      position:relative;\n    }\n    .pbx-exception-card:nth-child(1) .pbx-exception-img{\n      background:linear-gradient(180deg,#b9b9b9 0%,#ececec 100%);\n    }\n    .pbx-exception-card:nth-child(2) .pbx-exception-img{\n      background:linear-gradient(180deg,#8f5d3d 0%,#7a4a2d 35%,#c68b61 100%);\n    }\n    .pbx-exception-card:nth-child(3) .pbx-exception-img{\n      background:linear-gradient(180deg,#d8c39b 0%,#8b6238 100%);\n    }\n    .pbx-exception-caption{\n      padding:0.8rem 0.75rem 0.95rem;\n      text-align:center;\n      font-size:0.95rem;\n      line-height:1.25;\n      min-height:3.8rem;\n      display:flex;\n      align-items:flex-end;\n      justify-content:center;\n    }\n    .pbx-text{\n      font-size:1rem;\n      margin:0 0 1rem 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-text p{\n      margin:0 0 1rem 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-text ul{\n      margin:0.4rem 0 1rem 1.35rem;\n      padding:0;\n    }\n    .pbx-text li{\n      margin:0.35rem 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-bold{ font-weight:700; }\n    .pbx-ital{ font-style:italic; }\n    .pbx-edu-objective{\n      background:#f0f7ff;\n      border-left:4px solid #3498db;\n      border-radius:6px;\n      padding:14px 18px;\n      margin:24px 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-edu-objective-title{\n      font-size:13px;\n      font-weight:700;\n      color:#2980b9;\n      text-transform:uppercase;\n      letter-spacing:0.05em;\n      margin-bottom:8px;\n    }\n    .pbx-references{\n      background:#fafafa;\n      border:1px solid #e0e0e0;\n      border-radius:6px;\n      padding:14px 18px;\n      margin:20px 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-references-title{\n      font-size:13px;\n      font-weight:700;\n      color:#555;\n      text-transform:uppercase;\n      letter-spacing:0.05em;\n      margin-bottom:8px;\n    }\n    .pbx-ref-list{\n      margin:0;\n      padding-left:18px;\n      font-size:14px;\n      color:#555;\n      line-height:1.7;\n    }\n    .pbx-ref-list li{ margin:0.35rem 0; }\n    .pbx-choice{\n      border-left:3px solid #c0392b;\n      padding-left:10px;\n      margin:0.75rem 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-choice[data-choice-role=\"correct\"]{\n      border-left-color:#27ae60;\n    }\n    .pbx-choice strong{\n      font-weight:700;\n    }\n    @media (max-width: 640px){\n      body{\n        font-size:0.95rem;\n        padding:0.75rem;\n      }\n      .pbx-explanation{\n        padding:0.875rem 1rem;\n      }\n      .pbx-title{\n        font-size:1.05rem;\n      }\n      .pbx-exceptions-grid{\n        flex-direction:column;\n      }\n      .pbx-exception-img{\n        height:9rem;\n      }\n      .pbx-flow-card{\n        padding:0.75rem;\n      }\n      .pbx-flow-label,.pbx-exception-caption{\n        font-size:0.9rem;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<!-- pbx-topic: Applicability of Bill of Rights to states -->\n<div class=\"pbx-explanation\">\n  <div class=\"pbx-title\">Applicability of Bill of Rights to states</div>\n\n  <div class=\"pbx-flow\">\n    <div class=\"pbx-flow-top\">\n      <div class=\"pbx-flow-card\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:1.65rem; line-height:1.1; font-family:'Times New Roman', serif; margin-bottom:0.4rem;\">Bill of Rights</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:1rem; font-family:'Times New Roman', serif; color:#555;\">Congress of the United States</div>\n        <div class=\"pbx-flow-label\">Applicable to states under the 14th<br/>Amendment due process clause</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"pbx-exceptions\">\n      <div class=\"pbx-exceptions-label\">Exceptions</div>\n      <div class=\"pbx-exceptions-grid\">\n        <div class=\"pbx-exception-card\">\n          <div class=\"pbx-exception-img\"></div>\n          <div class=\"pbx-exception-caption\">Ban on quartering soldiers<br/>(3rd Amendment)</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"pbx-exception-card\">\n          <div class=\"pbx-exception-img\"></div>\n          <div class=\"pbx-exception-caption\">Right to grand jury Indictment<br/>(5th Amendment)</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"pbx-exception-card\">\n          <div class=\"pbx-exception-img\"></div>\n          <div class=\"pbx-exception-caption\">Right to civil jury trial<br/>(7th Amendment)</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pbx-text\">\n    <p>The first 10 amendments to the U.S. Constitution (ie, the <strong>Bill of Rights</strong>) protect individuals from government overreach. These protections limit the power of the federal government, and <strong>most apply to the states</strong> with equal force through incorporation into the <strong>Fourteenth Amendment</strong> due process clause—with three exceptions:</p>\n\n    <ul>\n      <li>The Third Amendment prohibition against the government <strong>quartering soldiers</strong> in individuals' homes</li>\n      <li>The Fifth Amendment requirement of a <strong>grand jury indictment</strong> to charge a person with a capital offense</li>\n      <li>The Seventh Amendment guarantee of a <strong>jury trial in civil cases*</strong></li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <p>Here, the state court denied the woman's jury trial demand pursuant to a state statute requiring judges to decide the outcome of workers' compensation suits. Since the <span style=\"color:#1155cc;\">right to a jury trial</span> in civil cases has <span class=\"pbx-bold\">not been incorporated</span> into the Fourteenth Amendment due process clause, this right does <span class=\"pbx-bold\">not</span> apply in state court. As a result, the woman has no right to a jury trial, and the statute is likely constitutional <strong>(Choice B)</strong>.</p>\n\n    <p class=\"pbx-ital\" style=\"font-size:0.92rem;\">*The Supreme Court incorporates a protection under the Bill of Rights into the Fourteenth Amendment due process clause if the protection is fundamental to the scheme of ordered liberty or deeply rooted in the history and tradition of the United States.</p>\n\n    <p class=\"pbx-choice\" data-choice=\"A\" data-choice-role=\"distractor\"><strong style=\"color:#9b1c1c;\">(Choice A)</strong> The statute implicates the Fourteenth Amendment <span style=\"color:#1155cc;\">equal protection</span> clause because it treats workers' compensation claimants differently than other civil claimants. However, the statute does not substantially impact a <span style=\"color:#1155cc;\">fundamental right</span> or protected class, so rational basis scrutiny applies. Since this low level of scrutiny is easily met, the statute likely complies with the equal protection clause.</p>\n\n    <p class=\"pbx-choice\" data-choice=\"B\" data-choice-role=\"correct\"><strong style=\"color:#1f8f4d;\">(Choice B)</strong> The Seventh Amendment right to a jury trial in civil cases has not been incorporated into the Fourteenth Amendment due process clause. Thus, this right does not apply in state court. As a result, the woman has no right to a jury trial.</p>\n\n    <p class=\"pbx-choice\" data-choice=\"C\" data-choice-role=\"distractor\"><strong style=\"color:#9b1c1c;\">(Choice C)</strong> The Sixth Amendment right to a jury trial attaches to any criminal proceeding in which the defendant could be sentenced to more than six months in prison. But since the woman filed a <span class=\"pbx-ital\">civil action</span>, this right does not apply here.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"pbx-edu-objective\">\n      <div class=\"pbx-edu-objective-title\">📌 Educational Objective</div>\n      <p>Every Bill of Rights protection applies to the states except (1) the Third Amendment prohibition against the government quartering soldiers in individuals' homes, (2) the Fifth Amendment requirement of a grand jury indictment for capital offenses, and (3) the Seventh Amendment right to a jury trial in civil cases.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"pbx-references\">\n      <div class=\"pbx-references-title\">📚 References</div>\n      <ul class=\"pbx-ref-list\">\n        <li>Minneapolis &amp; St. Louis R.R. Co. v. Bombolis, 241 U.S. 211, 217–18 (1916) (explaining that the Seventh Amendment right to a jury trial in civil cases does not apply to the states).</li>\n        <li>McDonald v. City of Chi., 561 U.S. 742, 765 n.13 (2010) (reaffirming that the Seventh Amendment guarantee of a civil jury trial has not been incorporated into the Fourteenth Amendment due process clause).</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "zh-question": "某州法律规定，所有在州法院提起的工伤赔偿诉讼都必须由法官裁决。一名女性因在工作中受伤，在州法院对其雇主提起了工伤赔偿诉讼。该女性要求进行陪审团审判，但法院根据州法律驳回了她的请求。\n\n该州法律是否可能合宪？",
      "zh-choices": {
        "A": "否，因为仅在工伤赔偿诉讼中拒绝陪审团审判违反了法律的平等保护原则。",
        "B": "否，因为Seventh Amendment保障了该女性获得陪审团审判的权利。",
        "C": "否，因为Sixth Amendment要求由陪审团决定案件的结果。",
        "D": "是。"
      },
      "zh-explanation": "<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\r\n<head>\r\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\r\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\r\n    \r\n    <style>\r\n        strong, b {\r\n            display: inline !important; \r\n            white-space: normal !important; \r\n            word-break: normal !important;\n            overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\r\n        }\r\n    </style>\r\n\r\n<style>\r\n        :root {\r\n            --primary-color: #2c3e50;\r\n            --accent-color: #3498db;\r\n            --success-color: #27ae60;\r\n            --warning-color: #e67e22;\r\n            --bg-color: #f4f6f8;\r\n            --card-bg: #ffffff;\r\n            --text-color: #333333;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        body {\r\n            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\r\n            background-color: var(--bg-color);\r\n            margin: 0;\r\n            padding: 10px;\r\n            color: var(--text-color);\r\n            line-height: 1.6;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .container {\r\n            max-width: 480px;\r\n            margin: 0 auto;\r\n            background-color: var(--card-bg);\r\n            border-radius: 12px;\r\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\r\n            overflow: hidden;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .header {\r\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-color), var(--accent-color));\r\n            color: white;\r\n            padding: 20px;\r\n            text-align: center;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .header h1 {\r\n            margin: 0;\r\n            font-size: 20px;\r\n            font-weight: 700;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .header .sub-title {\r\n            font-size: 12px;\r\n            opacity: 0.9;\r\n            margin-top: 5px;\r\n            text-transform: uppercase;\r\n            letter-spacing: 1px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .content {\r\n            padding: 20px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .answer-box {\r\n            background-color: #e8f5e9;\r\n            border: 1px solid #c8e6c9;\r\n            border-radius: 8px;\r\n            padding: 15px;\r\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\r\n            display: flex;\r\n            align-items: center;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .answer-icon {\r\n            font-size: 24px;\r\n            margin-right: 10px;\r\n            color: var(--success-color);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .answer-text {\r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n            color: var(--success-color);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .concept-card {\r\n            background-color: #fff;\r\n            border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-color);\r\n            padding: 15px;\r\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\r\n            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .concept-title {\r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n            color: var(--primary-color);\r\n            margin-bottom: 8px;\r\n            display: flex;\r\n            align-items: center;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .concept-title::before {\r\n            content: \"⚖️\";\r\n            margin-right: 8px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .highlight {\r\n            background-color: #fff3cd;\r\n            padding: 2px 4px;\r\n            border-radius: 3px;\r\n            font-weight: 500;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .exception-list {\r\n            list-style: none;\r\n            padding: 0;\r\n            margin: 10px 0;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .exception-list li {\r\n            background-color: #f8f9fa;\r\n            margin-bottom: 8px;\r\n            padding: 10px;\r\n            border-radius: 6px;\r\n            border: 1px solid #e9ecef;\r\n            font-size: 14px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .exception-list li strong {\r\n            color: var(--warning-color);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .analysis-section {\r\n            margin-top: 20px;\r\n            border-top: 1px solid #eee;\r\n            padding-top: 15px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .analysis-title {\r\n            font-size: 16px;\r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\r\n            color: var(--primary-color);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .wrong-option {\r\n            font-size: 13px;\r\n            color: #666;\r\n            margin-bottom: 8px;\r\n            padding-left: 10px;\r\n            border-left: 2px solid #ddd;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .tip-box {\r\n            background-color: #e3f2fd;\r\n            padding: 15px;\r\n            border-radius: 8px;\r\n            margin-top: 20px;\r\n            font-size: 14px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .tip-title {\r\n            color: var(--accent-color);\r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n            margin-bottom: 5px;\r\n            display: block;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        code {\r\n            background: #eee;\r\n            padding: 2px 4px;\r\n            border-radius: 3px;\r\n            font-family: monospace;\r\n            font-size: 0.9em;\r\n        }\r\n    </style>\r\n    <title>MBE Question Analysis</title>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n    <div class=\"header\">\r\n        <h1>MBE 考点解析</h1>\r\n        <div class=\"sub-title\">Constitutional Law · Individual Rights</div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"content\">\r\n        <!-- Correct Answer Section -->\r\n        <div class=\"answer-box\">\r\n            <div class=\"answer-icon\">✅</div>\r\n            <div>\r\n                <div>正确答案：<span class=\"answer-text\">选项 D (Yes)</span></div>\r\n                <div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #666;\">该州法律是合宪的。</div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Core Legal Concept -->\r\n        <div class=\"concept-card\">\r\n            <div class=\"concept-title\">核心考点：权利法案的“并入” (Incorporation)</div>\r\n            <p>本题考察的是<strong>权利法案 (Bill of Rights)</strong> 中的条款是否适用于州政府。</p>\r\n            <p>虽然大多数权利法案的保护通过<strong>第十四修正案的正当程序条款 (14th Amendment Due Process Clause)</strong> 适用于各州（即“并入”），但仍有少数例外。</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- The Exceptions Visual -->\r\n        <div class=\"concept-card\" style=\"border-left-color: var(--warning-color);\">\r\n            <div class=\"concept-title\" style=\"color: var(--warning-color);\">⚠️ 必须记住的三个例外</div>\r\n            <p style=\"font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">以下权利<strong>尚未</strong>并入第十四修正案，因此<strong>不强制</strong>州法院遵守：</p>\r\n            <ul class=\"exception-list\">\r\n                <li>\r\n                    <strong>Seventh Amendment (第七修正案)</strong><br>\r\n                    民事案件中的陪审团审判权 (Right to jury trial in civil cases)。\r\n                </li>\r\n                <li>\r\n                    <strong>Fifth Amendment (第五修正案)</strong><br>\r\n                    死刑/重罪案件的大陪审团起诉权 (Right to grand jury indictment)。\r\n                </li>\r\n                <li>\r\n                    <strong>Third Amendment (第三修正案)</strong><br>\r\n                    禁止士兵驻扎民宅 (Prohibition against quartering soldiers)。\r\n                </li>\r\n            </ul>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Detailed Analysis -->\r\n        <div class=\"analysis-section\">\r\n            <div class=\"analysis-title\">⚖️ 法律推理</div>\r\n            <p>\r\n                在本案中，原告在<strong>州法院 (State Court)</strong> 提起的是<strong>民事诉讼 (Civil Action)</strong>——即工伤赔偿诉讼。\r\n            </p>\r\n            <p>\r\n                虽然第七修正案 (7th Amendment) 保证在联邦法院的民事案件中享有陪审团审判的权利，但最高法院明确裁定，<span class=\"highlight\">这一权利并未并入第十四修正案</span>。\r\n            </p>\r\n            <p>\r\n                因此，各州有权自行决定是否在民事案件（如工伤赔偿）中提供陪审团。既然该州法律规定由法官裁决，该法律并未违反美国宪法。\r\n            </p>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Why other options are wrong -->\r\n        <div class=\"analysis-section\">\r\n            <div class=\"analysis-title\">❌ 干扰项排除</div>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"wrong-option\">\r\n                <strong>选项 A (Equal Protection):</strong> 错误。虽然该法律区别对待工伤赔偿案件和其他民事案件，但这不涉及“基本权利”或“受保护阶层”。法院仅需适用<strong>合理基础审查 (Rational Basis Review)</strong>。为了司法效率而限制陪审团审判是“合理”的，因此不违宪。\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"wrong-option\">\r\n                <strong>选项 B (7th Amendment):</strong> 错误。如上所述，第七修正案仅约束<strong>联邦法院</strong>，不约束州法院。\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"wrong-option\">\r\n                <strong>选项 C (6th Amendment):</strong> 错误。第六修正案仅适用于<strong>刑事案件 (Criminal Prosecutions)</strong>，本案是民事诉讼。\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Exam Tip -->\r\n        \r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n</html>",
