    {
      "index": 22,
      "subject": "Constitutional Law",
      "chapter": "Individual Rights",
      "topic": "Article IV",
      "count": 120,
      "question": "According to a state law, state employees may be fired only \"for good cause.\" A woman who was both a resident and an employee of the state was summarily fired on the sole ground that she had notified federal officials that the state was not following federal rules governing the administration of certain federally funded state programs on which she worked. The state denied the woman's request for a hearing to allow her to contest the charge. There is no record of any other state employee having been terminated for this reason.\nIn a suit to reinstate her employment, which of the following claims provides the LEAST support for the woman?",
      "choices": {
        "A": "The state's firing of her unconstitutionally abridged her freedom of speech.",
        "B": "The state's firing of her unconstitutionally denied her a privilege or immunity of state citizenship protected by Article IV.",
        "C": "The state's firing of her violated the supremacy clause of Article VI, because it interfered with the enforcement of federal rules.",
        "D": "The state's firing of her without affording her an opportunity for a hearing was an unconstitutional denial of procedural due process."
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "source_img": "source_imgs/q0022.png",
      "explanation": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n  <title>Explanation</title>\n  <style>\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      font-size: 1rem;\n      line-height: 1.7;\n      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n      background: #fff;\n      color: #111;\n    }\n    .pbx-explanation {\n      padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n      max-width: 100%;\n    }\n    .pbx-explanation * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n    .pbx-explanation p {\n      margin: 0 0 1rem 0;\n      word-break: break-word;\n      overflow-wrap: break-word;\n    }\n    .pbx-explanation strong { font-weight: 700; }\n    .pbx-table-wrap { margin: 1rem 0; }\n    .pbx-scroll-x { overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; margin: 16px 0; }\n    table {\n      min-width: 480px;\n      width: 100%;\n      border-collapse: collapse;\n      border: 1px solid #cccccc;\n    }\n    th, td {\n      border: 1px solid #cccccc;\n      padding: 8px 12px;\n      vertical-align: top;\n      text-align: left;\n    }\n    th {\n      background: #f5f5f5;\n      font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .pbx-center { text-align: center; }\n    .pbx-title {\n      font-weight: 700;\n      font-size: 1.1rem;\n    }\n    ul {\n      margin: 0.4rem 0 1rem 1.5rem;\n      padding: 0;\n    }\n    li { margin: 0.15rem 0; }\n    .pbx-edu-objective {\n      background: #f0f7ff;\n      border-left: 4px solid #3498db;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      padding: 14px 18px;\n      margin: 24px 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-edu-objective-title {\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: #2980b9;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n    .pbx-references {\n      background: #fafafa;\n      border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      padding: 14px 18px;\n      margin: 20px 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-references-title {\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: #555;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n    .pbx-ref-list {\n      margin: 0;\n      padding-left: 18px;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      color: #555;\n      line-height: 1.7;\n    }\n    .pbx-choice-correct { border-left: 3px solid #27ae60; padding-left: 10px; }\n    .pbx-choice-wrong { border-left: 3px solid #c0392b; padding-left: 10px; }\n    .pbx-choice-correct-label { color: #1f8f4d; font-weight: 600; }\n    .pbx-choice-wrong-label { color: #9b1c1c; font-weight: 600; }\n    @media (max-width: 640px) {\n      body { font-size: 0.95rem; padding: 0.75rem; }\n      .pbx-explanation { padding: 0.875rem 1rem; }\n      h1, .pbx-title { font-size: 1rem; }\n      th, td { font-size: 0.825rem; padding: 0.5em 0.625em; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<!-- pbx-topic: Article IV -->\n<div class=\"pbx-explanation\">\n  <div class=\"pbx-scroll-x\">\n    <table>\n      <tr>\n        <th colspan=\"2\" class=\"pbx-center\">Privileges &amp; immunities clauses</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <th>Provision</th>\n        <th>Applicability</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"pbx-center\">Article IV</td>\n        <td>\n          <ul>\n            <li>Discrimination against citizens of other states</li>\n            <li>Interference with right of <em>state</em> citizenship</li>\n          </ul>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"pbx-center\">Fourteenth Amendment</td>\n        <td>\n          <ul>\n            <li>Interference with right of <em>national</em> citizenship</li>\n          </ul>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n\n  <p>The <strong>Article IV privileges and immunities clause</strong> prohibits states from <strong>discriminating against citizens of other states</strong> by denying them a <span style=\"font-style: italic;\">right of state citizenship</span>. But this clause does not apply here since (1) the woman is a resident (ie, citizen) of the state that fired her and (2) public employment is not a right of state citizenship. Therefore, this clause provides the least support for the woman in a suit to reinstate her employment.</p>\n\n  <p class=\"pbx-choice-wrong\" data-choice=\"A\" data-choice-role=\"distractor\"><strong class=\"pbx-choice-wrong-label\">(Choice A)</strong> The state fired the woman solely because she notified federal officials that the state was not complying with federal rules. As a result, that firing may have unconstitutionally abridged her right to free speech as a <span style=\"color:#1f8f4d;\">public employee</span>.</p>\n\n  <p class=\"pbx-choice-correct\" data-choice=\"B\" data-choice-role=\"correct\"><strong class=\"pbx-choice-correct-label\">(Choice B)</strong> The state fired the woman solely because she notified federal officials that the state was not complying with federal rules. As a result, that firing may have unconstitutionally abridged her right to free speech as a public employee.</p>\n\n  <p class=\"pbx-choice-wrong\" data-choice=\"C\" data-choice-role=\"distractor\"><strong class=\"pbx-choice-wrong-label\">(Choice C)</strong> The Article VI supremacy clause renders state action void when federal law <span style=\"color:#1f8f4d;\">preempts</span> it—eg, when state action interferes with the achievement of federal objectives. Here, the state's firing of the woman for notifying federal officials that the state was not following federal rules likely interfered with the enforcement of those rules in violation of the supremacy clause.</p>\n\n  <p class=\"pbx-choice-wrong\" data-choice=\"D\" data-choice-role=\"distractor\"><strong class=\"pbx-choice-wrong-label\">(Choice D)</strong> The Fourteenth Amendment right to procedural due process requires states to give persons notice and a meaningful opportunity to be heard when depriving them of <span style=\"color:#1f8f4d;\">life, liberty, or property</span>. And public employees who can only be fired for cause—like the woman—have a property interest in their jobs. Therefore, it was an unconstitutional denial of procedural due process to fire her without giving her an opportunity for a hearing.</p>\n\n  <div class=\"pbx-edu-objective\">\n    <div class=\"pbx-edu-objective-title\">📌 Educational Objective</div>\n    <p>The Article IV privileges and immunities clause prohibits states from discriminating against citizens of other states by denying them a right of state citizenship.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pbx-references\">\n    <div class=\"pbx-references-title\">📚 References</div>\n    <ul class=\"pbx-ref-list\">\n      <li>Paul v. Virginia, 75 U.S. 168, 180 (1869) (holding that the Article IV privileges and immunities clause only applies when a state discriminates against citizens of other states).</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "zh-question": "根据州法律，州雇员只有在“有正当理由”的情况下才能被解雇。一名既是该州居民又是该州雇员的女性，仅因其通知联邦官员该州未遵守管理其所从事的某些联邦资助的州项目的联邦规定，而被立即解雇。该州拒绝了该女性提出的举行听证会以反驳指控的请求。没有记录显示有其他州雇员因此原因被解雇。\n\n在要求恢复其雇佣关系的诉讼中，以下哪项主张为该女性提供的支持最少？",
      "zh-choices": {
        "A": "该州解雇她的行为违宪地剥夺了她的言论自由。",
        "B": "该州解雇她的行为违宪地剥夺了她受 Article IV 保护的州公民身份所享有的特权或豁免权。",
        "C": "该州解雇她的行为违反了 Article VI 的至上条款，因为它干扰了联邦法规的执行。",
        "D": "该州在未给予她听证会机会的情况下解雇她的行为，构成了对程序性正当程序的违宪剥夺。"
      },
      "zh-explanation": "<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\r\n<head>\r\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\r\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\r\n\r\n    <style>\r\n        strong, b {\r\n            display: inline !important; \r\n            white-space: normal !important; \r\n            word-break: normal !important;\n            overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\r\n        }\r\n    </style>\r\n\r\n<style>\r\n    :root {\r\n        --primary-color: #2c3e50;\r\n        --accent-color: #3498db;\r\n        --highlight-bg: #ecf0f1;\r\n        --text-color: #333;\r\n        --correct-green: #27ae60;\r\n        --wrong-red: #c0392b;\r\n        --card-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\r\n    }\r\n    body {\r\n        font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\r\n        line-height: 1.6;\r\n        color: var(--text-color);\r\n        background-color: #f4f7f6;\r\n        margin: 0;\r\n        padding: 20px;\r\n        display: flex;\r\n        justify-content: center;\r\n    }\r\n    .container {\r\n        max-width: 480px; /* 适配手机逻辑宽度 */\r\n        background: #fff;\r\n        border-radius: 12px;\r\n        box-shadow: var(--card-shadow);\r\n        overflow: hidden;\r\n    }\r\n    .header {\r\n        background: var(--primary-color);\r\n        color: #fff;\r\n        padding: 20px;\r\n        text-align: center;\r\n    }\r\n    .header h1 {\r\n        margin: 0;\r\n        font-size: 1.2rem;\r\n        font-weight: 600;\r\n    }\r\n    .header .sub-title {\r\n        font-size: 0.9rem;\r\n        opacity: 0.9;\r\n        margin-top: 5px;\r\n    }\r\n    .content {\r\n        padding: 20px;\r\n    }\r\n    .answer-box {\r\n        background-color: #e8f6f3;\r\n        border-left: 5px solid var(--correct-green);\r\n        padding: 15px;\r\n        margin-bottom: 20px;\r\n        border-radius: 4px;\r\n    }\r\n    .answer-title {\r\n        color: var(--correct-green);\r\n        font-weight: bold;\r\n        margin-bottom: 5px;\r\n        display: block;\r\n    }\r\n    .concept-card {\r\n        background: var(--highlight-bg);\r\n        border-radius: 8px;\r\n        padding: 15px;\r\n        margin-bottom: 20px;\r\n        border: 1px solid #bdc3c7;\r\n    }\r\n    .concept-title {\r\n        font-weight: bold;\r\n        color: var(--primary-color);\r\n        margin-bottom: 10px;\r\n        border-bottom: 2px solid var(--accent-color);\r\n        display: inline-block;\r\n        padding-bottom: 3px;\r\n    }\r\n    .latin {\r\n        font-style: italic;\r\n        color: #555;\r\n    }\r\n    .english-term {\r\n        font-size: 0.9em;\r\n        color: #7f8c8d;\r\n        background: #eee;\r\n        padding: 2px 4px;\r\n        border-radius: 3px;\r\n        margin-left: 4px;\r\n    }\r\n    .analysis-section h3 {\r\n        font-size: 1.1rem;\r\n        color: var(--primary-color);\r\n        margin-top: 20px;\r\n        margin-bottom: 10px;\r\n    }\r\n    .option-analysis {\r\n        margin-bottom: 15px;\r\n        padding-bottom: 15px;\r\n        border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\r\n    }\r\n    .option-analysis:last-child {\r\n        border-bottom: none;\r\n    }\r\n    .badge {\r\n        display: inline-block;\r\n        padding: 3px 8px;\r\n        border-radius: 12px;\r\n        font-size: 0.8rem;\r\n        font-weight: bold;\r\n        color: white;\r\n        margin-right: 8px;\r\n    }\r\n    .badge-weak { background-color: var(--wrong-red); }\r\n    .badge-strong { background-color: var(--correct-green); }\r\n    \r\n    .exam-tip {\r\n        background: #fff8e1;\r\n        border: 1px solid #ffe082;\r\n        padding: 15px;\r\n        border-radius: 8px;\r\n        font-size: 0.95rem;\r\n    }\r\n    .exam-tip-title {\r\n        font-weight: bold;\r\n        color: #f57f17;\r\n        margin-bottom: 5px;\r\n        display: block;\r\n    }\r\n</style>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n    <div class=\"header\">\r\n        <h1>MBE 考点解析</h1>\r\n        <div class=\"sub-title\">宪法：个人权利 (Individual Rights)</div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"content\">\r\n        <!-- 核心答案 -->\r\n        <div class=\"answer-box\">\r\n            <span class=\"answer-title\">正确答案：选项 B</span>\r\n            题目要求选出<strong>支持力度最小 (LEAST support)</strong> 的主张。选项 B 关于 Article IV 特权与豁免权条款的主张在法律上完全站不住脚，因此是正确答案。\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 核心考点深度解析 -->\r\n        <div class=\"concept-card\">\r\n            <div class=\"concept-title\">核心考点：Article IV 特权与豁免权</div>\r\n            <p><strong>Article IV Privileges and Immunities Clause</strong>（也称为 Comity Clause）的核心规则是：</p>\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li><strong>禁止歧视外州人：</strong> 禁止各州在基本权利或重要经济活动上，歧视<strong>其他州的公民</strong> (Citizens of other states)。</li>\r\n                <li><strong>适用前提：</strong> 原告必须是<strong>非居民</strong> (Non-resident)。</li>\r\n            </ul>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"analysis-section\">\r\n            <h3>为什么选项 B 支持力度最小？</h3>\r\n            <div class=\"option-analysis\">\r\n                <span class=\"badge badge-weak\">法律依据不足</span>\r\n                <p>在本案中，原告不仅是该州的雇员，更是<strong>该州的居民 (Resident)</strong>。</p>\r\n                <p>Article IV 的特权与豁免权条款旨在保护“外地人”免受“本地人”的歧视。既然原告是本州居民，该条款根本不适用 (Inapplicable)。她不能起诉自己的州违反了保护外州人的条款。</p>\r\n                <p>因此，这项主张在法律上是死胡同，提供的支持最少。</p>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <h3>为什么其他选项是有力支持？</h3>\r\n            <p style=\"font-size: 0.9rem; color: #666;\">题目问的是“最少支持”，意味着其他三个选项在法律上都是站得住脚的（即如果作为原告律师，你会优先使用这些论点）。</p>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"option-analysis\">\r\n                <span class=\"badge badge-strong\">选项 A：言论自由</span>\r\n                <p><strong>Free Speech</strong></p>\r\n                <p>公职人员 (Public Employee) 就<strong>公共利益 (Public Concern)</strong> 发表言论受第一修正案保护。揭发政府滥用联邦资金显然涉及公共利益。因此，因言获罪构成违宪。</p>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"option-analysis\">\r\n                <span class=\"badge badge-strong\">选项 C：至上条款</span>\r\n                <p><strong>Supremacy Clause</strong></p>\r\n                <p>如果州政府因雇员遵守或报告联邦规则而将其解雇，这种行为会阻碍联邦法律的执行 (Obstacle to the execution of federal law)。根据至上条款，联邦法优于州法/州行为，因此该解雇行为可能无效。</p>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"option-analysis\">\r\n                <span class=\"badge badge-strong\">选项 D：程序性正当程序</span>\r\n                <p><strong>Procedural Due Process</strong></p>\r\n                <p>这是最强的论点之一：\r\n                <ol>\r\n                    <li><strong>财产权益 (Property Interest)：</strong> 法律规定只能“因正当理由” (For good cause) 解雇，这赋予了雇员对自己职位的财产权益。</li>\r\n                    <li><strong>正当程序：</strong> 剥夺财产权益前，必须给予<strong>通知 (Notice)</strong> 和<strong>听证机会 (Hearing)</strong>。</li>\r\n                </ol>\r\n                本案中，州政府拒绝给予听证机会，直接违反了第十四修正案的正当程序条款。</p>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 考试技巧 -->\r\n        <div class=\"exam-tip\">\r\n            <span class=\"exam-tip-title\">💡 MBE 提分技巧</span>\r\n            <p><strong>1. 警惕 \"LEAST Support\" 题型：</strong> 这类题目实际上是在找“错误”或“无关”的法律理论。你需要找出那个在给定的事实模式下完全无法适用的选项。</p>\r\n            <p><strong>2. 区分两个 P&I 条款：</strong></p>\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li><strong>Article IV P&I:</strong> 保护<strong>外州人</strong>不受歧视（常考）。</li>\r\n                <li><strong>14th Amendment P&I:</strong> 保护<strong>国家公民</strong>权利（如跨州迁徙权），极少适用（除了 <i>Saenz v. Roe</i> 等少数判例），通常是错误选项的陪跑员。</li>\r\n            </ul>\r\n            <p><strong>口诀：</strong> 本州人告本州，不用 Article IV。</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n</html>",
      "meta": {
