    {
      "index": 25,
      "subject": "Constitutional Law",
      "chapter": "Individual Rights",
      "topic": "Regulation of Content",
      "count": 120,
      "question": "A city ordinance prohibited individuals from picketing in residential neighborhoods unless the picketing related to the neighborhood zoning requirements. This exception to the ordinance was adopted in response to local citizens' strong views about proposed rezoning of residential neighborhoods.\nA group that wished to picket in front of a business owner's home because of the business owner's employment practices challenged the ordinance as unconstitutional under the First Amendment.\nWill the group's challenge likely prevail?",
      "choices": {
        "A": "No, because the ordinance is a content-neutral regulation of speech.",
        "B": "No, because the ordinance regulates conduct rather than speech.",
        "C": "Yes, because the ordinance irrationally discriminates between different types of protesters.",
        "D": "Yes, because the ordinance is a content-based regulation of speech."
      },
      "answer": "D",
      "source_img": "source_imgs/q0025.png",
      "explanation": "<!doctype html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n  <title>Explanation</title>\n  <style>\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      font-size: 1rem;\n      line-height: 1.7;\n      background: #ffffff;\n      color: #222;\n      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    }\n    .pbx-explanation {\n      padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n      max-width: 100%;\n      overflow-wrap: break-word;\n      word-break: break-word;\n    }\n    .pbx-scroll-x {\n      overflow-x: auto;\n      -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\n      margin: 16px 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-flow-inner {\n      min-width: 760px;\n      padding: 8px 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-flowchart {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 760px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n      color: #222;\n    }\n    .pbx-flow-box {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n      background: #f7f8fb;\n      border-radius: 14px;\n      box-shadow: 0 3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);\n      padding: 0.95em 1.15em;\n      text-align: center;\n      font-size: 1rem;\n      line-height: 1.35;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: #222;\n    }\n    .pbx-flow-box .pbx-sub {\n      display: block;\n      font-weight: 400;\n      font-size: 0.92rem;\n      margin-top: 0.15rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-flow-box.small {\n      font-weight: 700;\n    }\n    .pbx-flow-box.grey {\n      background: #e8e8ea;\n    }\n    .pbx-top {\n      width: 220px;\n      margin: 0 auto 1.75rem auto;\n    }\n    .pbx-branch-line {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 460px;\n      margin: 0 auto 1.2rem auto;\n      height: 46px;\n    }\n    .pbx-branch-line::before {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 50%;\n      top: 0;\n      bottom: 14px;\n      width: 2px;\n      background: #444;\n      transform: translateX(-50%);\n    }\n    .pbx-branch-line::after {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 0;\n      right: 0;\n      bottom: 14px;\n      height: 2px;\n      background: #444;\n    }\n    .pbx-arrow-down {\n      position: absolute;\n      bottom: 0;\n      width: 0;\n      height: 0;\n      border-left: 6px solid transparent;\n      border-right: 6px solid transparent;\n      border-top: 11px solid #444;\n    }\n    .pbx-arrow-left { left: 0; transform: translateY(8px) rotate(180deg); }\n    .pbx-arrow-right { right: 0; transform: translateY(8px); }\n    .pbx-col-wrap {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      align-items: flex-start;\n      gap: 28px;\n      margin-top: 0.5rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-col {\n      width: 340px;\n      position: relative;\n    }\n    .pbx-col .pbx-flow-box {\n      margin: 0 auto;\n    }\n    .pbx-col .pbx-arrow-vertical {\n      width: 2px;\n      height: 40px;\n      background: #444;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      position: relative;\n    }\n    .pbx-col .pbx-arrow-vertical::after {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 50%;\n      bottom: -1px;\n      transform: translateX(-50%);\n      border-left: 6px solid transparent;\n      border-right: 6px solid transparent;\n      border-top: 11px solid #444;\n    }\n    .pbx-bottom-center {\n      width: 230px;\n      margin: 1rem auto 0 auto;\n    }\n    .pbx-down-connector {\n      width: 2px;\n      height: 28px;\n      background: #444;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      position: relative;\n    }\n    .pbx-down-connector::after {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 50%;\n      bottom: -1px;\n      transform: translateX(-50%);\n      border-left: 6px solid transparent;\n      border-right: 6px solid transparent;\n      border-top: 11px solid #444;\n    }\n    .pbx-body-text p {\n      margin: 0 0 1.05rem 0;\n      font-size: 1rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-body-text strong { font-weight: 700; }\n    .pbx-body-text em { font-style: italic; }\n    .pbx-body-text .pbx-choice {\n      display: block;\n      margin: 0.95rem 0 0.85rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-body-text .pbx-choice strong {\n      font-weight: 700;\n    }\n    .pbx-edu-objective {\n      background: #f0f7ff;\n      border-left: 4px solid #3498db;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      padding: 14px 18px;\n      margin: 24px 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-edu-objective-title {\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: #2980b9;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n    .pbx-references {\n      background: #fafafa;\n      border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      padding: 14px 18px;\n      margin: 20px 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-references-title {\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: #555;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n    .pbx-ref-list {\n      margin: 0;\n      padding-left: 18px;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      color: #555;\n      line-height: 1.7;\n    }\n    @media (max-width: 640px) {\n      body { font-size: 0.95rem; padding: 0.75rem; }\n      .pbx-explanation { padding: 0.875rem 1rem; }\n      .pbx-body-text p { font-size: 0.95rem; }\n      .pbx-flowchart { width: 760px; }\n      .pbx-flow-inner { min-width: 760px; }\n      .pbx-flow-box { font-size: 0.95rem; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<!-- pbx-topic: Regulation of Content -->\n<div class=\"pbx-explanation\">\n  <div class=\"pbx-scroll-x\">\n    <div class=\"pbx-flow-inner\">\n      <div class=\"pbx-flowchart\">\n        <div class=\"pbx-top pbx-flow-box\">Free speech analysis</div>\n        <div class=\"pbx-branch-line\">\n          <div class=\"pbx-arrow-down pbx-arrow-left\"></div>\n          <div class=\"pbx-arrow-down pbx-arrow-right\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"pbx-col-wrap\">\n          <div class=\"pbx-col\">\n            <div class=\"pbx-flow-box small\">Content-based restriction<span class=\"pbx-sub\">(message, subject, or idea)</span></div>\n            <div class=\"pbx-arrow-vertical\"></div>\n            <div class=\"pbx-flow-box grey\">Strict scrutiny<span class=\"pbx-sub\">(least restrictive means)</span><span class=\"pbx-sub\">• Necessary &amp; narrowly tailored to compelling interest</span></div>\n            <div class=\"pbx-arrow-vertical\"></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"pbx-col\">\n            <div class=\"pbx-flow-box small\">Content-neutral restriction<span class=\"pbx-sub\">(time, place, or manner)</span></div>\n            <div class=\"pbx-arrow-vertical\"></div>\n            <div class=\"pbx-flow-box grey\">Intermediate scrutiny<span class=\"pbx-sub\">(no greater than necessary)</span><span class=\"pbx-sub\">• Narrowly tailored to substantial interest</span><span class=\"pbx-sub\">• Alternative avenues of communication</span></div>\n            <div class=\"pbx-arrow-vertical\"></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"pbx-bottom-center pbx-flow-box\">Exception<span class=\"pbx-sub\">(nonpublic forum + viewpoint-neutral)</span></div>\n        <div class=\"pbx-down-connector\"></div>\n        <div class=\"pbx-bottom-center pbx-flow-box grey\">Rational basis<span class=\"pbx-sub\">• Reasonably related to legitimate interest</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pbx-body-text\">\n    <p>The First Amendment's preeminent task is to protect the free flow of ideas, so <strong>content-based restrictions</strong> on speech are <strong>presumptively unconstitutional</strong> and subject to <strong>strict scrutiny</strong>. As a result, the government can only regulate speech based on what is said (ie, its message or ideas) by showing that the regulation is <strong>necessary and narrowly tailored</strong> to achieve a <strong>compelling government interest</strong>—a nearly impossible task.</p>\n\n    <p>The ordinance here is a content-based regulation because it allows speech on one topic (neighborhood zoning requirements) but no other. And since it is highly unlikely that the ordinance can survive strict scrutiny, the group's challenge will likely prevail.</p>\n\n    <p class=\"pbx-choice\" data-choice=\"A\" data-choice-role=\"distractor\"><strong style=\"color:#9b1c1c;\">(Choice A)</strong> Unlike content-based restrictions (as seen here), content-neutral regulations are constitutional if they pass intermediate scrutiny—ie, the government proves that the regulation (1) is narrowly tailored to achieve an important or substantial government interest and (2) leaves open alternative channels of communication.*</p>\n\n    <p><em>*Content-neutral restrictions that likely satisfy intermediate scrutiny include those penalizing trespasses on private property and prohibiting protests on streets during rush-hour traffic.</em></p>\n\n    <p class=\"pbx-choice\" data-choice=\"B\" data-choice-role=\"distractor\"><strong style=\"color:#9b1c1c;\">(Choice B)</strong> A person's conduct is protected by the First Amendment if it is expressive—ie, (1) the person intends to communicate a message and (2) the audience is likely to understand that message. And since the ordinance unjustifiably restricts the expressive aspect of picketing, it is likely unconstitutional.</p>\n\n    <p class=\"pbx-choice\" data-choice=\"C\" data-choice-role=\"distractor\"><strong style=\"color:#9b1c1c;\">(Choice C)</strong> Had the ordinance regulated a <span style=\"color:#1e73be;\">nonpublic forum</span>, rational basis scrutiny would require the group to show that the ordinance irrationally discriminates between different types of protesters. However, residential neighborhoods are <em>public forums</em> because they contain public streets and sidewalks.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"pbx-edu-objective\">\n      <div class=\"pbx-edu-objective-title\">📌 Educational Objective</div>\n      <p>Since content-based restrictions on speech are heavily disfavored, they are unconstitutional unless they survive strict scrutiny—ie, the government proves that the restriction is necessary and narrowly tailored to achieve a compelling government interest.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"pbx-references\">\n      <div class=\"pbx-references-title\">📚 References</div>\n      <ul class=\"pbx-ref-list\">\n        <li>United States v. Playboy Entm't Group, 529 U.S. 803, 816–17 (2000) (explaining that content-based restrictions on speech require the government to satisfy strict scrutiny).</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "zh-question": "一项市政条例禁止个人在居民区进行纠察示威，除非该示威与社区的区划要求有关。条例的这项例外规定是为了回应当地居民对居民区拟议重新区划的强烈意见而通过的。\n\n一个团体因某企业主的雇佣行为而希望在其家门前进行纠察示威，该团体以该条例违反《First Amendment》为由，质疑其合宪性。\n\n该团体的质疑是否可能成功？",
      "zh-choices": {
        "A": "不会，因为该条例是一项内容中立的言论规制。",
        "B": "不会，因为该条例规制的是行为而非言论。",
        "C": "会，因为该条例不合理地歧视不同类型的抗议者。",
        "D": "会，因为该条例是一项基于内容的言论规制。"
      },
      "zh-explanation": "<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\r\n<head>\r\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\r\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\r\n    \r\n    <style>\r\n        strong, b {\r\n            display: inline !important; \r\n            white-space: normal !important; \r\n            word-break: normal !important;\n            overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\r\n        }\r\n    </style>\r\n\r\n<style>\r\n        :root {\r\n            --primary-color: #2c3e50; /* Navy Blue */\r\n            --accent-color: #e74c3c; /* Red for emphasis */\r\n            --highlight-bg: #ecf0f1; /* Light Gray */\r\n            --success-color: #27ae60; /* Green */\r\n            --text-color: #333;\r\n            --card-bg: #ffffff;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        body {\r\n            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\r\n            background-color: #f4f4f4;\r\n            margin: 0;\r\n            padding: 20px;\r\n            display: flex;\r\n            justify-content: center;\r\n            color: var(--text-color);\r\n            line-height: 1.6;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .container {\r\n            max-width: 480px;\r\n            width: 100%;\r\n            background: var(--card-bg);\r\n            border-radius: 12px;\r\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\r\n            overflow: hidden;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .header {\r\n            background: var(--primary-color);\r\n            color: white;\r\n            padding: 20px;\r\n            text-align: center;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .header h1 {\r\n            margin: 0;\r\n            font-size: 20px;\r\n            font-weight: 700;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .header .subtitle {\r\n            font-size: 14px;\r\n            opacity: 0.9;\r\n            margin-top: 5px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .content {\r\n            padding: 20px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .concept-box {\r\n            background-color: #e8f4fd;\r\n            border-left: 5px solid #3498db;\r\n            padding: 15px;\r\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\r\n            border-radius: 4px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .concept-title {\r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n            color: #2980b9;\r\n            margin-bottom: 5px;\r\n            display: block;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .analysis-step {\r\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .step-number {\r\n            display: inline-block;\r\n            background: var(--primary-color);\r\n            color: white;\r\n            width: 24px;\r\n            height: 24px;\r\n            border-radius: 50%;\r\n            text-align: center;\r\n            line-height: 24px;\r\n            font-size: 14px;\r\n            margin-right: 8px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n.term {\n            background: transparent;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(36, 52, 71, 0.26);\n            padding: 0 1px 1px;\n            border-radius: 0;\n            font-size: 1em;\n            font-weight: 800;\n            white-space: normal;\n        }\r\n\r\n        .english {\r\n            font-style: italic;\r\n            color: #7f8c8d;\r\n            font-size: 0.9em;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .case-law {\r\n            background-color: #fff8e1;\r\n            border: 1px solid #ffe0b2;\r\n            padding: 12px;\r\n            border-radius: 8px;\r\n            margin: 15px 0;\r\n            font-size: 0.95em;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .case-title {\r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n            color: #d35400;\r\n            display: block;\r\n            margin-bottom: 4px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .correct-answer {\r\n            background-color: #dff0d8;\r\n            border: 1px solid #d6e9c6;\r\n            color: #3c763d;\r\n            padding: 15px;\r\n            border-radius: 8px;\r\n            margin-top: 20px;\r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .wrong-option {\r\n            margin-top: 10px;\r\n            padding: 10px;\r\n            background-color: #f9f9f9;\r\n            border-left: 3px solid #bdc3c7;\r\n            font-size: 0.9em;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .mbe-tip {\r\n            margin-top: 25px;\r\n            padding: 15px;\r\n            background: var(--primary-color);\r\n            color: white;\r\n            border-radius: 8px;\r\n            font-size: 0.95em;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .mbe-tip strong {\r\n            color: #f1c40f;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n    </style>\r\n    <title>MBE 解析</title>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n    <div class=\"header\">\r\n        <h1>MBE 考点解析</h1>\r\n        <div class=\"subtitle\">Constitutional Law: First Amendment</div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"content\">\r\n        <!-- 核心考点 -->\r\n        <div class=\"concept-box\">\r\n            <span class=\"concept-title\">核心考点：基于内容的规制 (Content-Based Regulation)</span>\r\n            当政府根据言论的主题或信息内容来限制言论时，这种限制被视为“基于内容的”。此类限制通常被推定为违宪。\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 逻辑推演 -->\r\n        <div class=\"analysis-step\">\r\n            <span class=\"step-number\">1</span>\r\n            <strong>识别论坛类型：</strong><br>\r\n            居民区的街道和人行道属于<span class=\"term\">传统公共论坛 (Traditional Public Forum)</span>。在这里，政府对言论的限制受到最严格的约束。\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"analysis-step\">\r\n            <span class=\"step-number\">2</span>\r\n            <strong>分析限制的性质：</strong><br>\r\n            本题中的条例禁止纠察示威，但<b>例外允许</b>涉及“区划要求” (zoning requirements) 的示威。\r\n            <br><br>\r\n            这意味着警察必须听示威者在说什么（内容），才能决定是否逮捕他们。如果谈论“区划”，合法；如果谈论“雇佣行为”，非法。这就是典型的<span class=\"term\">基于内容的规制 (Content-Based Regulation)</span>。\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"analysis-step\">\r\n            <span class=\"step-number\">3</span>\r\n            <strong>适用审查标准：</strong><br>\r\n            基于内容的言论规制必须通过<span class=\"term\">严格审查 (Strict Scrutiny)</span>。\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li>政府必须证明该限制是为实现<b>紧迫的政府利益 (Compelling Government Interest)</b>。</li>\r\n                <li>且手段必须是<b>狭义定制的 (Narrowly Tailored)</b>。</li>\r\n            </ul>\r\n            这种标准极难满足，因此该条例极可能违宪。\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 判例依据 -->\r\n        <div class=\"case-law\">\r\n            <span class=\"case-title\">⚖️ 经典判例：Carey v. Brown (1980)</span>\r\n            美国最高法院曾推翻了一项类似的伊利诺伊州法规，该法规禁止在居民区进行纠察，但豁免了劳资纠纷的纠察。法院裁定，这种基于主题（Subject Matter）的区别对待违反了第一修正案。\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 正确答案 -->\r\n        <div class=\"correct-answer\">\r\n            ✅ 正确答案：D<br>\r\n            会胜诉，因为该条例是一项基于内容的言论规制。\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 错误选项辨析 -->\r\n        <div class=\"wrong-option\">\r\n            <strong>❌ 选项 A (内容中立)：</strong><br>\r\n            如果条例禁止<b>所有</b>居民区纠察（无论主题如何），那才是内容中立的（如 <i>Frisby v. Schultz</i> 案）。本题中的“例外条款”破坏了中立性。\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"wrong-option\">\r\n            <strong>❌ 选项 B (行为 vs 言论)：</strong><br>\r\n            纠察 (Picketing) 被视为<span class=\"english\">Expressive Conduct</span>（表达性行为），受第一修正案保护。政府不能随意禁止。\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"wrong-option\">\r\n            <strong>❌ 选项 C (不合理歧视)：</strong><br>\r\n            虽然结论是对的（会胜诉），但理由中的标准太低。这里不仅仅是“不合理” (Irrational)，而是未能通过“严格审查”。选项 C 暗示的是合理基础审查 (Rational Basis Review)，这不适用于公共论坛的言论限制。\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 考试技巧 -->\r\n        <div class=\"mbe-tip\">\r\n            <strong>💡 MBE 提分技巧</strong><br>\r\n            看到言论限制题，先问自己：<b>“警察需要听内容才能开罚单吗？”</b>\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li>如果需要（如本题，需区分是谈区划还是谈雇佣），则是<b>基于内容</b> ➔ 严格审查 ➔ 通常违宪。</li>\r\n                <li>如果不需要（如“禁止在午夜后使用扩音器”），则是<b>内容中立</b> ➔ 中度审查 (Intermediate Scrutiny)。</li>\r\n            </ul>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n</html>",
      "meta": {
