    {
      "index": 26,
      "subject": "Constitutional Law",
      "chapter": "Individual Rights",
      "topic": "Fundamental rights",
      "count": 120,
      "question": "Congress enacted a statute authorizing the denial of all federal funding to public school districts in which a specified percentage of the students enrolled in the public schools fail to pass a national achievement test. According to the terms of the federal statute, the first national achievement test was scheduled for administration five years from the effective date of the statute.\nAfter reviewing then-current levels of public school student performance, the officials of a state became concerned that several of its public school districts would lose their federal funding after the administration of the first national achievement test. Then-current levels of private school student performance were substantially higher.\nIn order to improve the chances of those school districts retaining their federal funding, the state recently enacted a law that requires all children of elementary and secondary school age to attend the schools operated by their respective local public school districts. The law is to take effect at the beginning of the next school year.\nParents of children enrolled in private schools within the state have filed suit to challenge the constitutionality of this state law.\nShould the court uphold the law?",
      "choices": {
        "A": "No, because it is not necessary to further a compelling state interest.",
        "B": "No, because it is not rationally related to a legitimate state interest.",
        "C": "Yes, because it is necessary to further a compelling state interest.",
        "D": "Yes, because it is rationally related to a legitimate state interest."
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "source_img": "source_imgs/q0026.png",
      "explanation": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n  <title>Explanation</title>\n  <style>\n    body{\n      margin:0;\n      font-size:1rem;\n      line-height:1.7;\n      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n      color:#222;\n      background:#fff;\n    }\n    .pbx-explanation{\n      padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;\n      max-width: 980px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n    .pbx-explanation h1,\n    .pbx-explanation h2,\n    .pbx-explanation h3,\n    .pbx-explanation p{\n      margin:0 0 1rem 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-figure{\n      width:100%;\n      margin:0 0 1.25rem 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-diagram-title{\n      text-align:center;\n      font-size:1.9rem;\n      font-weight:700;\n      margin:1rem 0 1.5rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-flow-wrap{\n      width:100%;\n      overflow-x:auto;\n      -webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;\n      margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-flow-inner{\n      min-width: 760px;\n      padding: 0.25rem 0 0.5rem;\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n    .pbx-box{\n      box-sizing:border-box;\n      width:100%;\n      border-radius: 14px;\n      border: 1px solid #d9d9d9;\n      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);\n      background:#f8f9fb;\n      padding:1em 1.25em;\n    }\n    .pbx-box-header{\n      background:#d9d9d9;\n      color:#222;\n      font-weight:700;\n      text-align:center;\n      padding:0.55em 1em;\n      border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;\n      margin:-1em -1.25em 0.85em;\n      font-size:1.05rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-top-card{\n      width: 360px;\n      margin: 0 auto 1.25rem;\n      text-align:center;\n      background:#f3f5f8;\n      border-radius: 16px;\n      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);\n      padding: 1rem 1.2rem;\n      font-size: 1.15rem;\n      font-weight: 500;\n    }\n    .pbx-top-card strong{font-weight:700;}\n    .pbx-branch-labels{\n      display:flex;\n      justify-content:space-between;\n      align-items:center;\n      width: 520px;\n      margin:0 auto 0.2rem;\n      font-size:1rem;\n      color:#333;\n    }\n    .pbx-connector{\n      width: 520px;\n      height: 46px;\n      margin: 0 auto 0.6rem;\n      position:relative;\n    }\n    .pbx-connector:before{\n      content:\"\";\n      position:absolute;\n      left:50%;\n      top:0;\n      bottom:0;\n      width:2px;\n      background:#666;\n    }\n    .pbx-connector:after{\n      content:\"\";\n      position:absolute;\n      left:0;\n      right:0;\n      top:22px;\n      height:2px;\n      background:#666;\n    }\n    .pbx-branch-grid{\n      display:flex;\n      gap:3rem;\n      justify-content:center;\n      align-items:flex-start;\n    }\n    .pbx-card{\n      width: 340px;\n      background:#f1f1f1;\n      border-radius: 16px;\n      box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.14);\n      overflow:hidden;\n    }\n    .pbx-card-body{\n      padding: 0.95rem 1.25rem 1.1rem;\n      font-size:1.05rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-card ul{\n      margin:0.3rem 0 0 1.25rem;\n      padding:0;\n    }\n    .pbx-card li{ margin: 0.15rem 0; }\n    .pbx-down-arrow{\n      text-align:center;\n      font-size:2rem;\n      line-height:1;\n      color:#444;\n      margin:0.35rem 0 0.2rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-stacked{\n      display:flex;\n      flex-direction:column;\n      align-items:center;\n    }\n    .pbx-text{\n      font-size:1rem;\n      line-height:1.75;\n      margin: 0 0 1rem 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-text strong{font-weight:700;}\n    .pbx-text em{font-style:italic;}\n    .pbx-text .pbx-linkish{ color:#1a73e8; text-decoration:none; }\n    .pbx-note{\n      font-size:0.98rem;\n      line-height:1.75;\n      margin: 0 0 1rem 0;\n      font-style:italic;\n    }\n    .pbx-edu-objective{\n      background: #f0f7ff;\n      border-left: 4px solid #3498db;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      padding: 14px 18px;\n      margin: 24px 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-edu-objective-title{\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: #2980b9;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n    .pbx-references{\n      background: #fafafa;\n      border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      padding: 14px 18px;\n      margin: 20px 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-references-title{\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: #555;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n    .pbx-ref-list{\n      margin: 0;\n      padding-left: 18px;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      color: #555;\n      line-height: 1.7;\n    }\n    @media (max-width: 640px){\n      body{ font-size:0.95rem; }\n      .pbx-explanation{ padding:0.875rem 1rem; }\n      .pbx-diagram-title{ font-size:1.55rem; }\n      .pbx-top-card{ width: 320px; }\n      .pbx-branch-labels, .pbx-connector{ width: 680px; }\n      .pbx-branch-grid{ width: 680px; }\n      .pbx-card{ width: 300px; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<!-- pbx-topic: Fundamental rights -->\n  <div class=\"pbx-explanation\">\n    <div class=\"pbx-diagram-title\">Substantive due process</div>\n\n    <div class=\"pbx-flow-wrap\">\n      <div class=\"pbx-flow-inner\">\n        <div class=\"pbx-top-card\">Deprivation of life, liberty, or<br/>property impacts:</div>\n\n        <div class=\"pbx-branch-labels\">\n          <div>Default</div>\n          <div>Exception</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"pbx-connector\"></div>\n\n        <div class=\"pbx-branch-grid\">\n          <div class=\"pbx-stacked\">\n            <div class=\"pbx-card\">\n              <div class=\"pbx-box-header\">Ordinary right</div>\n              <div class=\"pbx-card-body\">\n                <ul>\n                  <li>Economic</li>\n                  <li>Employment</li>\n                  <li>Education</li>\n                  <li>Social welfare</li>\n                </ul>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"pbx-down-arrow\">↓</div>\n            <div class=\"pbx-card\">\n              <div class=\"pbx-box-header\">Rational basis</div>\n              <div class=\"pbx-card-body\">\n                <em>Challenger must show:</em>\n                <ul>\n                  <li>no rational relation to</li>\n                  <li>any legitimate interest</li>\n                </ul>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"pbx-stacked\">\n            <div class=\"pbx-card\">\n              <div class=\"pbx-box-header\">Fundamental right</div>\n              <div class=\"pbx-card-body\">\n                <ul>\n                  <li>First Amendment rights</li>\n                  <li>Voting</li>\n                  <li>Interstate travel</li>\n                  <li>Privacy</li>\n                </ul>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"pbx-down-arrow\">↓</div>\n            <div class=\"pbx-card\">\n              <div class=\"pbx-box-header\">Strict scrutiny</div>\n              <div class=\"pbx-card-body\">\n                <em>Government must show:</em>\n                <ul>\n                  <li>necessary to achieve</li>\n                  <li>compelling interest</li>\n                </ul>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"pbx-text\">Fourteenth Amendment <strong>substantive due process</strong> principles prevent states from depriving individuals of life, liberty, or property without adequate justification. State laws that substantially impair a <span class=\"pbx-linkish\">fundamental right</span>—eg, the <strong>right to privacy</strong>, which encompasses parents' right to control their children's upbringing and education*—must undergo <strong>strict scrutiny</strong>. This difficult test requires the state to show that its <strong>law is necessary</strong> to achieve a <strong>compelling state interest</strong>.</p>\n\n    <p class=\"pbx-text\">Here, the state law substantially impairs parents' fundamental right to control their children's upbringing and education by requiring all children to attend public school. And though the state may have a compelling interest in raising test scores to retain federal funding, the law is <strong>not necessary</strong> to further that interest. This is because the state can do so with less restrictive measures—eg, improving teaching and test preparation in public schools <strong>(Choice C)</strong>. Therefore, the law should not be upheld under strict scrutiny.</p>\n\n    <p class=\"pbx-note\">*The right to education is an ordinary right that is subject to rational basis review. But this right has not been impaired by the state law because each child is still receiving an education through the public school system.</p>\n\n    <p class=\"pbx-text\"><strong>(Choices B &amp; D)</strong> The law is rationally related to the state's legitimate interest in raising test scores to retain federal funding. But the easy-to-pass rational basis test does not apply here since the law substantially impairs a fundamental right.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"pbx-edu-objective\">\n      <div class=\"pbx-edu-objective-title\">📌 Educational Objective</div>\n      <p class=\"pbx-text\" style=\"margin:0;\">Laws that substantially impair a fundamental right—eg, parents' right to control their children's upbringing and education—can be challenged on substantive due process grounds. Such laws are reviewed under strict scrutiny and rarely survive.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"pbx-references\">\n      <div class=\"pbx-references-title\">📚 References</div>\n      <ul class=\"pbx-ref-list\">\n        <li>Pierce v. Soc'y of Sisters, 268 U.S. 510, 534–35 (1925) (holding that a law eliminating private schools violates the fundamental right of parents to direct the upbringing and education of their children).</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "zh-question": "国会颁布了一项法规，授权对那些在全国性学业成绩测试中，有特定比例在册学生未能通过的公立学区，拒绝拨付所有联邦资金。\n\n根据该联邦法规的条款，首次全国性学业成绩测试定于该法规生效之日起五年后举行。\n\n在审查了当时公立学校学生的学业表现水平后，某州官员开始担忧，在首次全国性学业成绩测试举行后，其州内几个公立学区将会失去联邦资金。当时，私立学校学生的学业表现水平要高得多。\n\n为了提高这些学区保留其联邦资金的机会，该州最近颁布了一项法律，要求所有中小学学龄儿童必须就读于其各自地方公立学区运营的学校。该法律将于下一学年开始时生效。\n\n州内就读于私立学校的儿童的家长已经提起诉讼，以质疑该州法律的合宪性。\n\n法院应否维持该法律？",
      "zh-choices": {
        "A": "否，因为它并非为促进一项迫切的州利益所必需。",
        "B": "否，因为它与一项合法的州利益没有理性关联。",
        "C": "是，因为它是为促进一项迫切的州利益所必需的。",
        "D": "是，因为它与一项合法的州利益有理性关联。"
      },
      "zh-explanation": "<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\r\n<head>\r\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\r\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\r\n    \r\n    <style>\r\n        strong, b {\r\n            display: inline !important; \r\n            white-space: normal !important; \r\n            word-break: normal !important;\n            overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\r\n        }\r\n    </style>\r\n\r\n<style>\r\n        body {\r\n            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\r\n            background-color: #f4f4f9;\r\n            margin: 0;\r\n            padding: 20px;\r\n            display: flex;\r\n            justify-content: center;\r\n        }\r\n        .card {\r\n            background-color: #ffffff;\r\n            width: 100%;\r\n            max-width: 480px;\r\n            border-radius: 12px;\r\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\r\n            overflow: hidden;\r\n            border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;\r\n        }\r\n        .header {\r\n            background-color: #2c3e50;\r\n            color: #ffffff;\r\n            padding: 20px;\r\n            text-align: center;\r\n        }\r\n        .header h2 {\r\n            margin: 0;\r\n            font-size: 1.2rem;\r\n            font-weight: 600;\r\n        }\r\n        .header .sub-title {\r\n            font-size: 0.85rem;\r\n            opacity: 0.9;\r\n            margin-top: 5px;\r\n            text-transform: uppercase;\r\n            letter-spacing: 1px;\r\n        }\r\n        .content {\r\n            padding: 20px;\r\n            color: #333;\r\n            line-height: 1.6;\r\n        }\r\n        .tag {\r\n            display: inline-block;\r\n            padding: 4px 8px;\r\n            border-radius: 4px;\r\n            font-size: 0.75rem;\r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\r\n        }\r\n        .tag-red { background-color: #ffebee; color: #c62828; }\r\n        .tag-blue { background-color: #e3f2fd; color: #1565c0; }\r\n        \r\n        .section-title {\r\n            font-weight: 700;\r\n            color: #2c3e50;\r\n            margin-top: 20px;\r\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\r\n            border-left: 4px solid #3498db;\r\n            padding-left: 10px;\r\n            font-size: 1rem;\r\n        }\r\n        .rule-box {\r\n            background-color: #f8f9fa;\r\n            border-left: 4px solid #f1c40f;\r\n            padding: 15px;\r\n            margin: 15px 0;\r\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\r\n            border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\r\n        }\r\n        .case-ref {\r\n            font-style: italic;\r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n            color: #555;\r\n        }\r\n        .highlight {\r\n            background-color: #fff3cd;\r\n            padding: 0 2px;\r\n            border-radius: 2px;\r\n        }\r\n        .answer-analysis {\r\n            margin-top: 15px;\r\n        }\r\n        .correct-choice {\r\n            color: #27ae60;\r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n        }\r\n        .wrong-choice {\r\n            color: #c0392b;\r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n        }\r\n        .footer {\r\n            background-color: #f8f9fa;\r\n            padding: 15px;\r\n            text-align: center;\r\n            font-size: 0.8rem;\r\n            color: #7f8c8d;\r\n            border-top: 1px solid #eee;\r\n        }\r\n        ul {\r\n            padding-left: 20px;\r\n            margin: 10px 0;\r\n        }\r\n        li {\r\n            margin-bottom: 8px;\r\n        }\r\n    </style>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card\">\r\n    <div class=\"header\">\r\n        <h2>MBE 考点解析</h2>\r\n        <div class=\"sub-title\">Constitutional Law | Substantive Due Process</div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"content\">\r\n        <div class=\"tag tag-red\">正确答案: A</div>\r\n        <div class=\"tag tag-blue\">难度: 高</div>\r\n\r\n        <p>本题考察的是美国宪法第十四修正案下的<b>实质性正当程序 (Substantive Due Process)</b> 以及父母对子女教育的权利。</p>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"section-title\">核心考点：父母的权利</div>\r\n        <div class=\"rule-box\">\r\n            <p><b>基本规则：</b>父母拥有控制其子女养育和教育的权利，这被视为一项<b>基本权利 (Fundamental Right)</b>。</p>\r\n            <p><b>经典判例：</b> <span class=\"case-ref\">Pierce v. Society of Sisters (1925)</span>。在该案中，最高法院裁定，州政府不能强迫所有儿童就读公立学校，因为这不合理地干涉了父母指导其子女教育的自由。</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"section-title\">审查标准：严格审查 (Strict Scrutiny)</div>\r\n        <p>当一项法律实质性地损害了基本权利（如隐私权、父母权、投票权等）时，法院必须适用<b>严格审查</b>标准。</p>\r\n        \r\n        <p><b>严格审查的三要素：</b></p>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li><b>举证责任：</b> 在政府 (Government)。</li>\r\n            <li><b>目的：</b> 必须是为了实现一项<span class=\"highlight\">迫切的州利益 (Compelling State Interest)</span>。</li>\r\n            <li><b>手段：</b> 法律手段必须是实现该利益所<span class=\"highlight\">必需的 (Necessary)</span>，且通常要求是限制性最小的手段 (Least Restrictive Means)。</li>\r\n        </ul>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"section-title\">案情分析</div>\r\n        <p>在本题中：</p>\r\n        <ol>\r\n            <li><b>权利受损：</b> 州法律强制所有儿童上公立学校，剥夺了父母选择私立教育的权利，侵犯了基本权利。</li>\r\n            <li><b>州利益：</b> 州政府希望通过提高平均分来保留联邦资金。这可能被视为一项“迫切的利益”。</li>\r\n            <li><b>手段是否必要？</b> <span class=\"wrong-choice\">否。</span> 强制所有私立学校学生转入公立学校并不是提高成绩的唯一或必要手段。州政府完全可以采取其他限制性更小的措施（如改进公立学校教学质量、增加辅导等）。</li>\r\n        </ol>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"section-title\">选项解析</div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"answer-analysis\">\r\n            <p><span class=\"correct-choice\">选项 A (正确)：</span><br>\r\n            <b>\"No, because it is not necessary to further a compelling state interest.\"</b><br>\r\n            这是严格审查标准的正确表述。虽然州可能有迫切利益，但该法律手段过于宽泛，并非“必需”。</p>\r\n\r\n            <p><span class=\"wrong-choice\">选项 B & D (错误)：</span><br>\r\n            这两个选项提到了“理性关联 (Rationally Related)”和“合法利益 (Legitimate Interest)”。这是<b>理性基础审查 (Rational Basis Review)</b> 的标准。由于本案涉及基本权利，必须使用更严格的标准，不能仅适用理性基础审查。</p>\r\n\r\n            <p><span class=\"wrong-choice\">选项 C (错误)：</span><br>\r\n            虽然它正确地引用了严格审查的标准（迫切利益+必需），但结论是错误的。该法律<b>并非</b>必需的，因为存在限制性更小的替代方案。</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"section-title\">💡 考试技巧 (Exam Tip)</div>\r\n        <div class=\"rule-box\" style=\"border-left-color: #e74c3c;\">\r\n            <p>在 MBE 宪法题中，首先判断受影响的权利是否为<b>基本权利 (Fundamental Right)</b>。</p>\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li>如果是（如：隐私、婚姻、父母权、州际旅行），直接寻找包含 <b>\"Compelling Interest\"</b> 和 <b>\"Necessary\"</b> 关键词的选项。</li>\r\n                <li>如果是普通社会/经济权利（如：受教育权本身、商业经营），则适用理性基础审查。</li>\r\n            </ul>\r\n            <p>注意：虽然受教育权本身不是基本权利，但<b>父母选择教育方式的权利</b>是基本权利。</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    \r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n</html>",
      "meta": {
        "question_analysis": {
          "micro_concept": "Strict scrutiny for fundamental rights",
          "trap_type": "Rule Exception Overlooked",
          "trap_type_is_new": false,
          "skill_tested": "Apply constitutional strict scrutiny analysis",
          "question_keyword_meta": {
            "keywords": [
              {
                "id": "k1",
                "text": "state law that requires all children of elementary and secondary school age to attend the schools operated by their respective local public school districts",
                "label": "State law / 州法律",
                "kind": "legal_term",
                "reason": "此為挑戰核心州法律條文，關係基本權利",
                "importance": "high"
              },
              {
