    {
      "index": 30,
      "subject": "Constitutional Law",
      "chapter": "Individual Rights",
      "topic": "Procedural Due Process Applied",
      "count": 120,
      "question": "The United States government demonstrated that terrorist attacks involving commercial airliners were perpetrated exclusively by individuals of one particular race. In response, Congress enacted a statute imposing stringent new airport and airline security measures only on individuals of that race seeking to board airplanes in the United States.\nWhich of the following provides the best ground for challenging the constitutionality of this statute?",
      "choices": {
        "A": "The commerce clause of Article I, Section 8.",
        "B": "The due process clause of the Fifth Amendment.",
        "C": "The privileges and immunities clause of Article IV.",
        "D": "The privileges or immunities clause of the Fourteenth Amendment."
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "source_img": "source_imgs/q0030.png",
      "explanation": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n  <title>Explanation</title>\n  <style>\n    body{\n      margin:0;\n      font-size:1rem;\n      line-height:1.7;\n      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n      color:#111;\n      background:#fff;\n    }\n    .pbx-explanation{\n      padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;\n      max-width:1100px;\n      margin:0 auto;\n      box-sizing:border-box;\n    }\n    .pbx-title{\n      text-align:center;\n      font-weight:700;\n      font-size:1.35rem;\n      line-height:1.25;\n      margin:1.2rem 0 1.4rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-diagram{\n      margin:0 auto 1.5rem;\n      max-width:100%;\n      box-sizing:border-box;\n    }\n    .pbx-scroll-x{\n      overflow-x:auto;\n      -webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;\n      margin:16px 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-flow-inner{\n      min-width:860px;\n      position:relative;\n      height:430px;\n      border-radius:0.5rem;\n      background:\n        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 100%),\n        linear-gradient(90deg, #dce8d0 0 7%, #ef8f7b 7% 93%, #dce8d0 93% 100%);\n      overflow:hidden;\n      border:1px solid #e3e3e3;\n    }\n    .pbx-track{\n      position:absolute;\n      inset:0;\n      background:\n        repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,\n          transparent 0 11.5%,\n          rgba(255,255,255,0.95) 11.5% 12.3%,\n          transparent 12.3% 23.5%,\n          rgba(255,255,255,0.95) 23.5% 24.3%,\n          transparent 24.3% 35.5%,\n          rgba(255,255,255,0.95) 35.5% 36.3%,\n          transparent 36.3% 47.5%,\n          rgba(255,255,255,0.95) 47.5% 48.3%,\n          transparent 48.3% 59.5%,\n          rgba(255,255,255,0.95) 59.5% 60.3%,\n          transparent 60.3% 71.5%,\n          rgba(255,255,255,0.95) 71.5% 72.3%,\n          transparent 72.3% 100%);\n      opacity:.9;\n    }\n    .pbx-track:before{\n      content:\"\";\n      position:absolute;\n      left:0; right:0;\n      top:22%;\n      height:2px;\n      background:rgba(255,214,96,0.55);\n    }\n    .pbx-hurdle{\n      position:absolute;\n      width:240px;\n      height:156px;\n    }\n    .pbx-hurdle .pbx-top{\n      position:absolute;\n      left:0; right:0;\n      top:0;\n      height:32px;\n      border:1px solid #cfcfcf;\n      background:#fff;\n      display:flex;\n      align-items:center;\n      justify-content:center;\n      font-weight:700;\n      font-size:1rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-hurdle .pbx-leg{\n      position:absolute;\n      top:30px;\n      width:7px;\n      height:92px;\n      background:#5b8bd8;\n      border-radius:2px;\n    }\n    .pbx-hurdle .pbx-leg.left{left:14px;}\n    .pbx-hurdle .pbx-leg.right{right:14px;}\n    .pbx-hurdle .pbx-base{\n      position:absolute;\n      left:4px; right:4px;\n      bottom:0;\n      height:9px;\n      background:#efefef;\n      border:1px solid #cfcfcf;\n    }\n    .pbx-hurdle .pbx-foot{\n      position:absolute;\n      bottom:-6px;\n      width:18px;\n      height:74px;\n      background:#efefef;\n      border:1px solid #cfcfcf;\n      transform-origin:top center;\n    }\n    .pbx-hurdle .pbx-foot.left{left:6px; transform:skewX(-22deg);}\n    .pbx-hurdle .pbx-foot.right{right:6px; transform:skewX(22deg);}\n    .pbx-hurdle .pbx-body{\n      position:absolute;\n      left:0; right:0;\n      top:40px;\n      font-size:.93rem;\n      line-height:1.4;\n      text-align:left;\n      padding-left:28px;\n    }\n    .pbx-hurdle .pbx-body ul{\n      margin:6px 0 0 1.1em;\n      padding:0;\n    }\n    .pbx-hurdle .pbx-body li{margin:0.08em 0;}\n    .pbx-hurdle.r1{left:64px; top:211px; transform:scale(.96);}\n    .pbx-hurdle.r2{left:340px; top:152px; transform:scale(.98);}\n    .pbx-hurdle.r3{left:608px; top:74px; transform:scale(1.02);}\n    .pbx-content{\n      font-size:1rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-content p{\n      margin:0 0 1rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-content strong{font-weight:700;}\n    .pbx-content em{font-style:italic;}\n    .pbx-content .pbx-note{\n      font-size:.94rem;\n      font-style:italic;\n      margin-top:-.25rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-edu-objective{\n      background:#f0f7ff;\n      border-left:4px solid #3498db;\n      border-radius:6px;\n      padding:14px 18px;\n      margin:24px 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-edu-objective-title{\n      font-size:13px;\n      font-weight:700;\n      color:#2980b9;\n      text-transform:uppercase;\n      letter-spacing:0.05em;\n      margin-bottom:8px;\n    }\n    .pbx-references{\n      background:#fafafa;\n      border:1px solid #e0e0e0;\n      border-radius:6px;\n      padding:14px 18px;\n      margin:20px 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-references-title{\n      font-size:13px;\n      font-weight:700;\n      color:#555;\n      text-transform:uppercase;\n      letter-spacing:0.05em;\n      margin-bottom:8px;\n    }\n    .pbx-ref-list{\n      margin:0;\n      padding-left:18px;\n      font-size:14px;\n      color:#555;\n      line-height:1.7;\n    }\n    @media (max-width:640px){\n      body{font-size:0.95rem;padding:0.75rem;}\n      .pbx-explanation{padding:0.875rem 1rem;}\n      .pbx-title{font-size:1.15rem;}\n      .pbx-flow-inner{min-width:860px;height:430px;}\n      .pbx-content{font-size:.95rem;}\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<!-- pbx-topic: Procedural Due Process Applied -->\n<div class=\"pbx-explanation\">\n  <div class=\"pbx-title\">Fifth Amendment due process challenge<br>(equal protection principles)</div>\n\n  <div class=\"pbx-diagram\">\n    <div class=\"pbx-scroll-x\">\n      <div class=\"pbx-flow-inner\">\n        <div class=\"pbx-track\"></div>\n\n        <div class=\"pbx-hurdle r1\">\n          <div class=\"pbx-top\">• Rational basis scrutiny •</div>\n          <div class=\"pbx-leg left\"></div>\n          <div class=\"pbx-leg right\"></div>\n          <div class=\"pbx-body\">\n            Constitutional unless\n            <ul>\n              <li>not rationally related to</li>\n              <li>legitimate interest</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"pbx-base\"></div>\n          <div class=\"pbx-foot left\"></div>\n          <div class=\"pbx-foot right\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"pbx-hurdle r2\">\n          <div class=\"pbx-top\">• Intermediate scrutiny •</div>\n          <div class=\"pbx-leg left\"></div>\n          <div class=\"pbx-leg right\"></div>\n          <div class=\"pbx-body\">\n            Unconstitutional unless\n            <ul>\n              <li>substantially related to</li>\n              <li>important interest</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"pbx-base\"></div>\n          <div class=\"pbx-foot left\"></div>\n          <div class=\"pbx-foot right\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"pbx-hurdle r3\">\n          <div class=\"pbx-top\">• Strict scrutiny •</div>\n          <div class=\"pbx-leg left\"></div>\n          <div class=\"pbx-leg right\"></div>\n          <div class=\"pbx-body\">\n            Unconstitutional unless\n            <ul>\n              <li>necessary to achieve</li>\n              <li>compelling interest</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"pbx-base\"></div>\n          <div class=\"pbx-foot left\"></div>\n          <div class=\"pbx-foot right\"></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pbx-content\">\n    <p>A law that treats <strong>similarly situated persons differently</strong> may violate the constitutional principle of <strong>equal protection</strong>, which applies to the <strong>federal government</strong> through the <strong>Fifth Amendment due process clause</strong>.</p>\n    <p>This is especially likely when the law intentionally discriminates against a <span style=\"color:#0000EE;\">suspect class</span> (eg, race). That is because the government must clear the highest hurdle—<strong>strict scrutiny</strong>—to justify such a law. And since this federal statute intentionally targets a particular race, due process provides the best ground to challenge the statute.</p>\n\n    <p class=\"pbx-note\">*The equal protection clause of the Fourteenth Amendment applies only to states and localities—not the federal government.</p>\n\n    <p data-choice=\"A\" data-choice-role=\"distractor\" style=\"border-left:3px solid #c0392b;padding-left:10px;\">\n      <strong style=\"color:#9b1c1c;\">(Choice A)</strong> The <span style=\"color:#0000EE;\">commerce clause</span> grants Congress broad plenary power to regulate the instrumentalities of interstate commerce—eg, planes, trains, automobiles. Therefore, this clause <em>supports</em> Congress's authority to regulate airports and airlines.\n    </p>\n\n    <p data-choice=\"C\" data-choice-role=\"distractor\" style=\"border-left:3px solid #c0392b;padding-left:10px;\">\n      <strong style=\"color:#9b1c1c;\">(Choice C)</strong> The Article IV privileges and immunities clause generally prohibits <strong>states</strong> from discriminating against citizens of other states. But it does not apply to the <strong>federal</strong> government.\n    </p>\n\n    <p data-choice=\"D\" data-choice-role=\"distractor\" style=\"border-left:3px solid #c0392b;padding-left:10px;\">\n      <strong style=\"color:#9b1c1c;\">(Choice D)</strong> The Fourteenth Amendment privileges or immunities clause applies to states—not the federal government—and bars them from depriving individuals of the very limited rights of <span style=\"color:#0000EE;\">national citizenship</span>.\n    </p>\n\n    <div class=\"pbx-edu-objective\">\n      <div class=\"pbx-edu-objective-title\">📌 Educational Objective</div>\n      <p>Equal protection principles apply to the federal government through the Fifth Amendment due process clause. And under this clause, federal laws that intentionally discriminate against a suspect class (eg, race) are almost always invalidated under strict scrutiny.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"pbx-references\">\n      <div class=\"pbx-references-title\">📚 References</div>\n      <ul class=\"pbx-ref-list\">\n        <li>Bolling v. Sharpe, 347 U.S. 497, 499–500 (1954) (holding that equal protection principles apply to the federal government through the Fifth Amendment due process clause).</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "zh-question": "美国政府证明，涉及商用客机的恐怖袭击完全是由某一特定种族的个人所为。作为回应，国会颁布了一项法规，仅对在美国寻求登机的该种族个人实施严格的新机场和航空公司安保措施。\n\n以下哪一项为挑战该法规的合宪性提供了最佳依据？",
      "zh-choices": {
        "A": "Article I, Section 8 的商业条款。",
        "B": "Fifth Amendment 的正当程序条款。",
        "C": "Article IV 的特权与豁免条款。",
        "D": "Fourteenth Amendment 的特权或豁免条款。"
      },
      "zh-explanation": "<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\r\n<head>\r\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\r\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\r\n    \r\n    <style>\r\n        strong, b {\r\n            display: inline !important; \r\n            white-space: normal !important; \r\n            word-break: normal !important;\n            overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\r\n        }\r\n    </style>\r\n\r\n<style>\r\n        :root {\r\n            --primary-color: #2c3e50;\r\n            --accent-color: #3498db;\r\n            --highlight-color: #e74c3c;\r\n            --bg-color: #f8f9fa;\r\n            --card-bg: #ffffff;\r\n            --text-color: #333333;\r\n            --secondary-text: #666666;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        body {\r\n            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\r\n            background-color: var(--bg-color);\r\n            color: var(--text-color);\r\n            line-height: 1.6;\r\n            margin: 0;\r\n            padding: 20px;\r\n            display: flex;\r\n            justify-content: center;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .container {\r\n            max-width: 480px; /* 适配手机屏幕逻辑宽度 */\r\n            width: 100%;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .header {\r\n            text-align: center;\r\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .header h1 {\r\n            font-size: 1.5rem;\r\n            color: var(--primary-color);\r\n            margin: 0;\r\n            border-bottom: 3px solid var(--accent-color);\r\n            display: inline-block;\r\n            padding-bottom: 5px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .card {\r\n            background-color: var(--card-bg);\r\n            border-radius: 12px;\r\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\r\n            padding: 20px;\r\n            margin-bottom: 16px;\r\n            border-left: 5px solid var(--accent-color);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .card.answer {\r\n            border-left-color: var(--highlight-color);\r\n            background-color: #fff5f5;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .card-title {\r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n            font-size: 1.1rem;\r\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\r\n            color: var(--primary-color);\r\n            display: flex;\r\n            align-items: center;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .card-title::before {\r\n            content: '';\r\n            display: inline-block;\r\n            width: 8px;\r\n            height: 8px;\r\n            background-color: currentColor;\r\n            border-radius: 50%;\r\n            margin-right: 8px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .concept-box {\r\n            background-color: #eef7fe;\r\n            border-radius: 8px;\r\n            padding: 12px;\r\n            margin: 10px 0;\r\n            font-size: 0.95rem;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .key-term {\r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n            color: var(--primary-color);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .latin {\r\n            font-style: italic;\r\n            color: var(--secondary-text);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .wrong-option {\r\n            margin-top: 15px;\r\n            border-top: 1px dashed #ddd;\r\n            padding-top: 10px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .wrong-option h4 {\r\n            margin: 0 0 5px 0;\r\n            font-size: 0.95rem;\r\n            color: var(--secondary-text);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .tip-box {\r\n            background-color: #2c3e50;\r\n            color: white;\r\n            border-radius: 8px;\r\n            padding: 15px;\r\n            margin-top: 20px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .tip-title {\r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n            margin-bottom: 5px;\r\n            color: #f1c40f;\r\n            text-transform: uppercase;\r\n            font-size: 0.85rem;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        ul {\r\n            padding-left: 20px;\r\n            margin: 5px 0;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        li {\r\n            margin-bottom: 5px;\r\n        }\r\n    </style>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n    <div class=\"header\">\r\n        <h1>MBE 考点解析</h1>\r\n        <p style=\"font-size: 0.9rem; color: #666;\">Constitutional Law: Individual Rights</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 正确答案解析 -->\r\n    <div class=\"card answer\">\r\n        <div class=\"card-title\" style=\"color: var(--highlight-color);\">正确答案：选项 B</div>\r\n        <p><strong>Fifth Amendment 的正当程序条款 (Due Process Clause)。</strong></p>\r\n        <p>这是本题挑战该联邦法规合宪性的最佳依据。</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 核心法律逻辑 -->\r\n    <div class=\"card\">\r\n        <div class=\"card-title\">核心考点：联邦政府与平等保护</div>\r\n        \r\n        <p>本题考察的是一个经典的宪法学“弯路”：如何用宪法约束<strong>联邦政府</strong>的歧视行为。</p>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"concept-box\">\r\n            <span class=\"key-term\">逻辑链条：</span>\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li><strong>平等保护条款 (Equal Protection Clause)</strong> 原文出现在第十四修正案 (14th Amendment)，但该修正案明确规定针对的是<strong>州 (State)</strong>。</li>\r\n                <li><strong>联邦政府 (Federal Government)</strong> 不受第十四修正案直接约束。</li>\r\n                <li>但是，最高法院在 <em>Bolling v. Sharpe (1954)</em> 案中确立，第五修正案的<strong>正当程序条款 (Due Process Clause)</strong> 包含了平等保护的原则。</li>\r\n            </ul>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <p>因此，当<strong>联邦政府</strong>（如本题中的国会 Congress）制定法律基于<strong>种族 (Race)</strong> 进行分类时，必须通过第五修正案的正当程序条款进行挑战。</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 审查标准 -->\r\n    <div class=\"card\">\r\n        <div class=\"card-title\">审查标准：严格审查 (Strict Scrutiny)</div>\r\n        <p>由于该法律涉及<strong>种族</strong>这一<strong>可疑分类 (Suspect Classification)</strong>，法院将适用<strong>严格审查</strong>标准。</p>\r\n        <p>政府必须证明该法律：</p>\r\n        <ol>\r\n            <li>是为了实现<strong>迫切的政府利益 (Compelling Government Interest)</strong>（如国家安全）；且</li>\r\n            <li>手段是<strong>狭义以此为目的 (Narrowly Tailored)</strong> 的。</li>\r\n        </ol>\r\n        <p>虽然反恐是迫切利益，但仅针对单一特定种族进行限制通常被认为过于宽泛或包含不足，难以通过严格审查。</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 排除错误选项 -->\r\n    <div class=\"card\">\r\n        <div class=\"card-title\">为什么其他选项是错的？</div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"wrong-option\">\r\n            <h4>❌ 选项 A: Commerce Clause (商业条款)</h4>\r\n            <p>商业条款是国会权力的<strong>来源 (Source of Power)</strong>，赋予国会监管航空业的权力。它是支持该法律存在的依据，而不是挑战该法律侵犯人权的依据。</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"wrong-option\">\r\n            <h4>❌ 选项 C: Art. IV Privileges and Immunities (特权与豁免条款)</h4>\r\n            <p>该条款（又称 Comity Clause）禁止<strong>州</strong>歧视来自<strong>其他州</strong>的公民。它不适用于联邦政府，也不涉及种族歧视。</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"wrong-option\">\r\n            <h4>❌ 选项 D: 14th Am. Privileges or Immunities (特权或豁免条款)</h4>\r\n            <p>该条款保护范围极窄（如跨州迁徙权），且仅适用于<strong>州</strong>对国民权利的剥夺。它不是挑战种族歧视的主要依据。</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- 考试技巧 -->\r\n    <div class=\"tip-box\">\r\n        <div class=\"tip-title\">💡 MBE 实战技巧</div>\r\n        <p>做题时请务必先看<strong>主体 (Actor)</strong>：</p>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li>如果是<strong>州 (State)</strong> 歧视 ➡️ 选 <strong>14th Amendment Equal Protection</strong>。</li>\r\n            <li>如果是<strong>联邦 (Federal/Congress)</strong> 歧视 ➡️ 选 <strong>5th Amendment Due Process</strong>。</li>\r\n        </ul>\r\n        <p>这是MBE中极易混淆但非常固定的考点，看到 \"Federal statute\" 和 \"Discrimination\" 同时出现，直奔第五修正案！</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n</html>",
