      "index": 32,
      "subject": "Constitutional Law",
      "chapter": "Individual Rights",
      "topic": "State Taxation Of Commerce",
      "count": 120,
      "question": "In one state, certain advanced diagnostic medical technologies were located only in hospitals, where they provided a major source of revenue. In many other states, such technologies were also available at \"diagnostic centers\" that were not affiliated with hospitals.\nA group of physicians announced its plan to immediately open in the state a diagnostic center that would not be affiliated with a hospital. The state hospital association argued to the state legislature that only hospitals could reliably handle advanced diagnostic medical technologies. The legislature then enacted a law prohibiting the operation in the state of diagnostic centers that were not affiliated with hospitals.\nThe group of physicians filed suit challenging the constitutionality of the state law. What action should the court take?",
      "choices": {
        "A": "Dismiss the suit without reaching the merits, because the suit is not ripe.",
        "B": "Invalidate the law, because it imposes an undue burden on access to medical services in the state.",
        "C": "Uphold the law, because the legislature could rationally believe that diagnostic centers not affiliated with hospitals would be less reliable than hospitals.",
        "D": "Uphold the law, because the provision of medical services is traditionally a matter of legitimate local concern that states have unreviewable authority to regulate."
      },
      "answer": "C",
      "source_img": "source_imgs/q0032.png",
      "explanation": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n  <title>Explanation</title>\n  <style>\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      font-size: 1rem;\n      line-height: 1.7;\n      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n      background: #ffffff;\n      color: #111;\n    }\n    .pbx-explanation {\n      padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n      max-width: 100%;\n      overflow-wrap: break-word;\n      word-break: break-word;\n    }\n    .pbx-explanation h1 {\n      font-size: 2rem;\n      line-height: 1.25;\n      text-align: center;\n      margin: 1.1rem 0 1.2rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n    }\n    .pbx-figure-title {\n      text-align: center;\n      font-size: 1.55rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      margin: 0 0 1.1rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-flow-wrap {\n      margin: 0.75rem 0 1rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-flow-inner {\n      min-width: 56rem;\n      position: relative;\n      padding: 0.5rem 0 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-chart {\n      position: relative;\n      height: 31rem;\n      border: 0;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      width: 100%;\n      min-width: 56rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-axis-y, .pbx-axis-x {\n      position: absolute;\n      background: #222;\n    }\n    .pbx-axis-y {\n      left: 8rem;\n      top: 4.6rem;\n      width: 2px;\n      height: 22rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-axis-x {\n      left: 8rem;\n      top: 26.6rem;\n      width: 42rem;\n      height: 2px;\n    }\n    .pbx-axis-y::before, .pbx-axis-x::after {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      background: #222;\n    }\n    .pbx-axis-y::before {\n      width: 0.7rem;\n      height: 0.7rem;\n      clip-path: polygon(50% 0, 0 100%, 100% 100%);\n      right: -0.35rem;\n      top: -0.45rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-axis-x::after {\n      width: 0.7rem;\n      height: 0.7rem;\n      clip-path: polygon(100% 50%, 0 0, 0 100%);\n      right: -0.35rem;\n      top: -0.35rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-y-label {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 4.1rem;\n      top: 13.5rem;\n      transform: rotate(-90deg);\n      font-size: 1.1rem;\n      color: #333;\n    }\n    .pbx-x-label {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 24rem;\n      top: 27.3rem;\n      font-size: 1.1rem;\n      color: #333;\n    }\n    .pbx-bar {\n      position: absolute;\n      bottom: 4.9rem;\n      width: 12.2rem;\n      border-radius: 0;\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n      padding: 0.9rem 0.9rem;\n      color: #222;\n    }\n    .pbx-bar h3 {\n      margin: 0 0 0.8rem;\n      font-size: 1.35rem;\n      line-height: 1.1;\n    }\n    .pbx-bar ul {\n      margin: 0;\n      padding-left: 1.2rem;\n      font-size: 1.02rem;\n      line-height: 1.55;\n    }\n    .pbx-bar li { margin: 0.15rem 0; }\n    .pbx-rational {\n      left: 10.1rem;\n      height: 10.2rem;\n      background: rgba(186, 210, 245, 0.75);\n    }\n    .pbx-intermediate {\n      left: 24.8rem;\n      height: 14.3rem;\n      background: rgba(239, 198, 205, 0.8);\n    }\n    .pbx-strict {\n      left: 39.8rem;\n      height: 19.8rem;\n      background: rgba(239, 198, 205, 0.8);\n    }\n    .pbx-legend {\n      text-align: center;\n      font-size: 1rem;\n      margin-top: 0.7rem;\n      color: #444;\n    }\n    .pbx-legend span {\n      display: inline-block;\n      margin: 0 0.9rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-swatch {\n      width: 0.9rem;\n      height: 0.9rem;\n      display: inline-block;\n      vertical-align: middle;\n      margin-right: 0.35rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-blue { background: #c7d8f2; }\n    .pbx-pink { background: #efc6cd; }\n\n    .pbx-explanation p {\n      margin: 0 0 1.05rem;\n      font-size: 1rem;\n      line-height: 1.72;\n    }\n    .pbx-explanation strong { font-weight: 700; }\n    .pbx-choice {\n      margin: 0 0 0.95rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-choice strong { font-weight: 700; }\n    .pbx-edu-objective {\n      background: #f0f7ff;\n      border-left: 4px solid #3498db;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      padding: 14px 18px;\n      margin: 24px 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-edu-objective-title {\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: #2980b9;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n    .pbx-references {\n      background: #fafafa;\n      border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      padding: 14px 18px;\n      margin: 20px 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-references-title {\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: #555;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n    .pbx-ref-list {\n      margin: 0;\n      padding-left: 18px;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      color: #555;\n      line-height: 1.7;\n    }\n    @media (max-width: 640px) {\n      body { font-size: 0.95rem; padding: 0.75rem; }\n      .pbx-explanation { padding: 0.875rem 1rem; }\n      .pbx-explanation h1 { font-size: 1.55rem; }\n      .pbx-figure-title { font-size: 1.2rem; }\n      .pbx-chart, .pbx-flow-inner { min-width: 52rem; }\n      .pbx-bar h3 { font-size: 1.15rem; }\n      .pbx-bar ul { font-size: 0.92rem; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body><!-- pbx-topic: State Taxation Of Commerce -->\n  <div class=\"pbx-explanation\">\n    <div class=\"pbx-figure-title\">Levels of scrutiny under equal protection clause</div>\n\n    <div class=\"pbx-flow-wrap\">\n      <div class=\"pbx-scroll-x\" style=\"overflow-x:auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch; margin: 16px 0;\">\n        <div class=\"pbx-flow-inner\">\n          <div class=\"pbx-chart\">\n            <div class=\"pbx-axis-y\"></div>\n            <div class=\"pbx-axis-x\"></div>\n            <div class=\"pbx-y-label\">Severity of burden</div>\n            <div class=\"pbx-x-label\">Type of scrutiny</div>\n\n            <div class=\"pbx-bar pbx-rational\">\n              <h3>Rational basis</h3>\n              <ul>\n                <li>no rational relation to</li>\n                <li>legitimate state interest</li>\n              </ul>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"pbx-bar pbx-intermediate\">\n              <h3>Intermediate</h3>\n              <ul>\n                <li>substantial relation to</li>\n                <li>important state interest</li>\n              </ul>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"pbx-bar pbx-strict\">\n              <h3>Strict</h3>\n              <ul>\n                <li>necessary to achieve</li>\n                <li>compelling state interest</li>\n              </ul>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"pbx-legend\">\n            <span><i class=\"pbx-swatch pbx-blue\"></i> = challenger's burden</span>\n            <span><i class=\"pbx-swatch pbx-pink\"></i> = state's burden</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <p>The constitutionality of a <strong>discriminatory law</strong> can be challenged under the <strong>equal protection clause</strong>. Such challenges are generally reviewed under the <strong>rational basis test</strong>, which requires that the law be <strong>rationally related</strong> to any <strong>legitimate state interest</strong>. And since any reasonable, conceivable purpose that may have motivated the legislature to pass the law will satisfy this test, laws subject to the rational basis test are usually upheld.</p>\n\n    <p>Here, a state law discriminates against physicians who wish to operate an unaffiliated diagnostic center by requiring that diagnostic centers be affiliated with hospitals. Since the legislature could rationally believe that unaffiliated diagnostic centers would be less reliable than hospitals, the law is rationally related to a legitimate state interest—providing safe medical services. Therefore, the law satisfies the rational basis test and should be upheld.</p>\n\n    <p class=\"pbx-choice\" data-choice=\"A\" data-choice-role=\"distractor\"><strong style=\"color:#9b1c1c;\">(Choice A)</strong> A court will dismiss a suit without reaching the merits if it is not ripe—ie, if the plaintiff has yet to suffer actual harm or an imminent threat thereof. But since this law threatens the physicians' immediate plan to open a diagnostic center in the state, their suit is ripe for litigation.</p>\n\n    <p class=\"pbx-choice\" data-choice=\"B\" data-choice-role=\"distractor\"><strong style=\"color:#9b1c1c;\">(Choice B)</strong> Discriminatory laws that unduly burden a <span style=\"color:#1f8f4d;font-weight:600;\">fundamental right</span> are presumptively invalid and reviewed under strict scrutiny, which requires that the law be necessary to serve a compelling state interest. But access to medical services is <strong>not</strong> a fundamental right, so this law need only survive rational basis scrutiny.</p>\n\n    <p class=\"pbx-choice\" data-choice=\"D\" data-choice-role=\"distractor\"><strong style=\"color:#9b1c1c;\">(Choice D)</strong> State laws and regulations are always subject to constitutional limits, so the state does not have the unreviewable authority to regulate the provision of medical services—even if it is traditionally a matter of legitimate local concern.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"pbx-edu-objective\">\n      <div class=\"pbx-edu-objective-title\">📌 Educational Objective</div>\n      <p>Under the equal protection clause, discriminatory laws are generally reviewed under the rational basis test—ie, the law must be rationally related to any legitimate state interest. And any reasonable, conceivable purpose that may have motivated the legislature in passing the law will satisfy this test.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"pbx-references\">\n      <div class=\"pbx-references-title\">📚 References</div>\n      <ul class=\"pbx-ref-list\">\n        <li>U.S. Const. amend. XIV (equal protection clause).</li>\n        <li>Heller v. Doe, 509 U.S. 312, 319–20 (1993) (explaining that any reasonable, conceivable legislative purpose will satisfy rational basis scrutiny).</li>\n        <li>Barsky v. Board of Regents, 347 U.S. 442, 449 (1954) (finding that a state has broad power to regulate the health profession).</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "zh-question": "在某个州，某些先进的诊断医疗技术仅设于医院内，并成为医院的主要收入来源。在许多其他州，此类技术也可在不隶属于医院的“诊断中心”使用。\n\n一群医生宣布了他们的计划，即刻在该州开设一家不隶属于医院的诊断中心。州医院协会向州立法机关主张，只有医院才能可靠地操作先进的诊断医疗技术。立法机关随后颁布了一项法律，禁止在该州经营不隶属于医院的诊断中心。\n\n该群医生提起诉讼，挑战该州法律的合宪性。法院应采取何种行动？",
      "zh-choices": {
        "A": "驳回诉讼，不对案情实质进行审理，因为该诉讼尚不成熟。",
        "B": "宣布该法律无效，因为它对在该州获取医疗服务施加了不当负担。",
        "C": "维持该法律，因为立法机关可以合理地认为，不隶属于医院的诊断中心比医院的可靠性更低。",
        "D": "维持该法律，因为提供医疗服务传统上是地方正当关切的事项，各州对此拥有不可审查的监管权力。"
      },
      "zh-explanation": "<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\r\n<head>\r\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\r\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\r\n    \r\n    <style>\r\n        strong, b {\r\n            display: inline !important; \r\n            white-space: normal !important; \r\n            word-break: normal !important;\n            overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\r\n        }\r\n    </style>\r\n\r\n<style>\r\n        :root {\r\n            --primary-color: #2c3e50;\r\n            --accent-color: #e74c3c;\r\n            --highlight-bg: #ecf0f1;\r\n            --text-color: #34495e;\r\n            --success-color: #27ae60;\r\n            --border-radius: 8px;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        body {\r\n            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\r\n            line-height: 1.6;\r\n            color: var(--text-color);\r\n            background-color: #f4f7f6;\r\n            margin: 0;\r\n            padding: 10px;\r\n            display: flex;\r\n            justify-content: center;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .container {\r\n            max-width: 480px;\r\n            background: white;\r\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\r\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\r\n            overflow: hidden;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .header {\r\n            background: var(--primary-color);\r\n            color: white;\r\n            padding: 20px;\r\n            text-align: center;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .header h1 {\r\n            margin: 0;\r\n            font-size: 1.2rem;\r\n            font-weight: 700;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .header .subtitle {\r\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\r\n            opacity: 0.9;\r\n            margin-top: 5px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .content {\r\n            padding: 20px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .card {\r\n            background: var(--highlight-bg);\r\n            border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-color);\r\n            padding: 15px;\r\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\r\n            border-radius: 0 var(--border-radius) var(--border-radius) 0;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .card-title {\r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n            color: var(--primary-color);\r\n            margin-bottom: 8px;\r\n            display: flex;\r\n            align-items: center;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .concept-box {\r\n            border: 1px solid #ddd;\r\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\r\n            padding: 15px;\r\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .tag {\r\n            display: inline-block;\r\n            background: var(--primary-color);\r\n            color: white;\r\n            padding: 2px 8px;\r\n            border-radius: 4px;\r\n            font-size: 0.8rem;\r\n            margin-right: 5px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .chart-container {\r\n            display: flex;\r\n            flex-direction: column;\r\n            gap: 10px;\r\n            margin: 20px 0;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .level {\r\n            padding: 10px;\r\n            color: white;\r\n            text-align: center;\r\n            border-radius: 4px;\r\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\r\n            position: relative;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .level-strict { background: #c0392b; opacity: 0.3; }\r\n        .level-intermediate { background: #f39c12; opacity: 0.3; }\r\n        .level-rational { \r\n            background: #27ae60; \r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n            box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--primary-color);\r\n            transform: scale(1.02);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .check-icon {\r\n            color: var(--success-color);\r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n            margin-right: 5px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .cross-icon {\r\n            color: var(--accent-color);\r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n            margin-right: 5px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .footer {\r\n            text-align: center;\r\n            font-size: 0.8rem;\r\n            color: #7f8c8d;\r\n            margin-top: 20px;\r\n            padding-top: 10px;\r\n            border-top: 1px solid #eee;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        ul {\r\n            padding-left: 20px;\r\n            margin: 0;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        li {\r\n            margin-bottom: 8px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .latin {\r\n            font-style: italic;\r\n            color: #555;\r\n        }\r\n    </style>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n    <div class=\"header\">\r\n        <h1>MBE 考点解析</h1>\r\n        <div class=\"subtitle\">宪法：平等保护与经济监管</div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"content\">\r\n        <!-- 核心结论 -->\r\n        <div class=\"card\">\r\n            <div class=\"card-title\">✅ 正确答案：C</div>\r\n            <p>法院应维持该法律，因为立法机关可以合理地认为，不隶属于医院的诊断中心比医院的可靠性更低。</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 考点详解 -->\r\n        <div class=\"concept-box\">\r\n            <div class=\"card-title\">⚖️ 核心考点：合理基础审查 (Rational Basis Review)</div>\r\n            <p>本题考查的是法院对<b>经济或社会福利立法</b>（Economic or Social Welfare Legislation）进行宪法审查的标准。</p>\r\n            \r\n            <p>当法律不涉及<b>基本权利</b>（Fundamental Rights，如言论自由、投票权）也不涉及<b>可疑分类</b>（Suspect Classifications，如种族、国籍）时，法院适用最低级别的审查标准，即<b>合理基础审查</b>。</p>\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"chart-container\">\r\n                <div class=\"level level-strict\">严格审查 (Strict Scrutiny)<br><small>种族、基本权利</small></div>\r\n                <div class=\"level level-intermediate\">中度审查 (Intermediate Scrutiny)<br><small>性别、非婚生子女</small></div>\r\n                <div class=\"level level-rational\">合理基础审查 (Rational Basis)<br><small>经济监管、年龄、财富等</small></div>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <p><b>审查标准公式：</b></p>\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li><b>举证责任：</b> 原告（挑战者）。</li>\r\n                <li><b>测试内容：</b> 法律必须与一个<b>合法的州利益</b> (Legitimate State Interest) 具有<b>合理关联</b> (Rationally Related)。</li>\r\n                <li><b>极度宽容：</b> 只要立法机关的理由是“可想象的”或“理论上合理的”，法律就会被维持。法院不会去判断该法律是否真的明智或有效。</li>\r\n            </ul>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 案情分析 -->\r\n        <div class=\"concept-box\">\r\n            <div class=\"card-title\">🔍 结合本案分析</div>\r\n            <p><b>1. 权利性质：</b> 医生经营“诊断中心”属于商业行为，不属于宪法保护的基本权利。</p>\r\n            <p><b>2. 分类性质：</b> 法律区分了“隶属于医院的中心”和“独立中心”，这不属于种族或性别分类，仅仅是经济分类。</p>\r\n            <p><b>3. 结论：</b> 适用合理基础审查。</p>\r\n            <p><b>4. 逻辑推演：</b> 州政府声称医院更可靠（合法的健康安全利益）。虽然这可能有争议，但立法机关<b>“可以合理地相信”</b>这一点。这就足够了。</p>\r\n            <p>这让人联想到著名的 <i>Williamson v. Lee Optical</i> 案，法院在该案中表明，对于经济监管，法院不会充当“超级立法机关”去纠正不明智的法律。</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 排除错误选项 -->\r\n        <div class=\"concept-box\" style=\"background-color: #fff5f5; border-color: #feb2b2;\">\r\n            <div class=\"card-title\" style=\"color: #c0392b;\">❌ 为什么其他选项错误？</div>\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li><span class=\"cross-icon\">A</span> <b>成熟性 (Ripeness)：</b> 错误。医生们已经有了“立即实施的计划”且法律已经颁布，面临迫在眉睫的执法威胁，因此案件已经成熟，可以审理。</li>\r\n                <li><span class=\"cross-icon\">B</span> <b>不当负担 (Undue Burden)：</b> 错误。这个术语通常用于堕胎权（基本权利）的分析。经营医疗业务并非基本权利，因此不需要证明法律施加了不当负担。</li>\r\n                <li><span class=\"cross-icon\">D</span> <b>不可审查 (Unreviewable)：</b> 错误。虽然州拥有警察权 (Police Power)，但所有州法律都必须服从美国宪法（至高条款）。没有什么是绝对“不可审查”的。</li>\r\n            </ul>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 考试技巧 -->\r\n        <div class=\"card\" style=\"border-left-color: #f1c40f; background: #fffcf0;\">\r\n            <div class=\"card-title\" style=\"color: #d35400;\">💡 MBE 考试技巧</div>\r\n            <p>在宪法题中，如果看到州政府监管<b>商业、经济或一般社会福利</b>，且不涉及种族歧视或言论自由：</p>\r\n            <ol>\r\n                <li>默认适用<b>合理基础审查 (Rational Basis)</b>。</li>\r\n                <li>寻找包含<b>“合理 (Rationally)”</b>、<b>“合法利益 (Legitimate Interest)”</b> 字眼的选项。</li>\r\n                <li>记住：在这类审查下，政府几乎总是赢家（法律被维持）。</li>\r\n            </ol>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n    </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n</html>",
      "meta": {
        "question_analysis": {
          "micro_concept": "Rational basis review equal protection",
          "trap_type": "Rule Exception Overlooked",
