    {
      "index": 33,
      "subject": "Constitutional Law",
      "chapter": "Individual Rights",
      "topic": "Equal protection",
      "count": 120,
      "question": "A public high school has had a very high rate of pregnancy among its students. In order to assist students who keep their babies to complete high school, the school has established an infant day-care center for children of its students, and also offers classes in child care. Because the child-care classes are always overcrowded, the school limits admission to those classes solely to students who are the mothers of babies in the infant day-care center.\nA male student at the high school has legal custody of his infant son. The school provides care for his son in its infant day-care center, but will not allow the student to enroll in the child-care classes. He brings suit against the school challenging, on constitutional grounds, his exclusion from the child-care classes.\nWhich of the following best states the burden of persuasion in this case?",
      "choices": {
        "A": "The male student must demonstrate that the admission requirement is not as narrowly drawn as possible to achieve a substantial governmental interest.",
        "B": "The male student must demonstrate that the admission requirement is not rationally related to a legitimate governmental interest.",
        "C": "The school must demonstrate that the admission policy is substantially related to an important governmental interest.",
        "D": "The school must demonstrate that the admission policy is the least restrictive means by which to achieve a compelling governmental interest."
      },
      "answer": "C",
      "source_img": "source_imgs/q0033.png",
      "explanation": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n<title>Explanation</title>\n<style>\n  body{\n    margin:0;\n    font-size:1rem;\n    line-height:1.7;\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    color:#222;\n    background:#fff;\n  }\n  .pbx-explanation{\n    padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;\n    box-sizing:border-box;\n    max-width:100%;\n  }\n  .pbx-explanation *{\n    box-sizing:border-box;\n  }\n  .pbx-explanation h1,\n  .pbx-explanation h2,\n  .pbx-explanation h3,\n  .pbx-explanation p,\n  .pbx-explanation ul,\n  .pbx-explanation ol{\n    margin:0 0 0.85em 0;\n  }\n  .pbx-center{\n    text-align:center;\n  }\n  .pbx-title{\n    font-size:1.35rem;\n    font-weight:700;\n    margin:0 0 1.1rem 0;\n  }\n  .pbx-flow-wrap{\n    margin:0.8rem 0 1.1rem 0;\n  }\n  .pbx-scroll-x{\n    overflow-x:auto;\n    -webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;\n    margin:16px 0;\n  }\n  .pbx-flow-inner{\n    min-width:900px;\n    padding:0.2rem 0.2rem 0.8rem 0.2rem;\n  }\n  .pbx-flow-title{\n    text-align:center;\n    font-size:1.35rem;\n    font-weight:700;\n    margin:0 0 1.1rem 0;\n  }\n  .pbx-flow-top{\n    display:flex;\n    justify-content:center;\n    align-items:center;\n    margin-bottom:0.7rem;\n  }\n  .pbx-flow-box{\n    display:inline-block;\n    max-width:560px;\n    width:100%;\n    border:1px solid #d7d7d7;\n    border-radius:0.45rem;\n    background:#fff;\n    box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\n    padding:0.85rem 1rem;\n    text-align:center;\n    font-size:1rem;\n    line-height:1.45;\n  }\n  .pbx-flow-box .pbx-small{\n    font-size:0.96rem;\n  }\n  .pbx-arrow{\n    font-size:1.25rem;\n    line-height:1;\n    color:#666;\n    text-align:center;\n    margin:0.1rem 0;\n  }\n  .pbx-branch{\n    display:flex;\n    justify-content:space-between;\n    align-items:flex-start;\n    gap:1rem;\n    margin-top:0.3rem;\n  }\n  .pbx-branch-col{\n    flex:1 1 0;\n    min-width:0;\n  }\n  .pbx-branch-label{\n    text-align:center;\n    font-size:1rem;\n    margin-bottom:0.3rem;\n  }\n  .pbx-branch-line{\n    width:100%;\n    height:1px;\n    background:#444;\n    margin:0.3rem 0 0.8rem 0;\n  }\n  .pbx-card{\n    border:1px solid #d3d3d3;\n    border-radius:0.35rem;\n    box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\n    background:#fff;\n    overflow:hidden;\n  }\n  .pbx-card-h{\n    background:#f2f2f2;\n    border-bottom:1px solid #d3d3d3;\n    padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;\n    font-weight:700;\n    text-align:left;\n  }\n  .pbx-card-b{\n    padding:0.8rem 0.9rem;\n    text-align:left;\n    line-height:1.45;\n  }\n  .pbx-list{\n    margin:0.35rem 0 0 1.2rem;\n    padding:0;\n  }\n  .pbx-list li{\n    margin:0.15rem 0;\n  }\n  .pbx-grid{\n    display:grid;\n    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;\n    gap:1rem;\n    align-items:start;\n  }\n  .pbx-flow-bottom{\n    margin-top:0.6rem;\n    display:grid;\n    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;\n    gap:1rem;\n  }\n  .pbx-center-line{\n    text-align:center;\n    margin:0.35rem 0;\n  }\n  .pbx-text{\n    font-size:1rem;\n  }\n  .pbx-para{\n    margin:0 0 0.95em 0;\n    text-align:left;\n  }\n  .pbx-edu-objective{\n    background:#f0f7ff;\n    border-left:4px solid #3498db;\n    border-radius:6px;\n    padding:14px 18px;\n    margin:24px 0;\n  }\n  .pbx-edu-objective-title{\n    font-size:13px;\n    font-weight:700;\n    color:#2980b9;\n    text-transform:uppercase;\n    letter-spacing:0.05em;\n    margin-bottom:8px;\n  }\n  .pbx-references{\n    background:#fafafa;\n    border:1px solid #e0e0e0;\n    border-radius:6px;\n    padding:14px 18px;\n    margin:20px 0;\n  }\n  .pbx-references-title{\n    font-size:13px;\n    font-weight:700;\n    color:#555;\n    text-transform:uppercase;\n    letter-spacing:0.05em;\n    margin-bottom:8px;\n  }\n  .pbx-ref-list{\n    margin:0;\n    padding-left:18px;\n    font-size:14px;\n    color:#555;\n    line-height:1.7;\n  }\n  .pbx-note{\n    font-size:0.96rem;\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 640px){\n    body{ font-size:0.95rem; padding:0.75rem; }\n    .pbx-explanation{ padding:0.875rem 1rem; }\n    .pbx-title,.pbx-flow-title{ font-size:1.15rem; }\n    .pbx-flow-inner{ min-width:860px; }\n    .pbx-card-b,.pbx-flow-box,.pbx-text{ font-size:0.95rem; }\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<!-- pbx-topic: Equal protection -->\n<div class=\"pbx-explanation\">\n  <div class=\"pbx-flow-wrap\">\n    <div class=\"pbx-flow-title\">Equal protection analysis</div>\n    <div class=\"pbx-scroll-x\">\n      <div class=\"pbx-flow-inner\">\n        <div class=\"pbx-flow-top\">\n          <div class=\"pbx-flow-box\">\n            Was government action discriminatory?<br>\n            <span class=\"pbx-small\">(ie, treated similarly situated persons differently)</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"pbx-arrow\">Yes</div>\n        <div class=\"pbx-branch-line\"></div>\n        <div class=\"pbx-branch\">\n          <div class=\"pbx-branch-col\" style=\"max-width:30%;\">\n            <div class=\"pbx-branch-label\">Default</div>\n            <div class=\"pbx-arrow\">↓</div>\n            <div class=\"pbx-card\">\n              <div class=\"pbx-card-h\">Rational basis test</div>\n              <div class=\"pbx-card-b\">\n                Challenger must show\n                <ul class=\"pbx-list\">\n                  <li>law is not rationally related to</li>\n                  <li>legitimate state interest</li>\n                </ul>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"pbx-branch-col\" style=\"max-width:65%;\">\n            <div class=\"pbx-branch-label\">Exception</div>\n            <div class=\"pbx-arrow\">↓</div>\n            <div class=\"pbx-card\" style=\"padding:0;\">\n              <div class=\"pbx-card-b\" style=\"padding:0;\">\n                <div class=\"pbx-grid\" style=\"padding:0;\">\n                  <div class=\"pbx-card\" style=\"box-shadow:none;border:none;border-right:1px solid #d3d3d3;border-radius:0;\">\n                    <div class=\"pbx-card-h\">Government action substantially impacts:</div>\n                    <div class=\"pbx-card-b\">\n                      <strong>Quasi-suspect class</strong>\n                      <ul class=\"pbx-list\">\n                        <li>Sex/gender*</li>\n                        <li>Legitimacy</li>\n                      </ul>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                  <div class=\"pbx-card\" style=\"box-shadow:none;border:none;border-right:1px solid #d3d3d3;border-radius:0;\">\n                    <div class=\"pbx-card-h\">&nbsp;</div>\n                    <div class=\"pbx-card-b\">\n                      <strong>Suspect class</strong>\n                      <ul class=\"pbx-list\">\n                        <li>Ethnicity</li>\n                        <li>Citizenship</li>\n                        <li>Race</li>\n                        <li>Nationality</li>\n                      </ul>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                  <div class=\"pbx-card\" style=\"box-shadow:none;border:none;border-radius:0;\">\n                    <div class=\"pbx-card-h\">&nbsp;</div>\n                    <div class=\"pbx-card-b\">\n                      <strong>Fundamental right</strong>\n                      <ul class=\"pbx-list\">\n                        <li>Voting</li>\n                        <li>Interstate travel</li>\n                        <li>Privacy</li>\n                        <li>First Amendment right</li>\n                      </ul>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"pbx-center-line\">Yes</div>\n            <div class=\"pbx-arrow\">↓</div>\n            <div class=\"pbx-flow-bottom\">\n              <div class=\"pbx-card\">\n                <div class=\"pbx-card-h\">Intermediate scrutiny</div>\n                <div class=\"pbx-card-b\">\n                  State must show\n                  <ul class=\"pbx-list\">\n                    <li>law is substantially related to</li>\n                    <li>important state interest</li>\n                  </ul>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <div></div>\n              <div class=\"pbx-card\">\n                <div class=\"pbx-card-h\">Strict scrutiny</div>\n                <div class=\"pbx-card-b\">\n                  State must show\n                  <ul class=\"pbx-list\">\n                    <li>law is necessary to achieve</li>\n                    <li>compelling state interest</li>\n                  </ul>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"pbx-note\" style=\"margin-top:0.35rem;\">*State must also show an exceedingly persuasive justification.</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <p class=\"pbx-para\">A government action that treats similarly situated persons differently may be challenged under the <strong>equal protection clause</strong>. The action will only be deemed constitutional if there is adequate justification for the alleged <strong>discrimination</strong>. A law that discriminates based on <strong>gender</strong> or <strong>nonmarital birth</strong> (ie, quasi-suspect classes) is presumptively invalid unless it survives <strong>intermediate scrutiny</strong>—ie, the government demonstrates that the law is <strong>substantially related</strong> to an <strong>important government interest</strong>.</p>\n\n  <p class=\"pbx-para\">Here, a public high school offers child-care classes to students with children (government action). But enrollment is limited to female students with children in the school's infant day-care center (gender discrimination). And since the male student was excluded from these classes, the admission policy will only be found constitutional if the school meets its burden of persuasion under <strong>intermediate scrutiny</strong>.</p>\n\n  <p class=\"pbx-para\" data-choice=\"A\" data-choice-role=\"distractor\"><strong style=\"color:#9b1c1c;\">(Choice A)</strong> The male student would have had the burden to prove that there was no adequate justification for the admission policy if rational basis review applied. And there is no burden of persuasion that requires proof that a government action be as narrowly drawn as possible to achieve a substantial government interest.</p>\n\n  <p class=\"pbx-para\" data-choice=\"B\" data-choice-role=\"distractor\"><strong style=\"color:#9b1c1c;\">(Choice B)</strong> Generally, a challenger must prove that the government action does not rationally relate to a legitimate government interest (ie, rational basis review). But this burden of persuasion does not apply when the government action impacts a fundamental right, suspect class, or quasi-suspect class (as seen here).</p>\n\n  <p class=\"pbx-para\" data-choice=\"D\" data-choice-role=\"distractor\"><strong style=\"color:#9b1c1c;\">(Choice D)</strong> The school would have had to demonstrate that the admission policy is the least restrictive means to achieve a compelling government interest (ie, strict scrutiny) had the policy impacted a fundamental right or suspect class. But here, the policy affected a quasi-suspect class (gender).</p>\n\n  <div class=\"pbx-edu-objective\">\n    <div class=\"pbx-edu-objective-title\">📌 Educational Objective</div>\n    <p>A government action challenged under the equal protection clause is subject to intermediate scrutiny if it discriminates against a quasi-suspect class (ie, sex/gender, nonmarital children). Intermediate scrutiny requires the government to prove that its action is substantially related to an important government interest.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pbx-references\">\n    <div class=\"pbx-references-title\">📚 References</div>\n    <ul class=\"pbx-ref-list\">\n      <li>U.S. Const. amend. XIV (equal protection clause).</li>\n      <li>Craig v. Boren, 429 U.S. 190, 197 (1976) (holding that state discrimination based on sex/gender places the burden on the state to show that its action is substantially related to an important government interest).</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "zh-question": "一所公立高中的学生怀孕率一直很高。为了帮助那些留下孩子并完成高中学业的学生，该学校为本校学生的孩子设立了一个婴儿日托中心，并提供育儿课程。由于育儿课程总是人满为患，学校将入学资格仅限于在学校婴儿日托中心有婴儿的母亲学生。\n\n该高中的一名男学生拥有其幼子的合法监护权。学校在其婴儿日托中心为他的儿子提供照料，但不允许该男学生参加育儿课程。他以宪法为由对学校提起诉讼，质疑他被排除在育儿课程之外的决定。\n\n以下哪项最能说明本案中的说服责任（burden of persuasion）？",
      "zh-choices": {
        "A": "该男学生必须证明，该入学要求并非为实现某一重大的政府利益而尽可能地精准拟定。",
        "B": "该男学生必须证明，该入学要求与合法的政府利益没有理性关联。",
        "C": "学校必须证明，该招生政策与一项重要的政府利益有实质性关联。",
        "D": "学校必须证明，该招生政策是为实现一项强制性的政府利益所采取的限制性最小的手段。"
      },
      "zh-explanation": "<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\r\n<head>\r\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\r\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\r\n    \r\n    <style>\r\n        strong, b {\r\n            display: inline !important; \r\n            white-space: normal !important; \r\n            word-break: normal !important;\n            overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\r\n        }\r\n    </style>\r\n\r\n<style>\r\n        :root {\r\n            --primary-color: #2c3e50;\r\n            --accent-color: #3498db;\r\n            --highlight-bg: #e8f4f8;\r\n            --correct-color: #27ae60;\r\n            --wrong-color: #c0392b;\r\n            --text-color: #333;\r\n            --bg-color: #f4f7f6;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        body {\r\n            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\r\n            background-color: #eef2f3;\r\n            margin: 0;\r\n            padding: 20px;\r\n            display: flex;\r\n            justify-content: center;\r\n            color: var(--text-color);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .container {\r\n            max-width: 480px;\r\n            background: #fff;\r\n            border-radius: 12px;\r\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\r\n            overflow: hidden;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .header {\r\n            background: var(--primary-color);\r\n            color: #fff;\r\n            padding: 20px;\r\n            text-align: center;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .header h2 {\r\n            margin: 0;\r\n            font-size: 1.2rem;\r\n            font-weight: 600;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .header .sub-title {\r\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\r\n            opacity: 0.9;\r\n            margin-top: 5px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .content {\r\n            padding: 20px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .answer-box {\r\n            background: var(--highlight-bg);\r\n            border-left: 5px solid var(--accent-color);\r\n            padding: 15px;\r\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\r\n            border-radius: 4px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .answer-label {\r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n            color: var(--accent-color);\r\n            display: block;\r\n            margin-bottom: 5px;\r\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .concept-card {\r\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\r\n            border-radius: 8px;\r\n            padding: 15px;\r\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .concept-title {\r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n            color: var(--primary-color);\r\n            border-bottom: 2px solid #eee;\r\n            padding-bottom: 8px;\r\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\r\n            display: flex;\r\n            align-items: center;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .concept-title::before {\r\n            content: \"⚖️\";\r\n            margin-right: 8px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .scrutiny-level {\r\n            display: flex;\r\n            flex-direction: column;\r\n            gap: 10px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .level-item {\r\n            background: #f9f9f9;\r\n            padding: 10px;\r\n            border-radius: 6px;\r\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .level-item strong {\r\n            display: block;\r\n            margin-bottom: 4px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .level-intermediate {\r\n            border: 2px solid var(--accent-color);\r\n            background: #fff;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n.term {\n            background: transparent;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(36, 52, 71, 0.26);\n            padding: 0 1px 1px;\n            border-radius: 0;\n            font-size: 1em;\n            font-weight: 800;\n            white-space: normal;\n        }\r\n\r\n        .key-point {\r\n            background-color: #fff3cd;\r\n            padding: 2px 5px;\r\n            border-radius: 3px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .footer-tip {\r\n            background: #2c3e50;\r\n            color: #fff;\r\n            padding: 15px;\r\n            font-size: 0.85rem;\r\n            text-align: center;\r\n            border-top: 4px solid var(--accent-color);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        ul {\r\n            padding-left: 20px;\r\n            margin: 5px 0;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        li {\r\n            margin-bottom: 5px;\r\n        }\r\n    </style>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n    <div class=\"header\">\r\n        <h2>MBE 考点解析</h2>\r\n        <div class=\"sub-title\">Equal Protection & Gender Discrimination</div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"content\">\r\n        <!-- Correct Answer Section -->\r\n        <div class=\"answer-box\">\r\n            <span class=\"answer-label\">正确答案：选项 C</span>\r\n            <p><strong>学校必须证明，该招生政策与一项重要的政府利益有实质性关联。</strong></p>\r\n            <p style=\"font-size: 0.85rem; color: #666; margin-top:5px;\">\r\n                The school must demonstrate that the admission policy is substantially related to an important governmental interest.\r\n            </p>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Core Legal Reasoning -->\r\n        <div class=\"concept-card\">\r\n            <div class=\"concept-title\">核心考点：审查标准 (Levels of Scrutiny)</div>\r\n            <p>本题考查宪法第十四修正案的<strong>平等保护条款 (Equal Protection Clause)</strong>。当政府行为基于不同特征对人群进行分类时，法院会适用不同等级的审查标准。</p>\r\n            \r\n            <p>本案中，学校仅允许“母亲”参加课程，排除了“父亲”，这构成了基于<strong>性别 (Gender)</strong> 的歧视。</p>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"scrutiny-level\">\r\n                <!-- Rational Basis -->\r\n                <div class=\"level-item\">\r\n                    <strong style=\"color: #7f8c8d;\">1. 理性审查 (Rational Basis)</strong>\r\n                    <span class=\"term\">适用：年龄、财富、智力等普通分类</span><br>\r\n                    举证责任：<strong>原告 (Challenger)</strong><br>\r\n                    标准：与合法利益有理性关联。\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- Intermediate Scrutiny (Target) -->\r\n                <div class=\"level-item level-intermediate\">\r\n                    <strong style=\"color: var(--accent-color);\">2. 中度审查 (Intermediate Scrutiny)</strong>\r\n                    <span class=\"term\">适用：性别 (Gender)、非婚生子女 (Illegitimacy)</span><br>\r\n                    <span style=\"color:var(--wrong-color)\">▼ 本题考点</span><br>\r\n                    举证责任：<strong>政府 (Government/School)</strong><br>\r\n                    标准：与<span class=\"key-point\">重要的政府利益 (Important Interest)</span> 有 <span class=\"key-point\">实质性关联 (Substantially Related)</span>。\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- Strict Scrutiny -->\r\n                <div class=\"level-item\">\r\n                    <strong style=\"color: #c0392b;\">3. 严格审查 (Strict Scrutiny)</strong>\r\n                    <span class=\"term\">适用：种族 (Race)、国籍、基本权利</span><br>\r\n                    举证责任：<strong>政府 (Government)</strong><br>\r\n                    标准：为实现强制性利益采取的限制最小手段。\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Why C is Correct -->\r\n        <div class=\"concept-card\">\r\n            <div class=\"concept-title\">逻辑推演</div>\r\n            <p><strong>1. 识别分类：</strong>题目中明确指出是“男性学生”被排除，且政策基于是否为“母亲”，属于<strong>性别分类 (Gender Classification)</strong>。</p>\r\n            <p><strong>2. 确定标准：</strong>性别分类属于<strong>准可疑分类 (Quasi-suspect class)</strong>，适用<strong>中度审查 (Intermediate Scrutiny)</strong>。</p>\r\n            <p><strong>3. 分配责任：</strong>在中度审查和严格审查下，举证责任倒置，由<strong>政府（学校）</strong>承担说服责任 (Burden of Persuasion)。</p>\r\n            <p><strong>结论：</strong>选项 C 准确描述了中度审查的主体（学校）和标准（实质性关联+重要利益）。</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Why Others Are Wrong -->\r\n        <div class=\"concept-card\">\r\n            <div class=\"concept-title\">干扰项分析</div>\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li><strong>选项 A (错误)：</strong>这是混淆的表述。它试图将举证责任加给学生，且使用了类似严格审查的语言（narrowly drawn），这不符合性别歧视的法律标准。</li>\r\n                <li><strong>选项 B (错误)：</strong>描述的是<strong>理性审查 (Rational Basis)</strong>。如果只是普通分类（如年龄），原告才需证明无理性关联。但性别歧视标准更高。</li>\r\n                <li><strong>选项 D (错误)：</strong>描述的是<strong>严格审查 (Strict Scrutiny)</strong>。这通常适用于种族歧视，而非性别歧视。虽然性别歧视审查很严格，但法律上仍归类为 Intermediate。</li>\r\n            </ul>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"footer-tip\">\r\n        <strong>💡 MBE 考试技巧</strong><br>\r\n        看到 \"Gender\" (性别) 或 \"Illegitimacy\" (非婚生子)，大脑要立刻反应出三个关键词：<br>\r\n        1. <strong>Intermediate Scrutiny</strong> (中度审查)<br>\r\n        2. <strong>Important Interest</strong> (重要利益)<br>\r\n        3. <strong>Substantially Related</strong> (实质关联)<br>\r\n        <br>\r\n        <em>经典判例参考：Craig v. Boren (1976)</em>\r\n    </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n</html>",
