    {
      "index": 37,
      "subject": "Constitutional Law",
      "chapter": "Individual Rights",
      "topic": "Regulation of association",
      "count": 120,
      "question": "A state adopted a rule denying admission to its bar to anyone who was currently or had previously been a member of a subversive group. The state's bar-application form was then modified to ask applicants whether they were or had previously been members of any subversive organization. An applicant refused to answer the question and was denied bar admission on that basis. The applicant challenged the decision, arguing that the question infringed upon his freedom of association.\nIs the applicant likely to prevail?",
      "choices": {
        "A": "No, because membership in a subversive group constitutes endorsement of the group's illegal activities.",
        "B": "No, because the Constitution does not apply to the bar.",
        "C": "Yes, because a broad inquiry into an applicant's association with a subversive organization as a possible basis to deny bar admission violates the First Amendment unless it is necessary to protect a legitimate state interest.",
        "D": "Yes, because denying bar admission based on any association with a subversive organization violates the First Amendment."
      },
      "answer": "C",
      "source_img": "source_imgs/q0037.png",
      "explanation": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n  <title>Explanation</title>\n  <style>\n    body { margin: 0; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.7; background: #fff; color: #111; }\n    .pbx-explanation { padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #111; }\n    .pbx-explanation * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    .pbx-explanation .pbx-center { text-align: center; }\n    .pbx-explanation .pbx-title { font-size: 1.375rem; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 1.5rem; }\n    .pbx-explanation .pbx-flow-wrap { margin: 1.5rem 0 1rem; }\n    .pbx-explanation .pbx-scroll-x { overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; margin: 1rem 0; }\n    .pbx-explanation .pbx-flow-inner { min-width: 560px; padding: 0.25rem 0; }\n    .pbx-explanation .pbx-flow-title { font-size: 1.375rem; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.15; margin: 0 0 1.25rem; }\n    .pbx-explanation .pbx-card {\n      width: 100%;\n      max-width: 31rem;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      border-radius: 0.9rem;\n      background: #f2f2f2;\n      box-shadow: 0 0.18rem 0.7rem rgba(0,0,0,0.18);\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n    .pbx-explanation .pbx-card-head {\n      background: #d9d9d9;\n      padding: 0.9rem 1rem;\n      text-align: center;\n      font-weight: 400;\n      font-size: 1.05rem;\n      line-height: 1.25;\n    }\n    .pbx-explanation .pbx-card-body { padding: 0.9rem 1.2rem 1rem; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.45; }\n    .pbx-explanation ul { margin: 0.1rem 0 0; padding-left: 1.35rem; }\n    .pbx-explanation li { margin: 0.25rem 0; }\n    .pbx-explanation .pbx-arrow-row {\n      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 0.5rem;\n      margin: 0.9rem 0 1rem;\n      font-size: 1rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-explanation .pbx-arrow { font-size: 1.25rem; line-height: 1; }\n    .pbx-explanation .pbx-no { margin-right: 0.35rem; }\n    .pbx-explanation .pbx-yes { margin: 0.35rem 0; text-align: center; font-size: 1rem; }\n    .pbx-explanation .pbx-constitutional { text-align: center; font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 0.2rem; }\n    .pbx-explanation .pbx-main-text { margin-top: 1.25rem; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.72; }\n    .pbx-explanation .pbx-main-text p { margin: 0 0 1.05rem; }\n    .pbx-explanation .pbx-choice { margin: 1rem 0; }\n    .pbx-explanation .pbx-choice strong { font-weight: 700; }\n    .pbx-explanation .pbx-edu-objective {\n      background: #f0f7ff; border-left: 4px solid #3498db; border-radius: 6px;\n      padding: 14px 18px; margin: 24px 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-explanation .pbx-edu-objective-title {\n      font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: #2980b9; text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n    .pbx-explanation .pbx-references {\n      background: #fafafa; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px;\n      padding: 14px 18px; margin: 20px 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-explanation .pbx-references-title {\n      font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: #555; text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n    .pbx-explanation .pbx-ref-list {\n      margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; font-size: 14px; color: #555; line-height: 1.7;\n    }\n    .pbx-explanation .pbx-footer-gap { height: 0.5rem; }\n    @media (max-width: 640px) {\n      body { font-size: 0.95rem; padding: 0.75rem; }\n      .pbx-explanation { padding: 0.875rem 1rem; }\n      .pbx-explanation .pbx-title { font-size: 1.2rem; }\n      .pbx-explanation .pbx-flow-title { font-size: 1.2rem; }\n      .pbx-explanation .pbx-card-head { font-size: 1rem; }\n      .pbx-explanation .pbx-constitutional { font-size: 1.2rem; }\n      .pbx-explanation th, .pbx-explanation td { font-size: 0.825rem; padding: 0.5em 0.625em; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<!-- pbx-topic: Regulation of association -->\n<div class=\"pbx-explanation\">\n  <div class=\"pbx-center\">\n    <div class=\"pbx-flow-title\">Freedom of association<br>(inquiry &amp; punishment)</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pbx-flow-wrap\">\n    <div class=\"pbx-center\">\n      <div class=\"pbx-card\">\n        <div class=\"pbx-card-head\">Inquiry about a person’s<br>associations</div>\n        <div class=\"pbx-card-body\">\n          <ul>\n            <li>inquiry is necessary to further</li>\n            <li>legitimate state interest</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pbx-arrow-row\"><span class=\"pbx-no\">No</span><span class=\"pbx-arrow\">→</span><strong>Unconstitutional</strong></div>\n      <div class=\"pbx-yes\">Yes</div>\n      <div class=\"pbx-card\">\n        <div class=\"pbx-card-head\">Punishment for association with<br>subversive organization</div>\n        <div class=\"pbx-card-body\">\n          <ul>\n            <li>active member</li>\n            <li>knows of illegal objectives</li>\n            <li>specifically intends to further objectives</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pbx-arrow-row\"><span class=\"pbx-no\">No</span><span class=\"pbx-arrow\">→</span><strong>Unconstitutional</strong></div>\n      <div class=\"pbx-yes\">Yes</div>\n      <div class=\"pbx-constitutional\">Constitutional</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pbx-main-text\">\n    <p>The First Amendment protects the <strong>right to freely associate</strong> with any group or organization—including subversive organizations. As such, the government cannot <strong>inquire about a person's associations</strong> for the sole purpose of withholding a right or benefit because of that person's beliefs. Instead, the government must show that the inquiry is <strong>necessary</strong> (i.e., the least restrictive means) to protect a <strong>legitimate state interest</strong>. As a result, a state may deny bar membership to a candidate who refuses to answer questions about her <strong>knowing membership</strong> in a subversive group only if that refusal <strong>obstructs the investigation</strong> of the candidate's qualifications.</p>\n\n    <p>Here, an applicant was denied bar admission for refusing to answer whether he was or had been a member of any subversive organization. This question—like the associated rule—relates to the state's legitimate interest in ensuring that applicants have the requisite character and professional competence to practice law. But that interest can be protected through less restrictive means—e.g., requiring a list of references and other professional information. Additionally, the broad inquiry is not limited to the applicant's knowing membership in a subversive group. As a result, he is likely to prevail.</p>\n\n    <p class=\"pbx-choice\" data-choice=\"A\" data-choice-role=\"distractor\"><strong>(Choice A)</strong> Membership in a subversive group does not necessarily constitute endorsement of the group's illegal activities since the individual may have joined for other, nonsubversive reasons. The individual also may have tentatively agreed with the group's goals when he became a member but then rejected their activities.</p>\n\n    <p class=\"pbx-choice\" data-choice=\"B\" data-choice-role=\"distractor\"><strong>(Choice B)</strong> The Constitution (excluding the Thirteenth Amendment) applies only to government action. The rule at issue here constitutes government action since it was adopted by the state. Therefore, the Constitution applies.</p>\n\n    <p class=\"pbx-choice\" data-choice=\"D\" data-choice-role=\"distractor\"><strong>(Choice D)</strong> The government may punish individuals (e.g., by denying bar admission) who are <em>active</em> members of subversive organizations and have the specific intent to further the organizations' illegal activities.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"pbx-edu-objective\">\n      <div class=\"pbx-edu-objective-title\">📌 Educational Objective</div>\n      <p>The First Amendment prohibits the government from inquiring into a person's associations unless that inquiry is necessary to protect a legitimate state interest.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"pbx-references\">\n      <div class=\"pbx-references-title\">📚 References</div>\n      <ul class=\"pbx-ref-list\">\n        <li>Baird v. State Bar of Ariz., 401 U.S. 1, 6–7 (1971) (holding that a state can only inquire about a person's associations if it is necessary to serve a legitimate state interest).</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "zh-question": "某个州通过了一项规则，拒绝授予律师资格给任何当前或曾经是颠覆性组织成员的人。该州的律师资格申请表也相应修改，询问申请人当前或曾经是否是任何颠覆性组织的成员。一名申请人拒绝回答该问题，并因此被拒绝授予律师资格。该申请人对该决定提出质疑，主张该问题侵犯了他的结社自由。\n\n该申请人是否可能胜诉？",
      "zh-choices": {
        "A": "不会，因为成为颠覆性组织的成员即构成对该组织非法活动的认可。",
        "B": "不会，因为宪法不适用于律师协会。",
        "C": "会，因为基于与颠覆性组织的任何关联而拒绝授予律师资格违反了第一修正案。",
        "D": "会，因为为拒绝授予律师资格而调查申请人与颠覆性组织的关联，这违反了第一修正案。"
      },
      "zh-explanation": "<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\r\n<head>\r\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\r\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\r\n    \r\n    <style>\r\n        strong, b {\r\n            display: inline !important; \r\n            white-space: normal !important; \r\n            word-break: normal !important;\n            overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\r\n        }\r\n    </style>\r\n\r\n<style>\r\n        :root {\r\n            --primary-color: #2c3e50;\r\n            --accent-color: #3498db;\r\n            --success-color: #27ae60;\r\n            --warning-color: #f39c12;\r\n            --danger-color: #c0392b;\r\n            --bg-color: #f4f6f7;\r\n            --card-bg: #ffffff;\r\n        }\r\n        body {\r\n            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\r\n            background-color: var(--bg-color);\r\n            margin: 0;\r\n            padding: 10px;\r\n            display: flex;\r\n            justify-content: center;\r\n            color: #333;\r\n            line-height: 1.6;\r\n        }\r\n        .container {\r\n            max-width: 480px;\r\n            width: 100%;\r\n            background-color: var(--card-bg);\r\n            border-radius: 12px;\r\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\r\n            overflow: hidden;\r\n        }\r\n        .header {\r\n            background-color: var(--primary-color);\r\n            color: white;\r\n            padding: 20px;\r\n            text-align: center;\r\n            position: relative;\r\n        }\r\n        .header h1 {\r\n            margin: 0;\r\n            font-size: 1.2rem;\r\n            font-weight: 600;\r\n        }\r\n        .header .subtitle {\r\n            font-size: 0.8rem;\r\n            opacity: 0.8;\r\n            margin-top: 5px;\r\n            text-transform: uppercase;\r\n            letter-spacing: 1px;\r\n        }\r\n        .content {\r\n            padding: 20px;\r\n        }\r\n        .answer-box {\r\n            background-color: #e8f6f3;\r\n            border: 2px solid var(--success-color);\r\n            border-radius: 8px;\r\n            padding: 15px;\r\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\r\n            text-align: center;\r\n        }\r\n        .answer-label {\r\n            color: var(--success-color);\r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n            font-size: 1.1rem;\r\n            display: block;\r\n            margin-bottom: 5px;\r\n        }\r\n        .section-title {\r\n            color: var(--primary-color);\r\n            font-weight: 700;\r\n            border-bottom: 2px solid #eee;\r\n            padding-bottom: 5px;\r\n            margin-top: 20px;\r\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\r\n            display: flex;\r\n            align-items: center;\r\n        }\r\n        .section-title::before {\r\n            content: '';\r\n            display: inline-block;\r\n            width: 6px;\r\n            height: 18px;\r\n            background-color: var(--accent-color);\r\n            margin-right: 8px;\r\n            border-radius: 2px;\r\n        }\r\n        .rule-card {\r\n            background-color: #fff8e1;\r\n            border-left: 4px solid var(--warning-color);\r\n            padding: 12px;\r\n            border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\r\n            font-size: 0.95rem;\r\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\r\n        }\r\n        .key-term {\r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n            color: var(--primary-color);\r\n            background-color: rgba(52, 152, 219, 0.1);\r\n            padding: 0 4px;\r\n            border-radius: 3px;\r\n        }\r\n        .comparison {\r\n            display: flex;\r\n            flex-direction: column;\r\n            gap: 10px;\r\n            margin: 15px 0;\r\n        }\r\n        .comp-item {\r\n            padding: 10px;\r\n            border-radius: 6px;\r\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\r\n        }\r\n        .comp-bad {\r\n            background-color: #fadbd8;\r\n            border: 1px solid #e6b0aa;\r\n        }\r\n        .comp-good {\r\n            background-color: #d5f5e3;\r\n            border: 1px solid #abebc6;\r\n        }\r\n        .icon {\r\n            margin-right: 5px;\r\n        }\r\n        .footer {\r\n            background-color: #ecf0f1;\r\n            padding: 15px;\r\n            text-align: center;\r\n            font-size: 0.8rem;\r\n            color: #7f8c8d;\r\n            border-top: 1px solid #ddd;\r\n        }\r\n        .latin {\r\n            font-style: italic;\r\n        }\r\n    </style>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n    <div class=\"header\">\r\n        <div class=\"subtitle\">MBE Constitutional Law</div>\r\n        <h1>结社自由与律师资格审查</h1>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"content\">\r\n        <!-- 答案部分 -->\r\n        <div class=\"answer-box\">\r\n            <span class=\"answer-label\">✅ 正确答案：D</span>\r\n            <p style=\"margin:0; font-size: 0.95rem;\">申请人会胜诉，因为该调查问题过于宽泛，侵犯了第一修正案保护的结社自由。</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 核心考点解析 -->\r\n        <div class=\"section-title\">核心法律规则 (The Rule)</div>\r\n        <p>本题考查的是第一修正案中的<b>结社自由 (Freedom of Association)</b> 在政府许可（如律师执业）背景下的应用。</p>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"rule-card\">\r\n            <strong>最高法院判例原则：</strong><br>\r\n            政府不能仅仅因为一个人是某个“颠覆性组织” (Subversive Organization) 的成员就拒绝给予其公共福利或执照。\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <p>要合宪地惩罚成员身份或拒绝执照，政府必须证明以下<b>三个要素同时存在</b>：</p>\r\n        <ol style=\"padding-left: 20px; margin-top: 5px;\">\r\n            <li>该人是<b>积极成员</b> (Active Member)；</li>\r\n            <li>该人<b>知晓</b> (Knowledge) 该组织的非法目标；</li>\r\n            <li>该人具有推动该非法目标的<b>特定意图</b> (Specific Intent)。</li>\r\n        </ol>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 案情分析 -->\r\n        <div class=\"section-title\">本案分析 (Analysis)</div>\r\n        <p>本题中的关键在于州律师协会的<b>调查手段（提问方式）</b>。</p>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"comparison\">\r\n            <div class=\"comp-item comp-bad\">\r\n                <span class=\"icon\">❌</span> <b>本题中的问题：</b><br>\r\n                “你是否曾经是任何颠覆性组织的成员？”<br>\r\n                <small><i>后果：这个问题是一刀切的 (Blanket Inquiry)。它没有区分你是仅仅交了会费的“消极成员”，还是意图推翻政府的“积极成员”。因此，它不仅惩罚了受宪法保护的结社行为，还会产生寒蝉效应 (Chilling Effect)。</i></small>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"comp-item comp-good\">\r\n                <span class=\"icon\">✅</span> <b>合宪的问题应当是：</b><br>\r\n                “你是否曾是颠覆性组织的成员，并知晓其非法目标且意图推动该目标？”<br>\r\n                <small><i>这种提问方式是“限制最小的手段” (Least Restrictive Means)，符合严格审查标准。</i></small>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <p>因为申请表上的问题本身违宪（过于宽泛），申请人有权拒绝回答，且不能因此被拒绝律师资格。</p>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 陷阱选项辨析 -->\r\n        <div class=\"section-title\">陷阱选项辨析 (Distractors)</div>\r\n        \r\n        <p><b>🚫 选项 A 错误：</b><br>\r\n        <span class=\"key-term\">Guilt by Association</span>（株连）是被宪法禁止的。成员身份并不自动等同于认可 (Endorsement) 组织的非法活动。</p>\r\n\r\n        <p><b>🚫 选项 C 错误（高频陷阱）：</b><br>\r\n        选项 C 声称“基于<b>任何</b>关联拒绝资格都违宪”。这是错误的。如果申请人满足上述的“特定意图”标准，政府<b>可以</b>拒绝其资格。选项 C 的说法太绝对了。</p>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 考试技巧 -->\r\n        <div class=\"section-title\">💡 MBE 考试技巧</div>\r\n        <p>在涉及第一修正案结社自由的题目中，请寻找<b>\"Scienter\" (心理状态/意图)</b>。</p>\r\n        <ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; margin-top: 5px; font-size: 0.9rem;\">\r\n            <li>如果政府试图惩罚成员身份，必须证明 <b>Specific Intent (特定意图)</b>。</li>\r\n            <li>如果题目中的法律或规则没有包含“特定意图”的要求，该规则通常是<b>Overbroad (过于宽泛)</b> 且违宪的。</li>\r\n            <li>相关判例参考：<span class=\"latin\">Baird v. State Bar of Arizona</span> (1971)。</li>\r\n        </ul>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    \r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n</html>",
      "meta": {
