    {
      "index": 41,
      "subject": "Constitutional Law",
      "chapter": "Individual Rights",
      "topic": "Regulation of speech",
      "count": 120,
      "question": "Residents of a city complained that brightly colored signs detracted from the character of the city's historic district and distracted motorists trying to navigate its narrow streets. In response, the city council enacted an ordinance requiring any \"sign or visual display\" visible on the streets of the historic district to be black and white and to be no more than four feet long or wide.\nA political party wanted to hang a six-foot-long red, white, and blue political banner in front of a building in the historic district. The party filed suit to challenge the constitutionality of the sign ordinance as applied to the display of its banner.\nWhich of the following would be the most useful argument for the political party?",
      "choices": {
        "A": "The ordinance effectively favors some categories of speech over others.",
        "B": "The ordinance imposes a prior restraint on political expression.",
        "C": "The ordinance is not narrowly tailored to further an important government interest, nor does it leave open alternative channels of communication.",
        "D": "The ordinance is not the least restrictive means of promoting a compelling government interest."
      },
      "answer": "C",
      "source_img": "source_imgs/q0041.png",
      "explanation": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n  <title>Explanation</title>\n  <style>\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      font-size: 1rem;\n      line-height: 1.7;\n      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n      background: #ffffff;\n      color: #222;\n    }\n    .pbx-explanation {\n      padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;\n      max-width: 100%;\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n    .pbx-explanation * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n    .pbx-flow {\n      width: 100%;\n      margin: 0 auto 1.25rem auto;\n    }\n    .pbx-scroll-x {\n      overflow-x: auto;\n      -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\n      margin: 1rem 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-flow-inner {\n      min-width: 56rem;\n      padding: 0.5rem 0 0.25rem 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-node {\n      border-radius: 0.8rem;\n      box-shadow: 0 0.18rem 0.35rem rgba(0,0,0,0.18);\n      border: 1px solid #e6e6e6;\n      background: #f8f9fb;\n      color: #222;\n      text-align: center;\n      padding: 0.75rem 1rem;\n      position: relative;\n      display: inline-block;\n    }\n    .pbx-node.dark {\n      background: #d9d9d9;\n    }\n    .pbx-node.small {\n      font-size: 0.98rem;\n      line-height: 1.35;\n    }\n    .pbx-title {\n      font-weight: 700;\n      font-size: 1.15rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-flow-top {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: center;\n      margin-bottom: 1.2rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-branches {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      align-items: flex-start;\n      gap: 2rem;\n      position: relative;\n      margin-top: 0.6rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-branch {\n      width: 47%;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 1rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-branch-label {\n      max-width: 21rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-connector {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 1.5rem;\n      position: relative;\n      margin-bottom: 0.15rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-connector:before {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 50%;\n      top: 0;\n      width: 0;\n      height: 100%;\n      border-left: 0.12rem solid #333;\n    }\n    .pbx-connector:after {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 12%;\n      right: 12%;\n      top: 0.2rem;\n      border-top: 0.12rem solid #333;\n    }\n    .pbx-arrows {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      width: 100%;\n      margin-top: -0.2rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-arrow-down {\n      width: 0;\n      height: 1.4rem;\n      border-left: 0.12rem solid #333;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      position: relative;\n    }\n    .pbx-arrow-down:after {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      left: -0.28rem;\n      bottom: -0.05rem;\n      border-left: 0.3rem solid transparent;\n      border-right: 0.3rem solid transparent;\n      border-top: 0.4rem solid #333;\n    }\n    .pbx-mid {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: center;\n      margin: 1rem 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-mid .pbx-node {\n      max-width: 30rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-list {\n      margin: 0.6rem 0 0 0;\n      padding-left: 1.2rem;\n      text-align: left;\n    }\n    .pbx-list li {\n      margin: 0.35rem 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-note {\n      font-style: italic;\n    }\n    .pbx-body {\n      max-width: 60rem;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      font-size: 1rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-body p {\n      margin: 0 0 1rem 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-body ul {\n      margin: 0.6rem 0 1rem 1.4rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-body li {\n      margin: 0.4rem 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-edu-objective {\n      background: #f0f7ff;\n      border-left: 4px solid #3498db;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      padding: 14px 18px;\n      margin: 24px 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-edu-objective-title {\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: #2980b9;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n    .pbx-references {\n      background: #fafafa;\n      border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      padding: 14px 18px;\n      margin: 20px 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-references-title {\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: #555;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n    .pbx-ref-list {\n      margin: 0;\n      padding-left: 18px;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      color: #555;\n      line-height: 1.7;\n    }\n    @media (max-width: 640px) {\n      body {\n        font-size: 0.95rem;\n        padding: 0.75rem;\n      }\n      .pbx-explanation {\n        padding: 0.875rem 1rem;\n      }\n      .pbx-title {\n        font-size: 1.05rem;\n      }\n      .pbx-node.small {\n        font-size: 0.92rem;\n      }\n      .pbx-flow-inner {\n        min-width: 48rem;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<!-- pbx-topic: Regulation of speech -->\n<div class=\"pbx-explanation\">\n  <div class=\"pbx-flow\">\n    <div class=\"pbx-scroll-x\">\n      <div class=\"pbx-flow-inner\">\n        <div class=\"pbx-flow-top\">\n          <div class=\"pbx-node\" style=\"min-width: 18rem;\">\n            <div class=\"pbx-title\">Free speech analysis</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"pbx-connector\"></div>\n\n        <div class=\"pbx-branches\">\n          <div class=\"pbx-branch\">\n            <div class=\"pbx-node pbx-branch-label small\" style=\"min-width: 19rem;\">\n              <strong>Content-based restriction</strong><br />\n              (message, subject, or idea)\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"pbx-arrow-down\"></div>\n            <div class=\"pbx-node dark small\" style=\"min-width: 25rem;\">\n              <strong>Strict scrutiny</strong><br />\n              (least restrictive means)\n              <ul class=\"pbx-list\">\n                <li>Necessary &amp; narrowly tailored to compelling interest</li>\n              </ul>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"pbx-branch\">\n            <div class=\"pbx-node pbx-branch-label small\" style=\"min-width: 19rem;\">\n              <strong>Content-neutral restriction</strong><br />\n              (time, place, or manner)\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"pbx-arrow-down\"></div>\n            <div class=\"pbx-node dark small\" style=\"min-width: 25rem;\">\n              <strong>Intermediate scrutiny</strong><br />\n              (no greater than necessary)\n              <ul class=\"pbx-list\">\n                <li>Narrowly tailored to substantial interest</li>\n                <li>Alternative avenues of communication</li>\n              </ul>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"pbx-mid\">\n          <div class=\"pbx-node small\" style=\"min-width: 19rem;\">\n            <strong>Exception</strong><br />\n            (nonpublic forum + viewpoint-neutral)\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"pbx-mid\">\n          <div class=\"pbx-arrow-down\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"pbx-mid\">\n          <div class=\"pbx-node dark small\" style=\"min-width: 16rem;\">\n            <strong>Rational basis</strong>\n            <ul class=\"pbx-list\">\n              <li>Reasonably related<br />to legitimate interest</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pbx-body\">\n    <p>Laws that restrict an individual's right to freely communicate information and ideas through speech or conduct can be challenged under the <strong>First Amendment</strong>. The level of <strong>scrutiny</strong> applied to such challenges depends on whether the law is either:</p>\n\n    <ul>\n      <li><strong>content-based</strong> – in which case, strict scrutiny applies and the law is unconstitutional unless the government can show that it is <strong>necessary and narrowly tailored</strong> (i.e., least restrictive means) to achieve a <strong>compelling government interest</strong> or</li>\n      <li><strong>content-neutral</strong> – in which case, intermediate scrutiny applies and the law is permissible so long as the government can show that it is <strong>narrowly tailored</strong> to achieve an <strong>important government interest</strong> and leaves open <strong>alternative channels</strong> of communication.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <p>The ordinance here is content-neutral since it applies <em>easily</em> to all signs and visual displays irrespective of their message, so strict scrutiny does not apply (<span data-choice=\"A D\" data-choice-role=\"distractor\" style=\"color:#9b1c1c;font-weight:600;\">Choices A &amp; D</span>). As a result, the political party's most useful argument is that the ordinance cannot survive intermediate scrutiny.</p>\n\n    <p data-choice=\"B\" data-choice-role=\"distractor\" style=\"border-left:3px solid #c0392b;padding-left:10px;\"><strong style=\"color:#9b1c1c;\">(Choice B)</strong> A prior restraint is a highly disfavored government action that prohibits speech before it even occurs (e.g., injunction, permitting process). The ordinance here is not a prior restraint because it does not require government approval before signs can be posted—they must merely comply with the ordinance.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"pbx-edu-objective\">\n      <div class=\"pbx-edu-objective-title\">📌 Educational Objective</div>\n      <p>Content-based speech regulations must be necessary and narrowly tailored to achieve a compelling government interest (strict scrutiny). In contrast, content-neutral regulations need only be narrowly tailored to achieve an important government interest and leave open alternative channels of communication (intermediate scrutiny).</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"pbx-references\">\n      <div class=\"pbx-references-title\">📚 References</div>\n      <ul class=\"pbx-ref-list\">\n        <li>16A Am. Jur. 2d Constitutional Law § 480 (2019) (level of scrutiny applied to content-based and content-neutral restrictions).</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "zh-question": "某市居民抱怨称，色彩鲜艳的标志损害了该市历史街区的特色，并分散了试图在狭窄街道上行驶的驾驶员的注意力。作为回应，市议会颁布了一项法令，要求在历史街区街道上可见的任何“标志或视觉展示”必须是黑白的，且长宽不得超过四英尺。\n\n一个政党希望在历史街区的一栋建筑前悬挂一条六英尺长的红、白、蓝三色政治横幅。该政党提起诉讼，就其横幅的展示对该标志法令的合宪性提出质疑。\n\n以下哪一项是该政党最有效的论点？",
      "zh-choices": {
        "A": "该法令实际上偏袒了某些言论类别，而非其他类别。",
        "B": "该法令对政治表达施加了事先限制（prior restraint）。",
        "C": "该法令并非为促进一项重要的政府利益而狭义制定，也没有保留其他可替代的沟通渠道。",
        "D": "该法令并非为促进一项迫切的政府利益而采用的限制最少的方式。"
      },
      "zh-explanation": "<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\r\n<head>\r\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\r\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\r\n    <title>MBE 考点解析</title>\r\n    \r\n    <style>\r\n        strong, b {\r\n            display: inline !important; \r\n            white-space: normal !important; \r\n            word-break: normal !important;\n            overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\r\n        }\r\n    </style>\r\n\r\n<style>\r\n        :root {\r\n            --primary-color: #2c3e50;\r\n            --accent-color: #3498db;\r\n            --correct-color: #27ae60;\r\n            --wrong-color: #e74c3c;\r\n            --bg-color: #f4f6f7;\r\n            --card-bg: #ffffff;\r\n        }\r\n        body {\r\n            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\r\n            background-color: var(--bg-color);\r\n            margin: 0;\r\n            padding: 10px;\r\n            color: #333;\r\n            line-height: 1.6;\r\n        }\r\n        .container {\r\n            max-width: 480px;\r\n            margin: 0 auto;\r\n            background-color: var(--card-bg);\r\n            border-radius: 12px;\r\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\r\n            overflow: hidden;\r\n        }\r\n        .header {\r\n            background-color: var(--primary-color);\r\n            color: white;\r\n            padding: 20px;\r\n            text-align: center;\r\n        }\r\n        .header h1 {\r\n            margin: 0;\r\n            font-size: 1.2rem;\r\n            font-weight: 600;\r\n        }\r\n        .header .subtitle {\r\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\r\n            opacity: 0.9;\r\n            margin-top: 5px;\r\n        }\r\n        .content {\r\n            padding: 20px;\r\n        }\r\n        .concept-card {\r\n            background-color: #eef2f7;\r\n            border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-color);\r\n            padding: 15px;\r\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\r\n            border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;\r\n        }\r\n        .concept-title {\r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n            color: var(--primary-color);\r\n            margin-bottom: 8px;\r\n            display: block;\r\n        }\r\n        .step {\r\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\r\n        }\r\n        .step-number {\r\n            display: inline-block;\r\n            background-color: var(--primary-color);\r\n            color: white;\r\n            width: 24px;\r\n            height: 24px;\r\n            border-radius: 50%;\r\n            text-align: center;\r\n            line-height: 24px;\r\n            font-size: 0.85rem;\r\n            margin-right: 8px;\r\n        }\r\n        .step-title {\r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n            font-size: 1.05rem;\r\n        }\r\n        .option-analysis {\r\n            margin-top: 15px;\r\n            border-top: 1px solid #eee;\r\n            padding-top: 15px;\r\n        }\r\n        .option {\r\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\r\n            padding: 10px;\r\n            border-radius: 6px;\r\n            border: 1px solid #ddd;\r\n        }\r\n        .option.correct {\r\n            border-color: var(--correct-color);\r\n            background-color: rgba(39, 174, 96, 0.05);\r\n        }\r\n        .option.wrong {\r\n            border-color: var(--wrong-color);\r\n            background-color: rgba(231, 76, 60, 0.05);\r\n            opacity: 0.8;\r\n        }\r\n        .badge {\r\n            display: inline-block;\r\n            padding: 2px 6px;\r\n            border-radius: 4px;\r\n            font-size: 0.75rem;\r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n            margin-bottom: 5px;\r\n        }\r\n        .badge-correct { background-color: var(--correct-color); color: white; }\r\n        .badge-wrong { background-color: var(--wrong-color); color: white; }\r\n        \r\n        .highlight {\r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n            color: var(--primary-color);\r\n        }\r\n        .latin {\r\n            font-style: italic;\r\n            color: #555;\r\n        }\r\n        .footer {\r\n            text-align: center;\r\n            font-size: 0.8rem;\r\n            color: #777;\r\n            margin-top: 20px;\r\n            padding-top: 10px;\r\n            border-top: 1px dashed #ccc;\r\n        }\r\n    </style>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n    <div class=\"header\">\r\n        <h1>MBE 考点解析</h1>\r\n        <div class=\"subtitle\">宪法第一修正案：言论自由</div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"content\">\r\n        \r\n        <!-- 核心考点介绍 -->\r\n        <div class=\"concept-card\">\r\n            <span class=\"concept-title\">核心考点：时、地、式限制 (TPM Restrictions)</span>\r\n            政府可以对言论的时间 (Time)、地点 (Place) 和方式 (Manner) 进行限制，但审查标准取决于该限制是<b>基于内容</b>的还是<b>内容中立</b>的。\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 解题步骤 1 -->\r\n        <div class=\"step\">\r\n            <div><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><span class=\"step-title\">第一步：定性法律</span></div>\r\n            <p>首先判断该法令是针对言论的内容（Content-Based）还是中立的（Content-Neutral）。</p>\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li><b>题目事实：</b>法令要求<b>任何</b>标志必须是黑白且不超过4英尺。</li>\r\n                <li><b>分析：</b>它不关心标志上写的是“投票给A党”还是“出售柠檬水”。它只规范颜色和尺寸（物理特征）。</li>\r\n                <li><b>结论：</b>这是<b>内容中立 (Content-Neutral)</b> 的规定。</li>\r\n            </ul>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 解题步骤 2 -->\r\n        <div class=\"step\">\r\n            <div><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><span class=\"step-title\">第二步：确定审查标准</span></div>\r\n            <p>对于内容中立的言论管制，法院适用<b>中度审查 (Intermediate Scrutiny)</b>。</p>\r\n            <div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px dashed #ccc; padding: 10px; border-radius: 6px;\">\r\n                <b>测试标准 (The Test):</b>\r\n                <ol style=\"padding-left: 20px; margin: 5px 0;\">\r\n                    <li>必须是为了促进<b>重要的政府利益</b> (Important Government Interest)；</li>\r\n                    <li>手段必须是<b>狭义制定</b>的 (Narrowly Tailored)；</li>\r\n                    <li>必须保留<b>替代性的沟通渠道</b> (Alternative Channels of Communication)。</li>\r\n                </ol>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 选项分析 -->\r\n        <div class=\"option-analysis\">\r\n            <h3>选项深度解析</h3>\r\n\r\n            <!-- 正确选项 C -->\r\n            <div class=\"option correct\">\r\n                <span class=\"badge badge-correct\">选项 C (正确答案)</span>\r\n                <p><b>论点：该法令并非为促进一项重要的政府利益而狭义制定，也没有保留其他可替代的沟通渠道。</b></p>\r\n                <p><b>解析：</b>这是最有效的论点，因为它直接引用了<b>中度审查</b>的法律标准。虽然政府有权为了美观和安全（重要利益）限制标志，但政党可以争辩说：</p>\r\n                <ul>\r\n                    <li>限制所有颜色和尺寸对于达成目标来说过于宽泛（即非 Narrowly Tailored）。</li>\r\n                    <li>黑白小标志无法有效传达政治信息（即剥夺了 Alternative Channels）。</li>\r\n                </ul>\r\n                <p>只要证明法令不符合上述任何一条，政党就能胜诉。</p>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- 错误选项 D -->\r\n            <div class=\"option wrong\">\r\n                <span class=\"badge badge-wrong\">选项 D (常见陷阱)</span>\r\n                <p><b>论点：...迫切的政府利益...限制最少的方式。</b></p>\r\n                <p><b>解析：</b>这是<b>严格审查 (Strict Scrutiny)</b> 的标准。只有当法律是<b>基于内容 (Content-Based)</b> 时（例如禁止政治言论但允许商业言论），才适用此标准。既然本题法律是中立的，使用此标准进行辩护在法律上是错误的。</p>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- 错误选项 A -->\r\n            <div class=\"option wrong\">\r\n                <span class=\"badge badge-wrong\">选项 A</span>\r\n                <p><b>论点：法令偏袒某些言论类别。</b></p>\r\n                <p><b>解析：</b>这与事实不符。法令对所有标志一视同仁（All signs），没有偏袒。</p>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- 错误选项 B -->\r\n            <div class=\"option wrong\">\r\n                <span class=\"badge badge-wrong\">选项 B</span>\r\n                <p><b>论点：事先限制 (Prior Restraint)。</b></p>\r\n                <p><b>解析：</b>事先限制通常指政府要求在言论发表前获得<b>许可 (Permit)</b> 或<b>执照 (License)</b>。本题中的法令只是设定了标准，违规者事后受罚，并未要求事前审批。</p>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"footer\">\r\n            <b>MBE 考试技巧：</b><br>\r\n            看到言论限制题，先找“内容”线索。<br>\r\n            如果是通用的（如噪音、尺寸、颜色），通常是中度审查。<br>\r\n            如果是针对特定话题的，通常是严格审查。\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n</html>",
