    {
      "index": 42,
      "subject": "Constitutional Law",
      "chapter": "Individual Rights",
      "topic": "First Amendment freedoms",
      "count": 120,
      "question": "A city ordinance prohibits any type of protesting on the public sidewalks immediately in front of any abortion clinic during the one hour before and one hour after the clinic's business hours. The purpose of the ordinance is to allow a clinic's staff to safely arrive at the beginning and leave at the end of their workdays, ensuring that the clinic could consistently operate with a full staff.\nA man's wife recently died from a fatal infection caused by negligence during a procedure at an improperly staffed abortion clinic. One morning, the man sat on the sidewalk in front of the abortion clinic one hour before it opened until one hour after the clinic closed, crying silently and holding a large sign that read, \"Do your jobs!\" The man was prosecuted for violating the ordinance. The man has claimed that the ordinance is unconstitutional as applied to him.\nIs the man likely to succeed?",
      "choices": {
        "A": "No, because the ordinance is content-neutral and narrowly tailored to serve a significant government interest.",
        "B": "No, because the ordinance is necessary for the state to achieve a compelling governmental interest.",
        "C": "Yes, because prosecuting the man does not directly advance the city's asserted interest.",
        "D": "Yes, because the ordinance is vague and does not delineate the type of speech prohibited."
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "source_img": "source_imgs/q0042.png",
      "explanation": "<!doctype html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n  <title>Explanation</title>\n  <style>\n    body{\n      margin:0;\n      font-size:1rem;\n      line-height:1.7;\n      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n      color:#111;\n      background:#fff;\n    }\n    .pbx-explanation{\n      padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;\n      box-sizing:border-box;\n      max-width:100%;\n      overflow-wrap:break-word;\n      word-break:break-word;\n    }\n    .pbx-explanation h1{\n      font-size:1.55rem;\n      line-height:1.2;\n      text-align:center;\n      font-weight:700;\n      margin:1.4rem 0 1rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-explanation h2{\n      font-size:1.15rem;\n      text-align:center;\n      margin:0 0 1rem;\n      font-weight:700;\n    }\n    .pbx-scroll-x{\n      overflow-x:auto;\n      -webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;\n      margin:16px 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-flow-inner{\n      min-width:760px;\n      padding:0.25rem 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-flowchart{\n      position:relative;\n      display:flex;\n      justify-content:space-between;\n      gap:1rem;\n      align-items:flex-start;\n      margin:0 auto;\n    }\n    .pbx-flow-top{\n      display:flex;\n      justify-content:center;\n      margin-bottom:1.1rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-box{\n      box-sizing:border-box;\n      border:1px solid #d6d6d6;\n      border-radius:0.35rem;\n      padding:0.9rem 1rem;\n      background:#fff;\n      box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.03);\n      text-align:center;\n      font-size:0.98rem;\n      line-height:1.35;\n      min-width: 14rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-box strong{ font-weight:700; }\n    .pbx-box small{ display:block; font-size:0.9rem; color:#444; }\n    .pbx-node-col{\n      flex:1;\n      display:flex;\n      flex-direction:column;\n      align-items:center;\n      position:relative;\n    }\n    .pbx-connector{\n      width:100%;\n      height:1.8rem;\n      border-left:0;\n      border-top:2px solid #555;\n      margin-top:1rem;\n      position:relative;\n    }\n    .pbx-connector:before{\n      content:\"\";\n      position:absolute;\n      left:50%;\n      top:-0.35rem;\n      width:0;\n      height:0;\n      border-left:0.35rem solid transparent;\n      border-right:0.35rem solid transparent;\n      border-top:0.5rem solid #555;\n      transform:translateX(-50%);\n    }\n    .pbx-flow-row{\n      display:flex;\n      justify-content:space-between;\n      gap:1rem;\n      margin-top:0.2rem;\n      align-items:flex-start;\n    }\n    .pbx-card{\n      border:1px solid #d9d9d9;\n      border-radius:0.35rem;\n      overflow:hidden;\n      width:100%;\n      background:#fff;\n    }\n    .pbx-card-head{\n      background:#eef1f4;\n      font-weight:700;\n      padding:0.6rem 0.9rem;\n      text-align:center;\n      font-size:1rem;\n      border-bottom:1px solid #d9d9d9;\n    }\n    .pbx-card-body{\n      padding:0.8rem 0.95rem;\n      font-size:0.95rem;\n      line-height:1.45;\n      text-align:left;\n    }\n    .pbx-card-body ul{\n      margin:0.45rem 0 0 1.2rem;\n      padding:0;\n    }\n    .pbx-card-body li{ margin:0.2rem 0; }\n    .pbx-section{\n      margin-top:1rem;\n      font-size:1rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-section p{\n      margin:0 0 1rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-indent{\n      margin-left:1rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-bullets{\n      margin:0.5rem 0 1rem 1.4rem;\n    }\n    .pbx-bullets li{\n      margin:0.35rem 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-edu-objective {\n      background: #f0f7ff;\n      border-left: 4px solid #3498db;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      padding: 14px 18px;\n      margin: 24px 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-edu-objective-title {\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: #2980b9;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n    .pbx-references {\n      background: #fafafa;\n      border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      padding: 14px 18px;\n      margin: 20px 0;\n    }\n    .pbx-references-title {\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: #555;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n    .pbx-ref-list {\n      margin: 0;\n      padding-left: 18px;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      color: #555;\n      line-height: 1.7;\n    }\n    .pbx-note{\n      font-size:0.93rem;\n      color:#222;\n    }\n    .pbx-small{\n      font-size:0.92rem;\n    }\n    @media (max-width: 640px){\n      body{ font-size:0.95rem; padding:0.75rem; }\n      .pbx-explanation{ padding:0.875rem 1rem; }\n      .pbx-explanation h1{ font-size:1.25rem; }\n      .pbx-explanation h2{ font-size:1.05rem; }\n      .pbx-box{ min-width:12rem; }\n      .pbx-flow-inner{ min-width:680px; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<!-- pbx-topic: First Amendment freedoms -->\n<div class=\"pbx-explanation\">\n  <h1>Content-neutral restrictions<br>(speech on government property)</h1>\n\n  <div class=\"pbx-flow-top\">\n    <div class=\"pbx-box\" style=\"min-width:11rem;\">\n      <div>Type of forum</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pbx-scroll-x\">\n    <div class=\"pbx-flow-inner\">\n      <div class=\"pbx-flowchart\">\n        <div class=\"pbx-node-col\">\n          <div class=\"pbx-box\">\n            <strong>Traditional public forum</strong><br>\n            <small>(eg, street, sidewalk, park)</small>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"pbx-connector\"></div>\n          <div class=\"pbx-card\" style=\"max-width:18rem;\">\n            <div class=\"pbx-card-head\">Intermediate scrutiny*</div>\n            <div class=\"pbx-card-body\">\n              Restriction <em>impermissible</em> unless\n              <ul>\n                <li>narrowly tailored to</li>\n                <li>substantial government interest</li>\n                <li>alternative channels open</li>\n              </ul>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"pbx-node-col\">\n          <div class=\"pbx-box\">\n            <strong>Designated public forum</strong><br>\n            <small>(eg, school, civic auditorium)</small>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"pbx-connector\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"pbx-node-col\">\n          <div class=\"pbx-box\">\n            <strong>Nonpublic forum</strong><br>\n            <small>(all other public property)</small>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"pbx-connector\"></div>\n          <div class=\"pbx-card\" style=\"max-width:18rem;\">\n            <div class=\"pbx-card-head\">Rational basis</div>\n            <div class=\"pbx-card-body\">\n              Restriction <em>permissible</em> if\n              <ul>\n                <li>reasonably related to</li>\n                <li>legitimate government interest</li>\n              </ul>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pbx-section\">\n    <p><em>*An absolute prohibition of a particular type of expression must satisfy <strong>strict scrutiny</strong>.</em></p>\n\n    <p>The <strong>First Amendment</strong>, which is applicable to the states through the <strong>Fourteenth Amendment</strong>, protects against governmental interference with free expression. But a reasonable restriction on the <strong>time, place, or manner of speech</strong> that occurs in a <strong>public forum</strong> (e.g., a public sidewalk) is permitted so long as it:</p>\n\n    <ul class=\"pbx-bullets\">\n      <li>is <strong>content-neutral</strong> as to both subject matter and viewpoint (here, the ordinance applies to <em>all</em> protests)*</li>\n      <li>is <strong>narrowly tailored</strong> to serve a <strong>significant governmental interest</strong> (the ordinance applies only one hour before and one hour after the clinic's business hours to allow for the staff's safe arrival and departure) and</li>\n      <li>leaves open <strong>ample alternative channels</strong> to communicate the information (protests can occur elsewhere or during the 22 other hours of the day).</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <p>However, regulations that are not content-based on their face may still be content-based in application or intent. When this occurs, the regulation is subject to strict scrutiny. But here, no facts suggest that the ordinance was passed to target certain speech or that the man was specifically prosecuted due to his message <span style=\"color:#9b1c1c;font-weight:600;\" data-choice=\"B\" data-choice-role=\"distractor\">(Choice B)</span>. Therefore, the man is unlikely to succeed.</p>\n\n    <p class=\"pbx-small\"><em>*The statute applies equally to protests against the clinic providing abortion procedures, protests against the clinic denying abortion procedures, and protests against abortion procedures that were improperly carried out (as seen here).</em></p>\n\n    <p data-choice=\"C\" data-choice-role=\"distractor\"><strong style=\"color:#9b1c1c\">(Choice C)</strong> The requirement that a regulation \"directly advance\" the government's asserted interest applies to a regulation of <strong>commercial speech</strong> (i.e., advertisements and other types of economically oriented expression). However, no commercial speech is at issue here.</p>\n\n    <p data-choice=\"D\" data-choice-role=\"distractor\"><strong style=\"color:#9b1c1c\">(Choice D)</strong> A law is void for <strong>vagueness</strong> if a person of ordinary intelligence would be unable to determine what it prohibits. Here, the ordinance is not vague because it clearly prohibits the act of protesting on the sidewalk outside the abortion clinic during the two specified hours.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"pbx-edu-objective\">\n      <div class=\"pbx-edu-objective-title\">📌 Educational Objective</div>\n      <p>Under the First Amendment, a restriction on the time, place, or manner of speech in a public forum must (1) be content-neutral as to subject matter and viewpoint, (2) be narrowly tailored to serve a significant governmental interest, and (3) leave open ample alternative channels to communicate the information.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"pbx-references\">\n      <div class=\"pbx-references-title\">📚 References</div>\n      <ul class=\"pbx-ref-list\">\n        <li>U.S. Const. amend. I (free speech clause).</li>\n        <li>Ward v. Rock Against Racism, 491 U.S. 781, 791 (1989) (setting forth the requirements for a constitutionally valid regulation of the time, place, or manner of expression).</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "zh-question": "一项市政条例禁止在堕胎诊所营业时间前后一小时内，在其正前方的公共人行道上进行任何形式的抗议活动。该条例的目的是为了让诊所工作人员在工作日开始时安全抵达，并在工作日结束时安全离开，从而确保诊所能够持续满员运作。\n一名男子的妻子最近因一家人员配备不当的堕胎诊所手术中的疏忽导致致命感染而死亡。一天早上，该男子在诊所开门前一小时直到关门后一小时，一直坐在堕胎诊所前的人行道上，默默哭泣，并举着一个写有“做好你们的工作！”的大标语牌。该男子因违反条例而被起诉。该男子声称该条例对他而言违宪。\n该男子可能会成功吗？",
      "zh-choices": {
        "A": "否，因为该条例是内容中立（content-neutral）的，并且经过狭义剪裁（narrowly tailored）以服务于一项重大的政府利益（significant government interest）。",
        "B": "否，因为该条例对于州实现一项强制性政府利益（compelling governmental interest）是必要的。",
        "C": "是，因为起诉该男子并不能直接促进该市所主张的利益。",
        "D": "是，因为该条例模糊不清（vague），没有明确界定所禁止的言论类型。"
      },
      "zh-explanation": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head><style>\n:root{--primary-color:#2c3e50;--accent-color:#3498db;--highlight-bg:#e8f4f8;--correct-bg:#d4edda;--correct-text:#155724;--wrong-bg:#f8d7da;--wrong-text:#721c24;--text-color:#333;--bg-color:#f4f7f6;--card-bg:#ffffff;--border-radius:8px}\nstrong,b{display:inline!important;white-space:normal!important;word-break:normal!important;overflow-wrap:break-word!important}\nbody{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.6;color:var(--text-color);background-color:var(--bg-color);margin:0;padding:20px;display:flex;justify-content:center;font-size:14px}\n.container{max-width:480px;width:100%;background:transparent}\n/* Header variants */\n.header,.card-header,.header-card{background:var(--primary-color);color:#fff;padding:15px;text-align:center;border-radius:var(--border-radius);margin-bottom:20px;box-shadow:0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.2)}\n.header h1,.card-header h1,.header-card h1{margin:0;font-size:20px;font-weight:600}\n.header p,.header .sub-title,.card-header p,.card-header .sub-title,.header-card p,.header-card .sub-title{margin:5px 0 0;font-size:14px;opacity:.9}\n.header + .card,.card-header + .card,.header-card + .card{margin-top:0}\n.header-title{font-size:20px;font-weight:600;margin:0}\n.header-subtitle{font-size:14px;opacity:.9;margin:5px 0 0}\n/* Content */\n.content,.content-section{padding:20px}\n/* Section headings — unified 1rem */\nh3{color:var(--primary-color);font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:20px;margin-bottom:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;padding-bottom:5px}\n.section-title{color:var(--primary-color);font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:20px;margin-bottom:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;padding-bottom:5px}\n/* Core concept / rule box */\n.concept-box,.rule-box{background-color:var(--highlight-bg);padding:10px;border-radius:4px;margin:10px 0;font-size:.95rem}\n.concept-box h2,.concept-box h3,.concept-box h4{color:var(--accent-color);margin-top:0;font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;border:none!important;padding-bottom:0!important;margin-bottom:8px}\n.rule-title{font-weight:bold;color:var(--primary-color);margin-bottom:8px;display:block}\n/* Concept cards */\n.concept-card{border:1px solid #eee;border-radius:8px;padding:15px;margin-bottom:15px}\n.concept-card h3{margin-top:0;font-size:1rem;color:var(--accent-color);border-bottom:1px solid #eee;padding-bottom:8px;margin-bottom:10px}\n/* Comparison table — solid borders, border-collapse */\n.comparison-table{margin:15px 0}\n.comparison-table h3,.comparison-table h4{color:var(--primary-color);font-size:.95rem;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:8px;border:none!important;padding-bottom:0!important}\ntable.comparison-table,.comparison-table table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:.9em}\ntable.comparison-table th,table.comparison-table td,.comparison-table table th,.comparison-table table td{border:1px solid #ddd;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left}\ntable.comparison-table th,.comparison-table table th{background-color:#f8f9fa;font-weight:bold;color:var(--primary-color)}\n/* Diagram */\n.diagram{background-color:#f9f9f9;border:1px solid #e0e0e0;padding:15px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:20px;text-align:center}\n.diagram h3{margin-top:0;border:none!important;padding-bottom:0!important;font-size:.95rem}\n.flow-container{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:10px}\n.flow-node{background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd;padding:10px 15px;border-radius:6px;font-size:.9em;max-width:90%;text-align:center}\n.flow-node.active{border-color:var(--accent-color);box-shadow:0 0 0 2px rgba(52,152,219,.3)}\n.flow-node.highlight-node{background-color:var(--correct-bg);border-color:var(--correct-text);color:var(--correct-text)}\n.arrow{font-size:1.2em;color:#aaa;line-height:1}\n/* Analysis steps — step-number floats left; step-content fills rest via BFC */\n.analysis-step{display:block;margin-bottom:14px;overflow:hidden}\n.step-number,.step-label{float:left;clear:left;background:var(--primary-color);color:#fff;width:24px;height:24px;min-width:24px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:bold;margin-right:10px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:1px}\n.step-content{overflow:hidden;font-size:.95em}\n/* Answer box */\n.answer-box{background-color:#e8f5e9;border-left:5px solid #4caf50;padding:15px;margin-bottom:20px;border-radius:4px}\n.answer-title{color:#2e7d32;font-weight:bold;display:block;margin-bottom:5px}\n/* Answer options */\n.option{padding:12px 15px;margin-bottom:10px;border-radius:8px;font-size:.9em;line-height:1.5}\n.option.correct,.option-item.correct{background-color:var(--correct-bg);color:var(--correct-text);border:1px solid #c3e6cb}\n.option.wrong{background-color:var(--wrong-bg);color:var(--wrong-text);border:1px solid #f5c6cb}\n.option-item{margin-bottom:12px;padding:10px;border-radius:6px;background-color:#f9f9f9;border:1px solid #eee;font-size:.9em}\n.option-label{font-weight:bold;display:inline-block;margin-right:5px}\n.correct-label{color:#27ae60}\n.wrong-label{color:#c0392b}\n/* Rule / trap alert */\n.rule-block,.trap-alert{background-color:#fff3cd;border:1px solid #ffeeba;color:#856404;padding:15px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:20px;font-size:.9em}\n.rule-block h4,.trap-alert h4{margin-top:0;color:#665000;font-size:.95em}\n/* Case reference box */\n.case-box{background-color:#e3f2fd;border:1px solid #bbdefb;border-radius:8px;padding:15px;margin-bottom:20px;font-size:.9em}\n.case-box h4,.case-title{color:#1565c0;font-weight:bold;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:8px;display:block;font-size:.95em}\n/* span.case-box — inline badge usage: compact padding, no line-height blowout */\nspan.case-box{display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;margin:0 4px;font-size:.85em;border-radius:4px;vertical-align:middle;background-color:#e3f2fd;border:1px solid #bbdefb;color:#1565c0;font-weight:500}\n/* Term highlight */\n.term {\n    background: transparent;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(36, 52, 71, 0.26);\n    padding: 0 1px 1px;\n    border-radius: 0;\n    font-size: 1em;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    white-space: normal;\n}\n.highlight{background-color:#fff3cd;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-weight:500}\n.key-concept{font-weight:bold;color:#e74c3c}\n/* Wrong options list */\n.wrong-options{background-color:#fafafa;padding:15px;border-radius:8px;font-size:.9em;color:#555;border:1px solid #eee}\n.wrong-options li{margin-bottom:8px}\n/* Exam tip — all variants → yellow left-bordered box */\n.footer-tip,.tip-box,.exam-tip{background:#fff8e1;border-left:5px solid #ffc107;padding:15px 20px;margin-top:20px;font-size:.9em;color:#6d4c41}\n.footer-tip{border-radius:0 0 12px 12px;margin-top:0}\n.footer{background:#fff8e1;border-left:5px solid #ffc107;padding:15px 20px;font-size:.9em;color:#6d4c41;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px}\n.tip-title,.exam-tip-title{font-weight:bold;color:#ff8f00;display:block;margin-bottom:8px}\n/* Misc */\ncode{background:#eee;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:4px;font-family:monospace;font-size:.9em}\nul,ol{padding-left:20px;margin:8px 0}\np{margin:8px 0}\n/* ── Aliases for legacy Gemini-generated class names ── */\n/* Card variants */\n.card{background:var(--card-bg);border-radius:var(--border-radius);box-shadow:0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.1);padding:20px;margin-bottom:20px;border-left:5px solid var(--accent-color)}\n.card.option.wrong{background:var(--card-bg);color:var(--wrong-text);border-left-color:#e74c3c;opacity:.95;font-size:.95rem}\n.card-title,.step-title{color:var(--primary-color);font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n/* Correct answer variants */\n.correct-answer,.answer-banner,.correct-section{background-color:#e8f5e9;border-left:5px solid #4caf50;padding:15px;margin-bottom:20px;border-radius:4px}\n/* Wrong answer / distractor variants */\n.wrong-option,.wrong-answer,.distractor,.option-wrong,.incorrect,.wrong-choice{background:var(--card-bg);border-radius:var(--border-radius);box-shadow:0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.1);padding:20px;margin-bottom:20px;border-left:5px solid #e74c3c;opacity:.95;font-size:.95rem;color:var(--wrong-text)}\n/* Option analysis wrapper */\n.option-analysis,.option-card,.option-box,.choice-analysis{margin-bottom:8px}\n/* English term / key term variants */\n.english-term,.eng-term,.en-term,.term-en,.english,.eng,.key-term,.latin-term{background-color:#e1ecf4;color:#2980b9;padding:1px 5px;border-radius:4px;font-size:.9em;font-weight:500}\n/* Analysis section variants — block containers, NOT flex */\n.analysis-section,.analysis-box,.analysis-title,.rule-section{display:block;margin-bottom:16px}\n/* Analysis step variants — same as .analysis-step (float-based) */\n.analysis-point,.logic-step,.step-item,.step-card{display:block;margin-bottom:14px;overflow:hidden}\n/* Step variants */\n.step{display:block;margin-bottom:14px;overflow:hidden}\n.step-num,.step-icon{float:left;clear:left;background:var(--primary-color);color:#fff;width:24px;height:24px;min-width:24px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:bold;margin-right:10px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:1px;flex-shrink:0}\n.step-text,.analysis-text,.explanation-text{flex-grow:1;font-size:.95em}\n/* Highlight / key point / rule card variants */\n.highlight-box,.key-point,.rule-card,.rule-section,.result-box,.answer-analysis{background-color:var(--highlight-bg);border-left:4px solid var(--accent-color);padding:15px;margin-bottom:20px;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0}\n/* Subtitle */\n.subtitle{margin:4px 0 0;font-size:14px;opacity:.9}\n/* MBE tip variants */\n.mbe-tip,.tip-box-alt,.exam-tip-box{background:#fff8e1;border-left:5px solid #ffc107;padding:15px 20px;margin-top:20px;font-size:.9em;color:#6d4c41}\n.mbe-tip-title{font-weight:bold;color:#ff8f00;display:block;margin-bottom:8px}\n/* Badge / tag variants */\n.badge,.tag,.concept-tag,.concept-term{display:inline-block;background:var(--accent-color);color:#fff;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:12px;font-size:.8em;margin-right:5px}\n.card.option.wrong .badge,.wrong-option .badge{background:#e74c3c;color:#fff}\n.badge-wrong,.wrong-tag,.tag-wrong,.wrong-badge{background-color:var(--wrong-bg);color:var(--wrong-text);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:4px;font-size:.85em;display:inline-block}\n.badge-correct,.correct-tag{background-color:var(--correct-bg);color:var(--correct-text);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:4px;font-size:.85em;display:inline-block}\n/* Case law / case ref */\n.case-law,.case-ref,.case-study{background-color:#e3f2fd;border:1px solid #bbdefb;border-radius:8px;padding:15px;margin-bottom:20px;font-size:.9em}\n/* Trap box */\n.trap-box{background-color:#fff3cd;border:1px solid #ffeeba;color:#856404;padding:15px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:20px;font-size:.9em}\n.trap-title{font-weight:bold;color:#856404;margin-bottom:8px;display:block}\n/* Timeline → diagram-like */\n.timeline{background-color:#f9f9f9;border:1px solid #e0e0e0;padding:15px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:20px}\n.timeline-item,.event{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;margin-bottom:10px;gap:10px}\n.timeline-date{background:var(--primary-color);color:#fff;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;font-size:.8em;white-space:nowrap;flex-shrink:0}\n.timeline-content,.timeline-desc,.event-desc{flex-grow:1;font-size:.9em}\n/* Party box (already in canonical, add alias) */\n.party-box{background:#e8fcff;border:1px solid #22b8cf;border-radius:6px;padding:10px 14px;font-weight:700;color:#05606a}\n/* Flow arrow alias */\n.flow-arrow{font-size:1.2em;color:#aaa;text-align:center;padding:2px 0}\n/* Distractor variants */\n.distractor-item,.wrong-distractor{background-color:var(--wrong-bg);color:var(--wrong-text);border:1px solid #f5c6cb;padding:10px 12px;margin-bottom:8px;border-radius:6px;font-size:.9em}\n.distractor-label,.wrong-title,.distractor-title{font-weight:bold;color:var(--wrong-text);display:block;margin-bottom:4px}\n/* Section/label */\n.section,.rule-item{margin-bottom:10px}\n.answer-label,.answer-title-text{color:#2e7d32;font-weight:bold;display:block;margin-bottom:5px}\n/* Concept header */\n.concept-header,.rule-header{color:var(--accent-color);font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px}\n/* Legal rule / law block variants */\n.legal-rule,.law-block,.rule-content,.legal-principle{background-color:var(--highlight-bg);border-left:4px solid var(--accent-color);padding:14px 15px;margin-bottom:16px;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;font-size:.95em}\n.result-title,.correct-title{color:#2e7d32;font-weight:bold;display:block;margin-bottom:5px}\n/* Icon (decorative) */\n.icon{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:20px;height:20px;font-size:.9em}\n/* Misc */\n.list-item{margin-bottom:6px}\n.label{font-size:.85em;font-weight:600;color:var(--primary-color)}\n.conclusion{background-color:#e8f5e9;border-left:5px solid #4caf50;padding:12px 15px;margin:15px 0;border-radius:4px}\n/* Remaining high-frequency aliases */\n.timeline-title{font-weight:600;color:var(--primary-color);margin-bottom:6px}\n.comparison-table-wrapper{overflow-x:auto;margin:15px 0}\n.text{font-size:.95em;line-height:1.6}\n.flow-label{font-size:.8em;color:#555;text-align:center;margin:2px 0}\n.diagram-box{background:#f9f9f9;border:1px solid #e0e0e0;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;margin:10px 0}\n.diagram-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;margin:6px 0}\n.diagram-content,.diagram-arrow{font-size:.9em;color:#555}\n.tip-icon,.check-icon,.logic-icon{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:.9em;margin-right:4px}\n.answer-badge{background-color:var(--correct-bg);color:var(--correct-text);padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;font-size:.85em;font-weight:600}\n.rule-list{list-style:disc;padding-left:18px;margin:8px 0}\n.rule-tag,.option-tag{background-color:#e8f4f8;color:#1565c0;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:4px;font-size:.82em;font-weight:500;display:inline-block}\n.flow-branch{display:flex;gap:8px;margin:6px 0}\n.option-title,.wrong-item{font-weight:600;margin-bottom:4px}\n.date{font-size:.82em;color:#666;white-space:nowrap}\n.explanation{font-size:.9em;color:var(--text-color);line-height:1.6}\n.wrong-item{color:var(--wrong-text)}\n</style>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>MBE 考点解析：宪法 - 个人权利</title>\n    \n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <header class=\"header\">\n            <h1>MBE 考点解析</h1>\n            <p class=\"sub-title\">宪法：个人权利 / 第一修正案自由</p>\n        </header>\n\n        <div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"answer-box\">\n                正确答案：A — 否，因为该条例是内容中立的，并且经过严格剪裁以服务于一项重要的政府利益。\n            </div>\n\n            <h2>核心法律规则</h2>\n            <div class=\"concept-box\">\n                <p class=\"concept-title\">第一修正案：时间、地点和方式限制</p>\n                <p>根据<strong>第一修正案 (First Amendment)</strong>，通过<strong>第十四修正案 (Fourteenth Amendment)</strong> 适用于各州，政府不得干预言论自由。然而，对在<strong>公共论坛 (public forum)</strong> 中发生的言论的<strong>时间 (time)、地点 (place) 或方式 (manner)</strong> 施加的合理限制是允许的，只要该限制满足以下条件：</p>\n                <ol>\n                    <li>该限制是<strong>内容中立的 (content-neutral)</strong>，即不针对特定主题或观点。</li>\n                    <li>该限制是<strong>严格剪裁的 (narrowly tailored)</strong>，以服务于一项<strong>重要的政府利益 (significant government interest)</strong>。</li>\n                    <li>该限制为沟通信息留下了<strong>充足的替代沟通渠道 (ample alternative channels)</strong>。</li>\n                </ol>\n                <p>如果一项法规未能满足上述任何一项要求，或者被发现是基于内容而制定的，那么它将受到<strong>严格审查 (strict scrutiny)</strong>，要求政府证明该法规是实现<strong>强制性政府利益 (compelling governmental interest)</strong> 所必需的，并且是<strong>最不限制性的 (least restrictive means)</strong>。</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <h2>概念比较表：公共论坛言论限制的审查标准</h2>\n            <div class=\"comparison-table-wrapper\">\n                <table class=\"comparison-table\">\n                    <thead>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>论坛类型</th>\n                            <th>定义</th>\n                            <th>审查标准</th>\n                            <th>要求</th>\n                        </tr>\n                    </thead>\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><strong>传统公共论坛 (Traditional Public Forum)</strong></td>\n                            <td>长期以来一直用于集会和言论表达的公共财产（例如：街道、人行道、公园）。</td>\n                            <td><strong>中度审查 (Intermediate Scrutiny)</strong></td>\n                            <td>\n                                <ul>\n                                    <li>内容中立</li>\n                                    <li>严格剪裁以服务于重要的政府利益</li>\n                                    <li>留有充足的替代沟通渠道</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><strong>指定公共论坛 (Designated Public Forum)</strong></td>\n                            <td>政府选择开放供公众表达言论的公共财产（例如：学校教室、市政礼堂）。一旦开放，适用与传统公共论坛相同的标准。</td>\n                            <td><strong>中度审查 (Intermediate Scrutiny)</strong></td>\n                            <td>\n                                <ul>\n                                    <li>内容中立</li>\n                                    <li>严格剪裁以服务于重要的政府利益</li>\n                                    <li>留有充足的替代沟通渠道</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><strong>非公共论坛 (Nonpublic Forum)</strong></td>\n                            <td>所有其他公共财产（例如：军事基地、机场航站楼、政府工作场所）。</td>\n                            <td><strong>合理基础审查 (Rational Basis)</strong></td>\n                            <td>\n                                <ul>\n                                    <li>限制合理地与合法的政府利益相关</li>\n                                    <li>不基于观点歧视</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n\n            <h2>事实与适用逻辑</h2>\n            <div class=\"analysis-step\">\n                <p>本案中，城市条例禁止在堕胎诊所营业时间前后一小时内在公共人行道上进行任何形式的抗议。该条例旨在确保诊所员工安全抵达和离开，从而保证诊所正常运营。</p>\n                <ol>\n                    <li><strong>论坛类型：</strong> 人行道是典型的<strong>传统公共论坛 (Traditional Public Forum)</strong>。因此，对言论的限制将受到<strong>中度审查 (Intermediate Scrutiny)</strong>。</li>\n                    <li><strong>内容中立性：</strong> 该条例禁止“任何类型的抗议”，这表明它是<strong>内容中立的 (content-neutral)</strong>，因为它不针对特定主题（如堕胎）或观点（如支持或反对堕胎）。它适用于所有抗议活动。</li>\n                    <li><strong>严格剪裁以服务于重要的政府利益：</strong> 确保诊所员工安全抵达和离开，从而保证诊所持续运营，是一项<strong>重要的政府利益 (significant government interest)</strong>。该条例将限制时间设定在诊所营业前后各一小时，这被认为是<strong>严格剪裁的 (narrowly tailored)</strong>，因为它仅限于实现该利益所必需的时间段。</li>\n                    <li><strong>充足的替代沟通渠道：</strong> 该条例仅限制了每天四个小时（营业前后各一小时）的抗议活动。这意味着抗议者在其他 22 小时内仍然可以在同一地点进行抗议，或者在其他地点进行抗议。因此，该条例为沟通信息留下了<strong>充足的替代沟通渠道 (ample alternative channels)</strong>。</li>\n                </ol>\n                <p>由于该条例满足了中度审查的所有三个要求，因此它很可能被认定为合宪。该男子不太可能成功挑战该条例。</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <h2>言论限制审查流程图</h2>\n            <div class=\"diagram\">\n                <div class=\"diagram-content\">\n                    <div class=\"diagram-title\">内容中立的言论限制（政府财产上的言论）</div>\n                    <div class=\"diagram-subtitle\">（基于时间、地点或方式的限制）</div>\n\n                    <div class=\"flow-node\"><strong>第一修正案 (First Amendment)</strong></div>\n                    <div class=\"flow-connector\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"flow-node\"><strong>言论限制类型 (Type of restriction)</strong></div>\n                    <div class=\"flow-connector\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"flow-node\"><strong>论坛类型 (Type of forum)</strong></div>\n\n                    <div class=\"flow-junction\">\n                        <div class=\"flow-junction-line\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"flow-junction-vertical\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"flow-junction-line\"></div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"flow-branch\">\n                        <div class=\"flow-branch-item\">\n                            <div class=\"flow-node\"><strong>传统公共论坛 (Traditional public forum)</strong><br>(例如：街道、人行道、公园)</div>\n                            <div class=\"flow-connector\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"flow-node highlight-node\"><strong>中度审查 (Intermediate scrutiny)</strong><br>限制<strong>不可允许 (impermissible)</strong> 除非：\n                                <ul>\n                                    <li>严格剪裁 (narrowly tailored)</li>\n                                    <li>重要的政府利益 (substantial government interest)</li>\n                                    <li>留有替代沟通渠道 (alternative channels open)</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"flow-branch-item\">\n                            <div class=\"flow-node\"><strong>指定公共论坛 (Designated public forum)</strong><br>(例如：学校、市政礼堂)</div>\n                            <div class=\"flow-connector\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"flow-node highlight-node\"><strong>中度审查 (Intermediate scrutiny)</strong><br>限制<strong>不可允许 (impermissible)</strong> 除非：\n                                <ul>\n                                    <li>严格剪裁 (narrowly tailored)</li>\n                                    <li>重要的政府利益 (substantial government interest)</li>\n                                    <li>留有替代沟通渠道 (alternative channels open)</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"flow-branch-item\">\n                            <div class=\"flow-node\"><strong>非公共论坛 (Nonpublic forum)</strong><br>(所有其他公共财产)</div>\n                            <div class=\"flow-connector\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"flow-node\"><strong>合理基础 (Rational basis)</strong><br>限制<strong>可允许 (permissible)</strong> 如果：\n                                <ul>\n                                    <li>合理相关 (reasonably related to)</li>\n                                    <li>合法的政府利益 (legitimate government interest)</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <p style=\"font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted-text); margin-top: 20px;\">*对特定类型表达的绝对禁止必须满足<strong>严格审查 (strict scrutiny)</strong>。</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <h2>陷阱警示</h2>\n            <div class=\"trap-alert\">\n                <p>MBE 考试中常见的陷阱是混淆不同的审查标准。请记住：</p>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>如果言论限制是<strong>内容中立的 (content-neutral)</strong>，并且发生在<strong>传统公共论坛 (Traditional Public Forum)</strong> 或<strong>指定公共论坛 (Designated Public Forum)</strong>，则适用<strong>中度审查 (Intermediate Scrutiny)</strong>。</li>\n                    <li>如果言论限制是<strong>内容歧视性的 (content-based)</strong>，则通常适用<strong>严格审查 (Strict Scrutiny)</strong>。</li>\n                    <li>如果言论发生在<strong>非公共论坛 (Nonpublic Forum)</strong>，则适用<strong>合理基础审查 (Rational Basis)</strong>。</li>\n                </ul>\n                <p>本案中的条例是内容中立的，因此不适用严格审查。</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <h2>正确答案与干扰项排除</h2>\n            <div class=\"option-analysis\">\n                <div class=\"option correct\">\n                    <strong>A. 否，因为该条例是内容中立的，并且经过严格剪裁以服务于一项重要的政府利益。</strong>\n                    <p><strong>正确。</strong> 该城市条例是内容中立的，因为它禁止“任何类型的抗议”，不针对特定主题或观点。它也是严格剪裁的，旨在通过限制在诊所营业前后一小时内的抗议活动来保护员工安全和诊所运营这一重要的政府利益。此外，它为抗议者留下了充足的替代沟通渠道（在其他时间或地点进行抗议）。因此，该条例符合中度审查标准，是合宪的。</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"option wrong\">\n                    <strong>B. 否，因为该条例是实现强制性政府利益所必需的。</strong>\n                    <p><strong>错误。</strong> “强制性政府利益 (compelling governmental interest)”和“必需的 (necessary)”是<strong>严格审查 (strict scrutiny)</strong> 的要素。严格审查适用于内容歧视性的言论限制。本案中的条例是内容中立的，因此适用中度审查，而非严格审查。</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"option wrong\">\n                    <strong>C. 是，因为起诉该男子并未直接促进城市所主张的利益。</strong>\n                    <p><strong>错误。</strong> “直接促进 (directly advance)”是用于审查<strong>商业言论 (commercial speech)</strong> 限制的标准之一。本案涉及的是政治抗议，而非商业言论，因此该标准不适用。</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"option wrong\">\n                    <strong>D. 是，因为该条例模糊不清，没有明确规定禁止的言论类型。</strong>\n                    <p><strong>错误。</strong> 如果一个法律的措辞过于宽泛或不明确，以至于一个普通智力的人无法确定它禁止什么，那么该法律可能因<strong>模糊性 (vagueness)</strong> 而无效。然而，本案中的条例明确禁止在特定时间段内在堕胎诊所前的公共人行道上进行“任何类型的抗议”，其措辞清晰，不具有模糊性。</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <h2>考试技巧</h2>\n            <div class=\"footer-tip\">\n                <p>在分析第一修正案下的言论限制时，始终首先确定<strong>论坛类型 (type of forum)</strong> 和限制是否<strong>内容中立 (content-neutral)</strong>。这将决定适用的审查标准：</p>\n                <ul>\n                    <li><strong>传统/指定公共论坛 + 内容中立 → 中度审查</strong> (内容中立、严格剪裁、充足替代渠道)</li>\n                    <li><strong>非公共论坛 + 内容中立 → 合理基础审查</strong> (合理相关、合法利益)</li>\n                    <li><strong>任何论坛 + 内容歧视 → 严格审查</strong> (强制性利益、最不限制性手段)</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"references\">\n                <h3>参考文献</h3>\n                <a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/wex/first_amendment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">U.S. Const. amend. I (free speech clause).</a>\n                <a href=\"https://supreme.justia.com/cases/federal/us/491/781/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ward v. Rock Against Racism, 491 U.S. 781, 791 (1989) (setting forth the requirements for a constitutionally valid regulation of the time, place, or manner of expression).</a>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"footer-meta\">\n                <div>\n                    <strong>宪法 (Constitutional Law)</strong>\n                    <span>科目 (Subject)</span>\n                </div>\n                <div>\n                    <strong>个人权利 (Individual Rights)</strong>\n                    <span>章节 (Chapter)</span>\n                </div>\n                <div>\n                    <strong>第一修正案自由 (First Amendment freedoms)</strong>\n                    <span>主题 (Topic)</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "meta": {
