      "zh-explanation": "<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\r\n<head>\r\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\r\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\r\n    \r\n    <style>\r\n        strong, b {\r\n            display: inline !important; \r\n            white-space: normal !important; \r\n            word-break: normal !important;\n            overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\r\n        }\r\n    </style>\r\n\r\n<style>\r\n        :root {\r\n            --primary-color: #2c3e50;\r\n            --accent-color: #3498db;\r\n            --highlight-bg: #ecf0f1;\r\n            --text-color: #333;\r\n            --card-bg: #ffffff;\r\n            --wrong-color: #e74c3c;\r\n            --correct-color: #27ae60;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        body {\r\n            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\r\n            background-color: #f4f7f6;\r\n            margin: 0;\r\n            padding: 20px;\r\n            display: flex;\r\n            justify-content: center;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .container {\r\n            width: 100%;\r\n            max-width: 480px;\r\n            background-color: var(--card-bg);\r\n            border-radius: 12px;\r\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\r\n            overflow: hidden;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .header {\r\n            background-color: var(--primary-color);\r\n            color: white;\r\n            padding: 20px;\r\n            text-align: center;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .header h1 {\r\n            margin: 0;\r\n            font-size: 20px;\r\n            font-weight: 600;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .header .subtitle {\r\n            font-size: 12px;\r\n            opacity: 0.8;\r\n            margin-top: 5px;\r\n            text-transform: uppercase;\r\n            letter-spacing: 1px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .content {\r\n            padding: 20px;\r\n            color: var(--text-color);\r\n            line-height: 1.6;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .question-analysis {\r\n            background-color: #fff3cd;\r\n            border-left: 4px solid #ffc107;\r\n            padding: 12px;\r\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\r\n            border-radius: 4px;\r\n            font-size: 14px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .concept-card {\r\n            background-color: var(--highlight-bg);\r\n            border-radius: 8px;\r\n            padding: 15px;\r\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\r\n            border: 1px solid #bdc3c7;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .concept-title {\r\n            color: var(--primary-color);\r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n            margin-bottom: 8px;\r\n            display: flex;\r\n            align-items: center;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .concept-title::before {\r\n            content: \"⚖️\";\r\n            margin-right: 8px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n.term {\n            background: transparent;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(36, 52, 71, 0.26);\n            padding: 0 1px 1px;\n            border-radius: 0;\n            font-size: 1em;\n            font-weight: 800;\n            white-space: normal;\n        }\r\n\r\n        .comparison-table {\r\n            width: 100%;\r\n            border-collapse: collapse;\r\n            margin-top: 10px;\r\n            font-size: 13px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .comparison-table th, .comparison-table td {\r\n            border: 1px solid #bdc3c7;\r\n            padding: 8px;\r\n            text-align: left;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .comparison-table th {\r\n            background-color: #dfe6e9;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .option-analysis {\r\n            margin-top: 20px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .option-item {\r\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\r\n            padding: 10px;\r\n            border-radius: 6px;\r\n            font-size: 14px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .option-item.correct {\r\n            border: 1px solid var(--correct-color);\r\n            background-color: #e8f8f5;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .option-item.other {\r\n            border: 1px solid #ddd;\r\n            background-color: #fafafa;\r\n            opacity: 0.8;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .badge {\r\n            display: inline-block;\r\n            padding: 2px 6px;\r\n            border-radius: 4px;\r\n            font-size: 11px;\r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n            margin-right: 5px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .badge-target {\r\n            background-color: var(--accent-color);\r\n            color: white;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .exam-tip {\r\n            background-color: #2c3e50;\r\n            color: white;\r\n            padding: 15px;\r\n            border-radius: 8px;\r\n            margin-top: 20px;\r\n            font-size: 14px;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        .exam-tip h3 {\r\n            margin: 0 0 10px 0;\r\n            font-size: 16px;\r\n            color: #f1c40f;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n    </style>\r\n    <title>MBE Question Analysis</title>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n    <div class=\"header\">\r\n        <h1>MBE 考点解析</h1>\r\n        <div class=\"subtitle\">Constitutional Law / Individual Rights</div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"content\">\r\n        \r\n        <!-- 审题关键 -->\r\n        <div class=\"question-analysis\">\r\n            <strong>⚠️ 审题陷阱：</strong><br>\r\n            题目要求选出对法律描述 <strong>“不准确 (INACCURATE)”</strong> 的选项。<br>\r\n            这意味着：<br>\r\n            3个选项是正确的法律描述（排除）；<br>\r\n            1个选项是错误的法律描述（<b>正确答案</b>）。\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 核心考点讲解 -->\r\n        <div class=\"concept-card\">\r\n            <div class=\"concept-title\">核心考点：剥夺公权法案 (Bill of Attainder)</div>\r\n            <p>选项 A 是本题的正确答案，因为它是对该法律的<b>错误描述</b>。</p>\r\n            <p>宪法第一条第10款禁止州通过 <span class=\"term\">Bill of Attainder</span>。要构成剥夺公权法案，必须同时满足以下条件：</p>\r\n            \r\n            <table class=\"comparison-table\">\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <th>特征</th>\r\n                    <th>剥夺公权法案</th>\r\n                    <th>本案中的法律</th>\r\n                </tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td><b>针对对象</b></td>\r\n                    <td>特定的个人或群体<br>(Specified persons)</td>\r\n                    <td>所有人<br>(General applicability)</td>\r\n                </tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td><b>惩罚方式</b></td>\r\n                    <td>立法机关直接惩罚<br>(Legislative punishment)</td>\r\n                    <td>通过司法审判程序<br>(Judicial trial)</td>\r\n                </tr>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td><b>审判程序</b></td>\r\n                    <td>无审判<br>(Without trial)</td>\r\n                    <td>有起诉和审判<br>(Prosecuted)</td>\r\n                </tr>\r\n            </table>\r\n            \r\n            <p style=\"margin-top:10px; font-size: 13px;\">\r\n                <b>结论：</b>本案法律针对的是“所有人”，且投递员经过了“起诉”（意味着有司法程序），因此该法律<b>不是</b>剥夺公权法案。选项 A 声称它是，这是一个<b>不准确</b>的描述，故为正确选项。\r\n            </p>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 其他选项分析 -->\r\n        <div class=\"option-analysis\">\r\n            <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; border-bottom: 2px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 5px;\">为什么其他选项是“准确”的描述？</h3>\r\n            <p style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #666;\">（因为它们描述准确，所以不能选）</p>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"option-item other\">\r\n                <span class=\"badge badge-target\">选项 B</span> <b>含糊其辞 (Void for Vagueness)</b><br>\r\n                描述准确。法律使用了“煽动性宣传品 (seditious propaganda)”一词，没有具体定义。普通人无法通过常识判断什么行为被禁止，违反了正当程序条款 (Due Process)。\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"option-item other\">\r\n                <span class=\"badge badge-target\">选项 C</span> <b>联邦豁免权 (Intergovernmental Immunity)</b><br>\r\n                描述准确。根据<b>至高条款 (Supremacy Clause)</b>，州不能监管或阻碍联邦机构（如美国邮政局）履行其授权职能。投递员在执行联邦任务，州法不能适用于他们。\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"option-item other\">\r\n                <span class=\"badge badge-target\">选项 D</span> <b>侵犯言论自由 (First Amendment)</b><br>\r\n                描述准确。虽然政府可以限制旨在煽动“迫在眉睫的非法行为 (imminent lawless action)”的言论，但禁止<b>所有</b>“煽动性”言论过于宽泛 (Overbroad)，侵犯了第一修正案权利。\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 考试技巧 -->\r\n        <div class=\"exam-tip\">\r\n            <h3>💡 MBE 实战技巧</h3>\r\n            <p>遇到 <b>\"INACCURATE\"</b> 或 <b>\"LEAST likely\"</b> 这类否定提问时：</p>\r\n            <ol style=\"padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 0;\">\r\n                <li>先在草稿纸上标记这是一个“找错”题。</li>\r\n                <li>逐一判断选项的 True/False。</li>\r\n                <li>你会发现有三个选项在法律上是成立的（True）。</li>\r\n                <li>选那个法律上站不住脚的选项（False）。</li>\r\n            </ol>\r\n            <p style=\"margin-top: 10px; font-size: 13px;\">\r\n                本题中，B、C、D 都是该法律存在的真实宪法缺陷，只有 A 是无中生有的指控。\r\n            </p>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n</html>"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "subject": "Constitutional Law",
      "chapter": "Individual Rights",
      "count": 120,
      "question": "A state law imposed substantial regulations on insurance companies operating within the state with respect to their rates, cash reserves, and financial practices.\nA privately owned insurance company operating within the state advertised that it wanted to hire a new data processor. After reviewing applications for that position, the company hired a woman who appeared to be well qualified. The company refused to consider the application of a man who was better qualified than the woman, because he was known to have radical political views.\nThe man sued the company, alleging only a violation of his federal constitutional right to freedom of expression.\nIs the man likely to prevail?",
      "choices": {
        "A": "No, because hiring decisions are wholly discretionary and thus are not governed by the First Amendment.",
        "B": "No, because the company is not subject to the provisions of the First and Fourteenth Amendments.",
        "C": "Yes, because the company is affected with a public interest.",
        "D": "Yes, because the company is substantially regulated by the state, and thus its employment decisions may fairly be attributed to the state."
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "source_img": "source_imgs/q0044.png",
      "explanation": "<!-- ERROR: rate limited -->",
      "zh-question": "某州法律对在该州运营的保险公司，就其费率、现金储备和财务实践方面，施加了重大的规制。\n\n一家在该州运营的私营保险公司刊登广告，希望招聘一名新的数据处理员。在审查该职位的申请后，该公司雇用了一名看起来非常合格的女性。该公司拒绝考虑一名比该女性更合格的男性的申请，因为他以持有激进的政治观点而闻名。\n\n该名男性起诉了该公司，仅指控其侵犯了他受联邦宪法保护的言论自由权。\n\n该男性是否可能胜诉？",
      "zh-choices": {
        "A": "不会，因为招聘决定完全是自由裁量的，因此不受 First Amendment 的管辖。",
        "B": "不会，因为该公司不受 First Amendment 和 Fourteenth Amendment 条款的约束。",
        "C": "会，因为该公司涉及公共利益。",
        "D": "会，因为该公司受到州的重大规制，因此其雇佣决定可以合理地归因于州政府。"
      },
      "zh-explanation": "<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\r\n<head>\r\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\r\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\r\n    \r\n    <style>\r\n        strong, b {\r\n            display: inline !important; \r\n            white-space: normal !important; \r\n            word-break: normal !important;\n            overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\r\n        }\r\n    </style>\r\n\r\n<style>\r\n        body {\r\n            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\r\n            background-color: #f0f2f5;\r\n            margin: 0;\r\n            padding: 0;\r\n            display: flex;\r\n            justify-content: center;\r\n            color: #333;\r\n            line-height: 1.6;\r\n        }\r\n        .container {\r\n            width: 100%;\r\n            max-width: 480px;\r\n            background-color: #ffffff;\r\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\r\n            margin: 20px 10px;\r\n            border-radius: 12px;\r\n            overflow: hidden;\r\n        }\r\n        .header {\r\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2c3e50, #4ca1af);\r\n            color: white;\r\n            padding: 24px 20px;\r\n            text-align: center;\r\n        }\r\n        .header h1 {\r\n            margin: 0;\r\n            font-size: 22px;\r\n            font-weight: 700;\r\n        }\r\n        .header p {\r\n            margin: 5px 0 0;\r\n            font-size: 14px;\r\n            opacity: 0.9;\r\n        }\r\n        .content {\r\n            padding: 20px;\r\n        }\r\n        .answer-box {\r\n            background-color: #e8f5e9;\r\n            border: 1px solid #c8e6c9;\r\n            color: #2e7d32;\r\n            padding: 15px;\r\n            border-radius: 8px;\r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n            text-align: center;\r\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\r\n            font-size: 18px;\r\n        }\r\n        .section-title {\r\n            font-size: 17px;\r\n            font-weight: 700;\r\n            color: #2c3e50;\r\n            margin-top: 25px;\r\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\r\n            display: flex;\r\n            align-items: center;\r\n        }\r\n        .section-title::before {\r\n            content: '';\r\n            display: inline-block;\r\n            width: 4px;\r\n            height: 18px;\r\n            background-color: #3498db;\r\n            margin-right: 10px;\r\n            border-radius: 2px;\r\n        }\r\n        .concept-card {\r\n            background-color: #f8f9fa;\r\n            border-left: 4px solid #f1c40f;\r\n            padding: 15px;\r\n            border-radius: 4px;\r\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\r\n            font-size: 14px;\r\n        }\r\n        .highlight {\r\n            background-color: #fff3cd;\r\n            padding: 2px 4px;\r\n            border-radius: 3px;\r\n            font-weight: 600;\r\n        }\r\n        .english-term {\r\n            color: #7f8c8d;\r\n            font-style: italic;\r\n            font-size: 0.9em;\r\n        }\r\n        .analysis-text {\r\n            font-size: 15px;\r\n            text-align: justify;\r\n        }\r\n        .trap-alert {\r\n            background-color: #fff5f5;\r\n            border: 1px solid #fed7d7;\r\n            border-radius: 8px;\r\n            padding: 12px;\r\n            margin-top: 15px;\r\n        }\r\n        .trap-title {\r\n            color: #c53030;\r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n            font-size: 14px;\r\n            margin-bottom: 5px;\r\n            display: block;\r\n        }\r\n        .footer {\r\n            text-align: center;\r\n            padding: 20px;\r\n            font-size: 12px;\r\n            color: #999;\r\n            border-top: 1px solid #eee;\r\n        }\r\n        ul {\r\n            padding-left: 20px;\r\n            margin: 10px 0;\r\n        }\r\n        li {\r\n            margin-bottom: 8px;\r\n        }\r\n    </style>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n    <div class=\"header\">\r\n        <h1>MBE 考点解析</h1>\r\n        <p>Constitutional Law: State Action</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"content\">\r\n        <!-- 正确答案展示 -->\r\n        <div class=\"answer-box\">\r\n            ✅ 正确答案：选项 B\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"analysis-text\">\r\n            本题考察的是宪法中的核心概念：<strong>州行为理论 (State Action Doctrine)</strong>。\r\n            <br><br>\r\n            简单来说，除了第十三修正案（废除奴隶制）外，美国宪法主要限制的是<strong>政府</strong>的行为，而不是私人公司或个人的行为。\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 核心考点讲解 -->\r\n        <div class=\"section-title\">核心法律规则</div>\r\n        <div class=\"concept-card\">\r\n            <strong>State Action Requirement (州行为要件)</strong><br>\r\n            宪法权利（如 First Amendment 言论自由）通常不适用于私人实体，除非该私人实体被视为“州行为者”。\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <p class=\"analysis-text\">\r\n            要将私人行为转化为州行为，通常需要满足以下两个极其严格的条件之一：\r\n        </p>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li><strong>公共职能 (Public Function)：</strong> 私人实体行使了传统上由政府<strong>专属</strong>行使的权力（例如：管理公司市镇、举行选举）。</li>\r\n            <li><strong>纠缠/参与 (Entanglement)：</strong> 政府肯定地授权、鼓励或协助了该具体的违宪行为。</li>\r\n        </ul>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 案情分析 -->\r\n        <div class=\"section-title\">本案深度解析</div>\r\n        <div class=\"analysis-text\">\r\n            在本案中，被告是一家<strong>私营保险公司</strong>。虽然州政府对其费率和财务进行了“大量规制” (Substantial Regulations)，但这不足以将其转化为“州行为者”。\r\n            <br><br>\r\n            <strong>关键推理逻辑：</strong>\r\n            <ol>\r\n                <li><strong>行业性质：</strong> 保险业虽然涉及公共利益，但并非传统上由政府“专属”行使的职能（不像监狱管理或选举）。</li>\r\n                <li><strong>规制与行为的关联：</strong> 州政府规制的是财务和费率，并没有强迫或鼓励公司进行“基于政治观点的歧视性招聘”。</li>\r\n                <li><strong>结论：</strong> 既然公司不是州行为者，它就不受 First Amendment 的约束。私人公司通常有权因为政治观点拒绝雇佣某人（除非有特定的联邦或州反歧视法规，但本题仅基于宪法起诉）。</li>\r\n            </ol>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 陷阱选项分析 -->\r\n        <div class=\"section-title\">为什么其他选项是错的？</div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"trap-alert\">\r\n            <span class=\"trap-title\">⚠️ 常见陷阱：选项 D</span>\r\n            <p style=\"font-size: 14px; margin: 0;\">\r\n                <strong>错误原因：</strong> 很多考生看到“Substantial Regulations”（大量规制）就认为构成了 State Action。\r\n                <br><br>\r\n                <strong>MBE 铁律：</strong> 仅仅是政府的许可 (Licensing)、重度规制 (Heavy Regulation) 或资助 (Funding)，都不足以让私人公司变成州行为者。必须证明政府参与了<strong>具体的</strong>被挑战的行为（即招聘决定）。\r\n            </p>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div style=\"margin-top: 15px; font-size: 14px;\">\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li><strong>选项 A 错误：</strong> 这种说法太绝对。如果招聘决定归因于政府（State Action），那么它<strong>确实</strong>受 First Amendment 管辖。A 错在前提，而不是结论。</li>\r\n                <li><strong>选项 C 错误：</strong> “涉及公共利益” (Affected with a public interest) 是政府有权规制该行业理由，但这并不等同于该行业变成了政府本身。</li>\r\n            </ul>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 考试技巧 -->\r\n        <div class=\"section-title\">💡 考试通关锦囊</div>\r\n        <div class=\"concept-card\" style=\"border-left-color: #2ecc71;\">\r\n            在 MBE 宪法题中，如果被告是<strong>私人 (Private Individual/Corporation)</strong>，第一步永远是检查是否存在 <strong>State Action</strong>。\r\n            <br><br>\r\n            如果题目中只有“政府发了执照”、“政府给了拨款”或“行业受政府监管”，通常<strong>不构成</strong> State Action。原告基于宪法的诉讼通常会失败。\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    \r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n</html>"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "subject": "Constitutional Law",
      "chapter": "Individual Rights",
      "count": 120,
      "question": "A state law prohibits dentists from advertising themselves as \"certified dental specialists\" unless they are certified by the American Dental Association (ADA) to practice the stated specialty. The state legislature passed the law to combat misleading dentist advertisements because many consumers consider ADA certification when selecting a dental provider. A dentist whose practice is limited to implant dentistry, a specialty that is not recognized by the ADA, has challenged the law as a violation of the First Amendment free speech clause.\nWhich of the following is the best argument that the state can advance for upholding this law?",
      "choices": {
        "A": "The law is constitutional because it furthers the state's substantial interest in protecting consumers.",
        "B": "The law is constitutional because it satisfies strict scrutiny.",
        "C": "The law is constitutional because misleading advertisements are not constitutionally protected.",
        "D": "The law is constitutional because the First Amendment does not protect commercial speech."
      },
      "answer": "C",
      "source_img": "source_imgs/q0045.png",
      "explanation": "<!-- ERROR: rate limited -->",
      "zh-question": "某州法律禁止牙医宣传自己为“认证牙科专科医生”，除非他们获得美国牙科协会（ADA）的认证，可以从事所宣称的专科。州立法机关通过该法律是为了打击误导性牙医广告，因为许多消费者在选择牙科服务提供者时会考虑ADA认证。一名牙医，其执业范围仅限于种植牙科（一项未被ADA认可的专科），已对该法律提出挑战，认为其违反了第一修正案的言论自由条款。\n以下哪项是该州为维持该法律有效而提出的最佳论点？",
      "zh-choices": {
        "A": "该法律是合宪的，因为它促进了州政府保护消费者的重大利益。",
        "B": "该法律是合宪的，因为它满足严格审查（strict scrutiny）标准。",
        "C": "该法律是合宪的，因为误导性广告不受宪法保护。",
        "D": "该法律是合宪的，因为第一修正案不保护商业言论（commercial speech）。"
      },
      "zh-explanation": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head><style>\n:root{--primary-color:#2c3e50;--accent-color:#3498db;--highlight-bg:#e8f4f8;--correct-bg:#d4edda;--correct-text:#155724;--wrong-bg:#f8d7da;--wrong-text:#721c24;--text-color:#333;--bg-color:#f4f7f6;--card-bg:#ffffff;--border-radius:8px}\nstrong,b{display:inline!important;white-space:normal!important;word-break:normal!important;overflow-wrap:break-word!important}\nbody{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.6;color:var(--text-color);background-color:var(--bg-color);margin:0;padding:20px;display:flex;justify-content:center;font-size:14px}\n.container{max-width:480px;width:100%;background:transparent}\n/* Header variants */\n.header,.card-header,.header-card{background:var(--primary-color);color:#fff;padding:15px;text-align:center;border-radius:var(--border-radius);margin-bottom:20px;box-shadow:0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.2)}\n.header h1,.card-header h1,.header-card h1{margin:0;font-size:20px;font-weight:600}\n.header p,.header .sub-title,.card-header p,.card-header .sub-title,.header-card p,.header-card .sub-title{margin:5px 0 0;font-size:14px;opacity:.9}\n.header + .card,.card-header + .card,.header-card + .card{margin-top:0}\n.header-title{font-size:20px;font-weight:600;margin:0}\n.header-subtitle{font-size:14px;opacity:.9;margin:5px 0 0}\n/* Content */\n.content,.content-section{padding:20px}\n/* Section headings — unified 1rem */\nh3{color:var(--primary-color);font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:20px;margin-bottom:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;padding-bottom:5px}\n.section-title{color:var(--primary-color);font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:20px;margin-bottom:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;padding-bottom:5px}\n/* Core concept / rule box */\n.concept-box,.rule-box{background-color:var(--highlight-bg);padding:10px;border-radius:4px;margin:10px 0;font-size:.95rem}\n.concept-box h2,.concept-box h3,.concept-box h4{color:var(--accent-color);margin-top:0;font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;border:none!important;padding-bottom:0!important;margin-bottom:8px}\n.rule-title{font-weight:bold;color:var(--primary-color);margin-bottom:8px;display:block}\n/* Concept cards */\n.concept-card{border:1px solid #eee;border-radius:8px;padding:15px;margin-bottom:15px}\n.concept-card h3{margin-top:0;font-size:1rem;color:var(--accent-color);border-bottom:1px solid #eee;padding-bottom:8px;margin-bottom:10px}\n/* Comparison table — solid borders, border-collapse */\n.comparison-table{margin:15px 0}\n.comparison-table h3,.comparison-table h4{color:var(--primary-color);font-size:.95rem;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:8px;border:none!important;padding-bottom:0!important}\ntable.comparison-table,.comparison-table table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:.9em}\ntable.comparison-table th,table.comparison-table td,.comparison-table table th,.comparison-table table td{border:1px solid #ddd;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left}\ntable.comparison-table th,.comparison-table table th{background-color:#f8f9fa;font-weight:bold;color:var(--primary-color)}\n/* Diagram */\n.diagram{background-color:#f9f9f9;border:1px solid #e0e0e0;padding:15px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:20px;text-align:center}\n.diagram h3{margin-top:0;border:none!important;padding-bottom:0!important;font-size:.95rem}\n.flow-container{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:10px}\n.flow-node{background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd;padding:10px 15px;border-radius:6px;font-size:.9em;max-width:90%;text-align:center}\n.flow-node.active{border-color:var(--accent-color);box-shadow:0 0 0 2px rgba(52,152,219,.3)}\n.flow-node.highlight-node{background-color:var(--correct-bg);border-color:var(--correct-text);color:var(--correct-text)}\n.arrow{font-size:1.2em;color:#aaa;line-height:1}\n/* Analysis steps — step-number floats left; step-content fills rest via BFC */\n.analysis-step{display:block;margin-bottom:14px;overflow:hidden}\n.step-number,.step-label{float:left;clear:left;background:var(--primary-color);color:#fff;width:24px;height:24px;min-width:24px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:bold;margin-right:10px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:1px}\n.step-content{overflow:hidden;font-size:.95em}\n/* Answer box */\n.answer-box{background-color:#e8f5e9;border-left:5px solid #4caf50;padding:15px;margin-bottom:20px;border-radius:4px}\n.answer-title{color:#2e7d32;font-weight:bold;display:block;margin-bottom:5px}\n/* Answer options */\n.option{padding:12px 15px;margin-bottom:10px;border-radius:8px;font-size:.9em;line-height:1.5}\n.option.correct,.option-item.correct{background-color:var(--correct-bg);color:var(--correct-text);border:1px solid #c3e6cb}\n.option.wrong{background-color:var(--wrong-bg);color:var(--wrong-text);border:1px solid #f5c6cb}\n.option-item{margin-bottom:12px;padding:10px;border-radius:6px;background-color:#f9f9f9;border:1px solid #eee;font-size:.9em}\n.option-label{font-weight:bold;display:inline-block;margin-right:5px}\n.correct-label{color:#27ae60}\n.wrong-label{color:#c0392b}\n/* Rule / trap alert */\n.rule-block,.trap-alert{background-color:#fff3cd;border:1px solid #ffeeba;color:#856404;padding:15px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:20px;font-size:.9em}\n.rule-block h4,.trap-alert h4{margin-top:0;color:#665000;font-size:.95em}\n/* Case reference box */\n.case-box{background-color:#e3f2fd;border:1px solid #bbdefb;border-radius:8px;padding:15px;margin-bottom:20px;font-size:.9em}\n.case-box h4,.case-title{color:#1565c0;font-weight:bold;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:8px;display:block;font-size:.95em}\n/* span.case-box — inline badge usage: compact padding, no line-height blowout */\nspan.case-box{display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;margin:0 4px;font-size:.85em;border-radius:4px;vertical-align:middle;background-color:#e3f2fd;border:1px solid #bbdefb;color:#1565c0;font-weight:500}\n/* Term highlight */\n.term {\n    background: transparent;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(36, 52, 71, 0.26);\n    padding: 0 1px 1px;\n    border-radius: 0;\n    font-size: 1em;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    white-space: normal;\n}\n.highlight{background-color:#fff3cd;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-weight:500}\n.key-concept{font-weight:bold;color:#e74c3c}\n/* Wrong options list */\n.wrong-options{background-color:#fafafa;padding:15px;border-radius:8px;font-size:.9em;color:#555;border:1px solid #eee}\n.wrong-options li{margin-bottom:8px}\n/* Exam tip — all variants → yellow left-bordered box */\n.footer-tip,.tip-box,.exam-tip{background:#fff8e1;border-left:5px solid #ffc107;padding:15px 20px;margin-top:20px;font-size:.9em;color:#6d4c41}\n.footer-tip{border-radius:0 0 12px 12px;margin-top:0}\n.footer{background:#fff8e1;border-left:5px solid #ffc107;padding:15px 20px;font-size:.9em;color:#6d4c41;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px}\n.tip-title,.exam-tip-title{font-weight:bold;color:#ff8f00;display:block;margin-bottom:8px}\n/* Misc */\ncode{background:#eee;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:4px;font-family:monospace;font-size:.9em}\nul,ol{padding-left:20px;margin:8px 0}\np{margin:8px 0}\n/* ── Aliases for legacy Gemini-generated class names ── */\n/* Card variants */\n.card{background:var(--card-bg);border-radius:var(--border-radius);box-shadow:0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.1);padding:20px;margin-bottom:20px;border-left:5px solid var(--accent-color)}\n.card.option.wrong{background:var(--card-bg);color:var(--wrong-text);border-left-color:#e74c3c;opacity:.95;font-size:.95rem}\n.card-title,.step-title{color:var(--primary-color);font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n/* Correct answer variants */\n.correct-answer,.answer-banner,.correct-section{background-color:#e8f5e9;border-left:5px solid #4caf50;padding:15px;margin-bottom:20px;border-radius:4px}\n/* Wrong answer / distractor variants */\n.wrong-option,.wrong-answer,.distractor,.option-wrong,.incorrect,.wrong-choice{background:var(--card-bg);border-radius:var(--border-radius);box-shadow:0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.1);padding:20px;margin-bottom:20px;border-left:5px solid #e74c3c;opacity:.95;font-size:.95rem;color:var(--wrong-text)}\n/* Option analysis wrapper */\n.option-analysis,.option-card,.option-box,.choice-analysis{margin-bottom:8px}\n/* English term / key term variants */\n.english-term,.eng-term,.en-term,.term-en,.english,.eng,.key-term,.latin-term{background-color:#e1ecf4;color:#2980b9;padding:1px 5px;border-radius:4px;font-size:.9em;font-weight:500}\n/* Analysis section variants — block containers, NOT flex */\n.analysis-section,.analysis-box,.analysis-title,.rule-section{display:block;margin-bottom:16px}\n/* Analysis step variants — same as .analysis-step (float-based) */\n.analysis-point,.logic-step,.step-item,.step-card{display:block;margin-bottom:14px;overflow:hidden}\n/* Step variants */\n.step{display:block;margin-bottom:14px;overflow:hidden}\n.step-num,.step-icon{float:left;clear:left;background:var(--primary-color);color:#fff;width:24px;height:24px;min-width:24px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:bold;margin-right:10px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:1px;flex-shrink:0}\n.step-text,.analysis-text,.explanation-text{flex-grow:1;font-size:.95em}\n/* Highlight / key point / rule card variants */\n.highlight-box,.key-point,.rule-card,.rule-section,.result-box,.answer-analysis{background-color:var(--highlight-bg);border-left:4px solid var(--accent-color);padding:15px;margin-bottom:20px;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0}\n/* Subtitle */\n.subtitle{margin:4px 0 0;font-size:14px;opacity:.9}\n/* MBE tip variants */\n.mbe-tip,.tip-box-alt,.exam-tip-box{background:#fff8e1;border-left:5px solid #ffc107;padding:15px 20px;margin-top:20px;font-size:.9em;color:#6d4c41}\n.mbe-tip-title{font-weight:bold;color:#ff8f00;display:block;margin-bottom:8px}\n/* Badge / tag variants */\n.badge,.tag,.concept-tag,.concept-term{display:inline-block;background:var(--accent-color);color:#fff;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:12px;font-size:.8em;margin-right:5px}\n.card.option.wrong .badge,.wrong-option .badge{background:#e74c3c;color:#fff}\n.badge-wrong,.wrong-tag,.tag-wrong,.wrong-badge{background-color:var(--wrong-bg);color:var(--wrong-text);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:4px;font-size:.85em;display:inline-block}\n.badge-correct,.correct-tag{background-color:var(--correct-bg);color:var(--correct-text);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:4px;font-size:.85em;display:inline-block}\n/* Case law / case ref */\n.case-law,.case-ref,.case-study{background-color:#e3f2fd;border:1px solid #bbdefb;border-radius:8px;padding:15px;margin-bottom:20px;font-size:.9em}\n/* Trap box */\n.trap-box{background-color:#fff3cd;border:1px solid #ffeeba;color:#856404;padding:15px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:20px;font-size:.9em}\n.trap-title{font-weight:bold;color:#856404;margin-bottom:8px;display:block}\n/* Timeline → diagram-like */\n.timeline{background-color:#f9f9f9;border:1px solid #e0e0e0;padding:15px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:20px}\n.timeline-item,.event{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;margin-bottom:10px;gap:10px}\n.timeline-date{background:var(--primary-color);color:#fff;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;font-size:.8em;white-space:nowrap;flex-shrink:0}\n.timeline-content,.timeline-desc,.event-desc{flex-grow:1;font-size:.9em}\n/* Party box (already in canonical, add alias) */\n.party-box{background:#e8fcff;border:1px solid #22b8cf;border-radius:6px;padding:10px 14px;font-weight:700;color:#05606a}\n/* Flow arrow alias */\n.flow-arrow{font-size:1.2em;color:#aaa;text-align:center;padding:2px 0}\n/* Distractor variants */\n.distractor-item,.wrong-distractor{background-color:var(--wrong-bg);color:var(--wrong-text);border:1px solid #f5c6cb;padding:10px 12px;margin-bottom:8px;border-radius:6px;font-size:.9em}\n.distractor-label,.wrong-title,.distractor-title{font-weight:bold;color:var(--wrong-text);display:block;margin-bottom:4px}\n/* Section/label */\n.section,.rule-item{margin-bottom:10px}\n.answer-label,.answer-title-text{color:#2e7d32;font-weight:bold;display:block;margin-bottom:5px}\n/* Concept header */\n.concept-header,.rule-header{color:var(--accent-color);font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px}\n/* Legal rule / law block variants */\n.legal-rule,.law-block,.rule-content,.legal-principle{background-color:var(--highlight-bg);border-left:4px solid var(--accent-color);padding:14px 15px;margin-bottom:16px;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;font-size:.95em}\n.result-title,.correct-title{color:#2e7d32;font-weight:bold;display:block;margin-bottom:5px}\n/* Icon (decorative) */\n.icon{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:20px;height:20px;font-size:.9em}\n/* Misc */\n.list-item{margin-bottom:6px}\n.label{font-size:.85em;font-weight:600;color:var(--primary-color)}\n.conclusion{background-color:#e8f5e9;border-left:5px solid #4caf50;padding:12px 15px;margin:15px 0;border-radius:4px}\n/* Remaining high-frequency aliases */\n.timeline-title{font-weight:600;color:var(--primary-color);margin-bottom:6px}\n.comparison-table-wrapper{overflow-x:auto;margin:15px 0}\n.text{font-size:.95em;line-height:1.6}\n.flow-label{font-size:.8em;color:#555;text-align:center;margin:2px 0}\n.diagram-box{background:#f9f9f9;border:1px solid #e0e0e0;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;margin:10px 0}\n.diagram-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;margin:6px 0}\n.diagram-content,.diagram-arrow{font-size:.9em;color:#555}\n.tip-icon,.check-icon,.logic-icon{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:.9em;margin-right:4px}\n.answer-badge{background-color:var(--correct-bg);color:var(--correct-text);padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;font-size:.85em;font-weight:600}\n.rule-list{list-style:disc;padding-left:18px;margin:8px 0}\n.rule-tag,.option-tag{background-color:#e8f4f8;color:#1565c0;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:4px;font-size:.82em;font-weight:500;display:inline-block}\n.flow-branch{display:flex;gap:8px;margin:6px 0}\n.option-title,.wrong-item{font-weight:600;margin-bottom:4px}\n.date{font-size:.82em;color:#666;white-space:nowrap}\n.explanation{font-size:.9em;color:var(--text-color);line-height:1.6}\n.wrong-item{color:var(--wrong-text)}\n</style>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>MBE 考点解析 - 宪法：个人权利</title>\n    \n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <header class=\"header\">\n            <h1>MBE 考点解析</h1>\n            <p class=\"sub-title\">宪法：个人权利</p>\n        </header>\n\n        <div class=\"content-padding\">\n            <div class=\"answer-box\">\n                正确答案：C<br>\n                核心要点：误导性或非法商业言论不受第一修正案保护。\n            </div>\n\n            <h2>核心法律规则：商业言论的保护级别</h2>\n            <div class=\"concept-box\">\n                <div class=\"concept-title\">商业言论的宪法保护</div>\n                <p>商业言论（<span class=\"term\">Commercial speech</span>），如广告，通常受到第一修正案的**中等保护级别**（<span class=\"term\">intermediate level of protection</span>）。这意味着政府对真实且不涉及非法活动的商业言论进行规制时，必须满足中等审查标准：即规制必须直接促进**实质性政府利益**（<span class=\"term\">substantial government interest</span>），且规制手段与目标**紧密相连**（<span class=\"term\">narrowly tailored</span>）。</p>\n                <p>然而，如果商业言论涉及**非法活动**（<span class=\"term\">unlawful activity</span>）或本身是**虚假或误导性**（<span class=\"term\">false or misleading</span>）的，则完全**不受第一修正案保护**。在这种情况下，政府可以自由规制此类言论，无需满足任何审查标准。</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <h2>概念比较：受保护与不受保护的商业言论</h2>\n            <table class=\"comparison-table\">\n                <thead>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th>类别</th>\n                        <th>特点</th>\n                        <th>宪法保护级别</th>\n                        <th>政府规制要求</th>\n                    </tr>\n                </thead>\n                <tbody>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>受保护的商业言论</strong></td>\n                        <td>真实且不涉及非法活动的商业言论。</td>\n                        <td>中等保护级别（<span class=\"term\">Intermediate Scrutiny</span>）</td>\n                        <td>\n                            <ul>\n                                <li>规制必须直接促进**实质性政府利益**。</li>\n                                <li>规制手段与目标**紧密相连**（不需是最小限制性手段）。</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>不受保护的商业言论</strong></td>\n                        <td>虚假、误导性或涉及非法活动的商业言论。</td>\n                        <td>无保护</td>\n                        <td>政府可以自由规制或禁止，无需满足任何审查标准。</td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n\n            <h2>案情分析与法律适用</h2>\n            <p>本案涉及一项州法律，该法律禁止牙医在未获得美国牙科协会（<span class=\"term\">ADA</span>）认证的情况下，宣传自己为“认证牙科专家”。州立法机关通过此法旨在打击误导性牙医广告，因为许多消费者在选择牙科服务提供者时会考虑ADA认证。</p>\n            <ol>\n                <li><strong>识别言论类型：</strong> 牙医的广告属于商业言论。</li>\n                <li><strong>评估言论性质：</strong> 牙医在未获ADA认证的情况下自称“认证牙科专家”，这种说法是**误导性**的。消费者可能会因此误认为该牙医具有ADA认可的专业资质，从而影响其选择。</li>\n                <li><strong>适用核心规则：</strong> 根据第一修正案对商业言论的保护原则，**误导性商业言论完全不受宪法保护**。这意味着州政府有权规制或禁止此类言论，而无需证明其规制满足任何审查标准（无论是中等审查还是严格审查）。</li>\n                <li><strong>州政府的最佳论点：</strong> 因此，州政府可以提出的最佳论点是，该法律规制的是误导性广告，而误导性广告不受第一修正案保护。这使得州政府能够直接禁止此类广告，而无需满足“实质性政府利益”或“紧密相连”等中等审查要求。</li>\n            </ol>\n\n            <h2>第一修正案言论保护流程图</h2>\n            <div class=\"diagram\">\n                <div class=\"diagram-content\">\n                    <div class=\"flow-line\">\n                        <div class=\"flow-node highlight-node\">言论类型</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flow-connector\">↓</div>\n                    <div class=\"flow-branch-horizontal\">\n                        <div class=\"flow-branch\">\n                            <div class=\"flow-node\">受保护言论</div>\n                            <div class=\"flow-connector\">↓</div>\n                            <div class=\"flow-node\">政治言论</div>\n                            <div class=\"flow-connector\">↓</div>\n                            <div class=\"flow-node\">内容相关</div>\n                            <div class=\"flow-connector\">↓</div>\n                            <div class=\"flow-node\">严格审查<br>(最严格手段)</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flow-horizontal-line\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"flow-branch\">\n                            <div class=\"flow-node active\">商业言论</div>\n                            <div class=\"flow-connector\">↓</div>\n                            <div class=\"flow-node\">广告</div>\n                            <div class=\"flow-connector\">↓</div>\n                            <div class=\"flow-branch-horizontal\">\n                                <div class=\"flow-branch\">\n                                    <div class=\"flow-node\">受保护</div>\n                                    <div class=\"flow-connector\">↓</div>\n                                    <div class=\"flow-node\">内容中立</div>\n                                    <div class=\"flow-connector\">↓</div>\n                                    <div class=\"flow-node\">中等审查<br>(不超必要)</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"flow-horizontal-line\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"flow-branch\">\n                                    <div class=\"flow-node active\">误导性或非法</div>\n                                    <div class=\"flow-connector\">↓</div>\n                                    <div class=\"flow-node active\">无第一修正案审查</div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flow-horizontal-line\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"flow-branch\">\n                            <div class=\"flow-node\">不受保护言论</div>\n                            <div class=\"flow-connector\">↓</div>\n                            <div class=\"flow-node\">FIDO<br>(虚假、非法、诽谤、淫秽)</div>\n                            <div class=\"flow-connector\">↓</div>\n                            <div class=\"flow-node\">无第一修正案审查</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <h2>陷阱警示</h2>\n            <div class=\"trap-alert\">\n                <p>考生常误以为所有商业言论都受到某种程度的宪法保护，或者认为政府对商业言论的规制总是需要满足中等审查。这是一个常见的陷阱！</p>\n                <p>请记住，**虚假、误导性或涉及非法活动的商业言论完全不受第一修正案保护**。在这种情况下，政府可以自由规制，无需证明其规制满足任何审查标准。只有真实且合法的商业言论才受到中等审查的保护。</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <h2>正确答案与干扰项排除</h2>\n            <div class=\"option-analysis\">\n                <div class=\"option correct\">\n                    <strong>C. 法律合宪，因为误导性广告不受宪法保护。</strong>\n                    <p><strong>正确。</strong>这是州政府可以提出的最佳论点。商业言论如果虚假、误导性或涉及非法活动，则完全不受第一修正案保护。本案中，牙医在未获ADA认证的情况下自称“认证牙科专家”是误导性言论，因此州政府可以合法地禁止此类广告，而无需满足任何审查标准。</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"option wrong\">\n                    <strong>A. 法律合宪，因为它促进了州保护消费者的实质性利益。</strong>\n                    <p><strong>错误。</strong>虽然保护消费者是实质性政府利益，但这一论点适用于**受保护的商业言论**，需要满足中等审查（即规制必须直接促进该利益且手段与目标紧密相连）。由于本案涉及的是误导性言论，它根本不受第一修正案保护，州政府无需证明其规制满足中等审查的要求。</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"option wrong\">\n                    <strong>B. 法律合宪，因为它满足严格审查。</strong>\n                    <p><strong>错误。</strong>严格审查（<span class=\"term\">Strict scrutiny</span>）适用于**内容相关的受保护言论**，且通常不适用于商业言论。商业言论通常适用中等审查，而误导性商业言论则完全不受保护。因此，严格审查不适用本案。</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"option wrong\">\n                    <strong>D. 法律合宪，因为第一修正案不保护商业言论。</strong>\n                    <p><strong>错误。</strong>第一修正案**确实保护**真实且不涉及非法活动的商业言论，但保护级别低于其他受保护言论（如政治言论）。只有虚假、误导性或非法的商业言论才不受保护。此选项的表述过于绝对，因此是错误的。</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <h2>考试技巧</h2>\n            <div class=\"footer-tip\">\n                <p>在MBE考试中遇到商业言论问题时，首先判断其是否**虚假、误导性或非法**。如果是，则直接判定其不受第一修正案保护，政府可自由规制。如果不是，则进一步判断其是否满足中等审查标准。</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
    },
